ace and to the centres of its round edges","Base Center":"Base Centre","Center X":"Centre X","Center Y":"Centre Y","Center of mass":"Centre of mass","Centre to centre":"Centre to centre","Circle center":"Circle centre","Colour":"Colour","Copy all licences":"Copy all licences","Customize Toolbar":"Customise Toolbar","Customize…":"Customise…","Face center":"Face centre","Favorites":"Favourites","Favourite":"Favourite","Mass Center":"Mass Centre","Modeled":"Modelled","Select the centre the pattern turns around first":"Select the centre the pattern turns around first","Snap to face and edge centres":"Snap to face and edge centres","Specialise":"Specialise","cmd.appearance_favorite":"Favourite Look","cmd.component_cycle_color":"Cycle Component Colour","cmd.construct_point_center":"Point At Centre Of Circle/Sphere/Torus","cmd.inspect_center_of_mass":"Centre of Mass","cmd.inspect_colored_components":"Enable Component Colours","cmd.inspect_colored_components_disable":"Disable Component Colours","cmd.parameters_favorite":"Favourite Parameter","cmd.render_aging_describe":"Layered Surface Aging","cmd.render_effects_describe":"Lens and Creative Effects","cmd.sketch.construction_line":"Construction Line","cmd.sketch.construction_line.angle":"Construction Line at Angle","cmd.sketch.construction_line.bisector":"Angle Bisector","cmd.sketch.construction_line.horizontal":"Horizontal Construction Line","cmd.sketch.construction_line.parallel":"Parallel Construction Line","cmd.sketch.construction_line.perpendicular":"Perpendicular Construction Line","cmd.sketch.construction_line.tangent_at":"Tangent at Curve Point","cmd.sketch.construction_line.tangent_external":"Tangent through External Point","cmd.sketch.construction_line.tangent_two":"Common Tangent","cmd.sketch.construction_line.vertical":"Vertical Construction Line","cmd.sketch_arc_center_point":"Centre Point Arc","cmd.sketch_circle_center":"Centre Diameter Circle","cmd.sketch_rectangle_center":"Centre Rectangle","cmd.sketch_slot_arc_center":"Centre Point Arc Slot","cmd.sketch_slot_center_point":"Centre Point Slot","cmd.sketch_slot_center_to_center":"Centre to Centre Slot","color.copy":"Click to copy colour values","color.edit":"Click to edit colour","color.gamma":"Showing colour values in 0-255 gamma space","color.linear":"Showing colour values in 0-1 linear space","color.recent":"Recent colours","color.recent_help":"Colours you pick in any colour field appear here","color.saturation":"Saturation (per cent)","color.selected":"Selected colour","color.step_down":"Step down","color.step_up":"Step up","color.value":"Value, the brightness (per cent)","dxf.cancelled":"DXF export cancelled","dxf.cancelling":"Cancelling DXF export","help.apache":"Apache licence 2.0","help.appearance.assign":"Gives the selected bodies, faces or components a colour or a material look, without changing their weight. Use it to tell parts apart or to preview a finish.","help.face.delete":"Removes the selected faces and lets the neighbouring faces close the gap, or leaves the gap open as a surface. Use it to take off a rounded edge, a hole or a boss that is in the way.","help.font_details":"The interface uses egui's built-in fonts (Ubuntu Light and Hack, under the Ubuntu Font Licence and the MIT/Bitstream Vera licence; Noto Emoji and the emoji icon font, under the OFL and MIT). Sketch text uses Liberation Sans (SIL OFL 1.1). The Crafting Apps' optional font pack, craft-fonts (BIZ UDPGothic, Shippori Mincho, BIZ UDMincho, Noto Sans CJK SC, Noto Sans Arabic; SIL OFL 1.1), is not bundled in SolidCraft builds.","help.licences":"Licences","help.material.assign":"Sets what the selected bodies are made of, such as steel, aluminium or ABS. Use it so that the mass and weight match the real part.","help.mit":"MIT licence","help.solid.draft":"Tilts the selected faces by the angle you set, measured from a neutral plane. Use it on moulded or cast parts so that they slide out of the mould.","help.solid.revolve":"Spins a sketch profile around an axis to make a round solid. Use it for shafts, knobs, bowls and any part that is round about a centre line.","help.solid.split_body":"Cuts a body into separate bodies with a plane, the face of another body or a sketch line. Use it to make parts that are printed, machined or coloured on their own.","help.solid.split_face":"Divides the selected faces along a plane, the face of another body or sketch curves, without cutting the body. Use it to give part of a face its own draft, colour or offset.","help.third_party":"Third-party licences","home.new_mm_hint":"Millimetres · opens in Design","navbar.custom.customise":"Customise navigation bar…","navbar.custom.position_centre":"Centre","navbar.description.separator":"A thin line that groups neighbouring slots.","pattern.alignment_hint":"Counts include the original. Centre balances copies; Flip chooses the extra side for even totals.","prefs.bottom_centre":"Bottom centre","prefs.logo_theme":"Theme's colours","prefs.max_file_size":"Largest file to open","prefs.max_file_size_design":"Design files","prefs.max_file_size_flag":"This run started with --max-file-size {size}, which applies until SolidCraft closes. These settings apply when it starts without it.","prefs.max_file_size_note":"Defaults: 512 MB and 256 MB; at most 16 GB. Opening a file takes several times its size in memory. A design that keeps a large import may need a higher design file limit to save and reopen.","prefs.max_file_size_step":"STEP and import files","prefs.max_file_size_web":"The web app opens STEP and import files up to 512 MB and designs up to 256 MB: a browser tab can't hold larger files. The desktop app can raise these limits.","prefs.megabytes":"MB","prefs.sketch_conflict_colour":"Conflicting geometry in the conflict colour","prefs.sketch_conflict_colour_note":"While a sketch's constraints conflict, the curves and points a failing constraint holds are drawn in the conflict colour too, not only its glyph or dimension. Off: they keep their usual colours.","prefs.sketch_construction_lines":"Extended construction line tools","prefs.sketch_recent_snap":"Auto snap to recent centres and midpoints","prefs.sketch_recent_snap_note":"While drawing, snap the cursor where the guides of the two most recent circle centres or straight-edge midpoints cross. Off: those guides stay visual and the cursor does not move.","prefs.sketch_state_icons":"Sketch icons in the colour of their state","prefs.sketch_state_icons_note":"In History and the browser, a sketch's icon takes the colour of its state (under constrained, fully constrained or conflicting) and its tooltip names the state. Off: every sketch has the same icon.","prefs.sketch_tracking_guides":"Centre and midpoint alignment guides","prefs.sketch_tracking_guides_note":"Hover over a circle centre or straight-edge midpoint, then move horizontally or vertically to show a temporary dotted guide.","prefs.status_bar_note":"A thin bar along the window's bottom edge shows what is being edited, the open sketch's state in its colour and the design's units; a click on the units changes them. The sketch's state then no longer shows in the view's corner.","prefs.structure.appearance_note":"Colours, text and accessibility.","prefs.structure.tools_note":"How modelling tools behave.","prefs.theme_follow":"Follow a theme file","prefs.theme_follow_error":"Not applied: {error}. The last good theme stays on.","prefs.theme_follow_launch":"Followed for this run only (--theme-file); reloaded whenever another tool rewrites it.","prefs.theme_follow_note":"Reloaded whenever another tool rewrites it. Choosing a theme stops following it.","prefs.theme_follow_off":"Off","prefs.theme_follow_stop":"Stop following","prefs.theme_option_opacity_help":"Adjust floating panel opacity. A readability floor protects text over viewport colours.","prefs.theme_option_tab_colours":"Tab colours","prefs.theme_option_tab_colours_help":"Use this theme’s panel and viewport colours for each ribbon tab.","prefs.theme_option_tab_fade_ms_help":"Fade panel and viewport colours when switching tabs. Zero switches instantly.","prefs.trackpad_zoom_modifier.help":"Hold only this key to zoom at the pointer with vertical scroll. Off keeps the existing scroll behaviour.","prefs.view":"View behaviour","prefs.viewport_background_colour":"Colour","render.aging_add":"Add aging layer","render.aging_airborne":"Airborne dust / participating medium","render.aging_airborne_help":"Airborne dust is a separate finite homogeneous scattering volume. It changes transport and raw EXR, not the surface-aging stack. Existing volume/glass/denoising restrictions remain explicit; no atmosphere is added automatically.","render.aging_all_bodies":"All eligible opaque bodies","render.aging_chips":"Chipped paint","render.aging_class_any":"All opaque material classes","render.aging_class_dielectric":"Nonmetallic surfaces only","render.aging_class_metal":"Metallic surfaces only","render.aging_color":"Layer colour · sRGB","render.aging_coverage":"Coverage","render.aging_dust":"Deposited dust","render.aging_empty":"No aging layers: the original surfaces remain unchanged.","render.aging_fading":"Faded coating","render.aging_grime":"Grime & staining","render.aging_help":"Combine up to eight optical layers, in order. Rust and patina are authored appearances, not age/corrosion simulations. Scale is in world millimetres. No geometry, mass or engineering property is changed; glass and passive stages are excluded.","render.aging_metallic":"Layer metallic fraction","render.aging_origin":"Field origin · world mm","render.aging_patina":"Copper-green patina","render.aging_refresh_targets":"Inspect current bodies","render.aging_roughness":"Layer roughness","render.aging_rust":"Oxidized iron / rust","render.aging_scale":"Pattern scale","render.aging_scratches":"Fine scratches","render.aging_target":"Target & coordinates","render.aging_target_help":"A named target must still match its captured index and name. Global masks are world-anchored; they do not follow moving parts. This is neither cavity detection nor true edge wear. Filter the list to reach additional bodies.","render.aging_target_search":"Filter body names","render.aging_upward":"Upward-facing deposition","render.appearance_editor.base_colour":"Base colour","render.backdrop_first":"Start / centre colour","render.backdrop_second":"End / edge colour","render.backdrop_x":"Centre X","render.backdrop_y":"Centre Y","render.background_camera_section":"Camera background · PNG presentation","render.background_completed_frozen":"The displayed result is a frozen completed image. Editing a background does not repaint that result automatically. Use Regrade for camera-only changes, or Render for a new physical stage.","render.background_hdr_separate":"The current HDR resources illuminate and reflect on surfaces; they are not automatically displayed as a panorama behind the subject. Changing a gradient does not rotate or recolour the lighting.","render.background_lighting_section":"HDR illumination · separate from camera background","render.background_no_alpha_override":"A camera background is not added to transparent output silently. Raw-master regrading uses captured coverage and does not reapply denoising; the source EXR remains unchanged.","render.background_not_light":"Background colour is presentation, not an additional lighting source.","render.background_regrade":"Apply to retained raw master","render.background_stage_occlusion":"This shot includes physical stage geometry. A large floor or wall can fill the frame and hide a camera-only background. Clear or resize the stage deliberately, or change its physical reflectance. Regrading cannot remove captured geometry.","render.background_workflow":"Choose the background you intend: a camera-only colour/gradient, a physical stage that receives light, or HDR illumination. They are independent. Live Preview is a modelling view; render a new image or regrade a retained master to see camera finishing.","render.base_color":"Base colour · sRGB","render.bloom_help":"Creative output-only glow from positive linear highlights, spread with three normalised box passes. Radius is in output pixels. Added in linear display light before sRGB; not a lens, volumetric effect or convergence improvement. The raw EXR is unchanged.","render.chromatic_offset":"Chromatic edge offset","render.cpu_area_editor_help":"Full side vectors in millimeters; U cross V points towards the emitting side. This differs from GPU half-edge vectors.","render.cpu_light_help":"Up to eight directional lights. An empty custom list turns them off; selecting a preset restores its lights. Colours are linear RGB and intensity is relative, not watts.","render.cpu_linear_color":"Linear colour (R, G, B)","render.effects_gpu_only":"These effects require GPU path tracing. Changing the page never switches the renderer automatically.","render.effects_help":"Combine ordered colour looks and image-space lens effects. Rendering and raw-master regrading use the same saved settings. Raw EXR stays unchanged. These are original artistic controls, not calibrated lens or branded-film emulations.","render.effects_reset_lens":"Reset lens effects","render.effects_seed":"Pattern seed","render.env_colour":"Colour","render.environment.radial_only":"Centre and radius apply to Radial mode.","render.error_finish_gesture":"finish the modelling gesture before previewing","render.error_finish_operation":"finish the current modelling operation before entering Render","render.film_grain":"Photographic grain","render.flare_ghosts":"Ghost rings per source","render.flare_halo":"Flare halo","render.flare_streak":"Anamorphic-style streak","render.flare_strength":"Highlight flare strength","render.flare_threshold":"Scene-linear flare threshold","render.frame_centre_mark":"Centre mark","render.hdr_primaries_declared":"The source declares its colour primaries.","render.hdr_primaries_srgb":"Colour primaries: sRGB/D65","render.hdr_primaries_undeclared":"The source does not declare primaries; review the renderer colour requirements.","render.image_cancelled":"Render cancelled","render.image_cancelling":"Cancelling","render.image_scene_stale":"Finish the modelling gesture or refresh the scene before checking or starting an image.","render.inspector_colour":"Colour","render.layer_down":"Move down","render.layer_enabled":"Layer enabled","render.layer_remove":"Remove layer","render.layer_strength":"Layer strength","render.layer_up":"Move up","render.lens_effects_help":"Flare uses up to four separated bright sources in the actual linear image. Ghosts, halo, streaks, chromatic offsets and radial distortion are artistic image-space approximations. Spatial effects need opaque output; outside samples extend the image edge. Grain is deterministic. No physics, EXR or geometry is altered.","render.lens_effects_title":"Lens-inspired & photographic","render.library_center":"Rig centre","render.library_favorite":"Add favourite","render.library_favorites":"Favourites","render.library_inspect_only":"Select to inspect; nothing is applied automatically. Favourites and recent history belong to this open document session.","render.library_rig_help":"Fit once at an explicit centre and physical extent. Complete rigs include passive cards; calibration blockers still refuse. Conservative emitter/card clearance is checked before saving.","render.library_source_preview_help":"Authored base-colour source map. This is not a rendered or measured material preview.","render.library_unfavorite":"Remove favourite","render.light_behaviour":"BEHAVIOUR","render.light_preview_help":"Live view is unshadowed; Area lights use a centre-sample approximation. Render uses the complete light model.","render.light_product_centre":"Product centre","render.light_temperature":"Colour temperature","render.lighting_colour":"Colour","render.look_add":"Add colour look","render.look_bleach":"Bleach-bypass-inspired","render.look_cool":"Cool","render.look_cyanotype":"Cyanotype-inspired","render.look_faded":"Faded print","render.look_mono":"Monochrome","render.look_sepia":"Sepia","render.look_strength":"Look strength","render.look_teal_orange":"Teal / orange","render.look_title":"Creative look stack","render.look_warm":"Warm","render.material_color_map":"Base colour image (sRGB)","render.material_color_replace":"Base map replaces body colour","render.material_map_required":"Choose a colour image or a normal image before using maps.","render.material_maps":"Planar colour and normal maps","render.material_maps_help":"PNG/JPEG up to 1024×1024; 16 MiB encoded total. U and V are orthogonal world-mm repeat vectors (maximum 128 repeats). Colour is sRGB; normal data uses OpenGL +Y. Files are captured at Check/Start.","render.opaque_preview_help":"Opaque PBR and simple colours; blended transparency. Refraction, HDRI and final rendering are not available yet.","render.page_aging":"Aging & contamination","render.page_background":"Backgrounds","render.page_effects":"Lens & finishing effects","render.radial_distortion":"Radial distortion","render.ribbon_aging":"Aging","render.ribbon_effects":"Effects","render.ribbon_studios_help":"Browse implemented studio compositions and review their replacements before applying. Concept-only scenes remain labelled.","render.sharpening":"Detail sharpening","render.soft_focus":"Soft focus","render.stage_panels.centre":"Centre","render.stage_panels.source_note":"Authored base-colour source map. Not a measured material.","render.studio_area_help":"Up to four one-sided rectangles. Orthogonal half-edges U and V define size; U × V faces the lit side. Coordinates are world-space millimetres.","render.studio_center":"Centre X, Y, Z (mm)","render.studio_hdr_help":"Radiance .hdr, 2:1 panorama, up to 2048 × 1024. EXR is unavailable. The colour assumption applies only when primaries are unspecified.","sketch_text.align_center":"Centre","ui.3d_mouse_kind_cap":"Return to Centre","ui.3d_mouse_looks_like_cap":"The reading stays put while you hold it, the way a Return to Centre device does.","ui.3d_mouse_orbit_tip":"Traced: the 3D mouse turns the view around the part of the model in the middle of the view when the turn begins, marked by a faint ball. Classic: around the view's centre","ui.3d_mouse_step_pull":"Pull the cap towards you, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_switch_cap":"Calibrate as Return to Centre","ui.agent_chat_minimize":"Minimise to a strip","ui.ai_mode_edits_note":"Modelling commands run without asking; saving, opening, exporting and other file or destructive actions still ask.","ui.center":"Centre","ui.center_arc_follows_cursor":"Centre point arc follows the cursor's direction","ui.center_arc_follows_cursor_tip":"A centre point arc runs clockwise or counter-clockwise the way the cursor goes round its centre. Off: always counter-clockwise from the start.","ui.centerline":"Centreline","ui.colour_vision":"Colour vision","ui.colour_vision_note":"Changes the colours that carry a meaning: sketch states, axes, bends, analyses and icons. If you use Windows colour filters, keep this Off.","ui.colour_vision_off_tip":"The theme's own colours","ui.construction.ribbon_label":"X-Lines","ui.customizeToolbar":"Customise Toolbar…","ui.default_modelling_orientation":"Default modelling orientation","ui.design_properties.license":"Licence","ui.design_properties.organization":"Organisation","ui.details_curvature_caption":"Faces are coloured by their local radius of curvature.","ui.details_draft_caption":"Faces are coloured by their angle to the pull direction.","ui.export_keymap_tip":"Keys, S box favourites and the toolbar, as a file","ui.layout_compact":"Compact","ui.layout_floating":"Floating","ui.material_review.claims":"Sources and licences are unverified claims. Missing values remain unknown.","ui.point_cloud_color_by":"Colour By","ui.point_cloud_file_colors":"File Colours","ui.point_cloud_no_file_colors":"The file has no colours","ui.point_cloud_single_color":"Single Colour","ui.properties.inertia_note":"About the centre of mass, in world axes (g·{unit}²)","ui.ribbon_labels":"Show text under ribbon icons","ui.view_centre":"View centre","ui.workspace_layout":"Workspace layout","ui.zoom_to_cursor_tip":"The wheel zooms towards the point under the cursor (off: towards the view's centre)","update.prefs_flatpak":"Flatpak updates this copy ({version}): run {command} or use your software centre. SolidCraft doesn't check."}Bahasa Indonesia{"(active rule)":"(aturan aktif)","0 turns it off":"0 menonaktifkannya","1. Open GitHub draft below, then paste the report copied to your clipboard.":"1. Buka draf GitHub di bawah, lalu tempel laporan yang disalin ke papan klip Anda.","1. Open GitHub draft below. Your title and report will be filled in.":"1. Buka draf GitHub di bawah. Judul dan laporan Anda akan terisi otomatis.","2. Attach your screenshot: copy and paste it, or save and upload the PNG.":"2. Lampirkan tangkapan layar: salin dan tempel, atau simpan dan unggah PNG-nya.","2D":"2D","3. Click Submit new issue on GitHub to send your report.":"3. Klik Submit new issue di GitHub untuk mengirim laporan Anda.","A Single hole snaps to the middle of its face and to the centres of its round edges":"Lubang Tunggal menempel ke tengah mukanya dan ke pusat tepi bulatnya","A new configuration, a copy of the active one":"Konfigurasi baru, salinan dari yang aktif","A placed Single hole has a handle to drag it, and picking its face again moves the hole there instead of taking it out":"Lubang Tunggal yang ditempatkan punya handle untuk menyeretnya, dan memilih mukanya lagi memindahkan lubang ke sana alih-alih menghapusnya","A short title for the problem (optional)":"Judul singkat untuk masalahnya (opsional)","ARRANGE":"SUSUN","About SolidCraft":"Tentang SolidCraft","Acceleration":"Percepatan","Access":"Akses","Actions":"Aksi","Active":"Aktif","Active rule":"Aturan aktif","Add":"Tambah","Add Column":"Tambah Kolom","Add Key":"Tambah Kunci","Add Mid Radius":"Tambah Radius Tengah","Add Row":"Tambah Baris","Add a tool":"Tambah alat","Add all bodies":"Tambah semua bodi","Add bend":"Tambah tekukan","Add condition":"Tambah kondisi","Add or edit rule":"Tambah atau edit aturan","Add to New Folder":"Tambah ke Folder Baru","Add visible bodies":"Tambah bodi yang terlihat","Advanced":"Lanjutan","Against":"Terhadap","Alignment":"Perataan","All Lines":"Semua Garis","All Sketch Points":"Semua Titik Sketsa","All components":"Semua komponen","All open designs":"Semua desain yang terbuka","Allowed expressions, separated by semicolons":"Ekspresi yang diizinkan, dipisahkan titik koma","Also deletes":"Juga menghapus","Also place them from the origin (fully constrained)":"Tempatkan juga dari titik asal (terkunci penuh)","Anchor":"Jangkar","Angle 2":"Sudut 2","Angle Display":"Tampilan Sudut","Animate":"Animasikan","Another bend on the far edge of the last flange":"Tekukan lain di tepi terjauh flens terakhir","App/system information and command settings are included. Review private details before sharing.":"Informasi aplikasi/sistem dan pengaturan perintah disertakan. Tinjau detail pribadi sebelum dibagikan.","Appearance name":"Nama tampilan","Applied Radius":"Radius Terapan","Apply To":"Terapkan Ke","Apply library appearance":"Terapkan tampilan pustaka","Apply to selection":"Terapkan ke pilihan","Apply your appearance first. Exports assigned appearances and materials created in this design.":"Terapkan tampilan Anda terlebih dahulu. Mengekspor tampilan yang ditetapkan dan material yang dibuat di desain ini.","Arc length":"Panjang busur","Area":"Luas","As Picked":"Sesuai Pilihan","As-Built":"As-Built","Assign Rule":"Tetapkan Aturan","Attachment":"Lampiran","BLEND SURFACE":"PERMUKAAN BLEND","BOUNDARY SURFACE":"PERMUKAAN BATAS","BROWSER":"PENJELAJAH","Back to the original order":"Kembali ke urutan asli","Ball":"Bola","Bar":"Batang","Base Center":"Pusat Dasar","Base Height":"Tinggi Dasar","Bend":"Tekukan","Bend Edges":"Tepi Tekukan","Bend Line":"Garis Tekukan","Bend Line Position":"Posisi Garis Tekuk","Bend Position":"Posisi Tekukan","Bend Radius":"Radius Tekukan","Bend Table":"Tabel Tekukan","Bends":"Tekukan","Bodies":"Bodi","Bodies (optional)":"Bodi (opsional)","Body":"Bodi","Body (last if none)":"Bodi (terakhir jika kosong)","Body to split":"Bodi yang dibelah","Body, or faces to take out":"Bodi, atau muka yang dikeluarkan","Both":"Keduanya","Bottom Left":"Kiri Bawah","Bottom Middle":"Tengah Bawah","Bottom Right":"Kanan Bawah","Boundary":"Batas","Bounding box":"Kotak pembatas","CHECK":"PERIKSA","COMPONENTS":"KOMPONEN","CONFIGURATIONS":"KONFIGURASI","CONSTRAIN":"BATASAN","CONTACT":"KONTAK","CONVERT":"KONVERSI","CSV or JSON: updates existing parameters, adds new ones":"CSV atau JSON: memperbarui parameter yang ada, menambah yang baru","Capture All Positions":"Tangkap Semua Posisi","Capture Pos.":"Tangkap Pos.","Catch Depth":"Kedalaman Tangkap","Catch Direction":"Arah Tangkap","Catch Length":"Panjang Tangkap","Cells":"Sel","Center X":"Pusat X","Center Y":"Pusat Y","Center of mass":"Pusat massa","Centre to centre":"Pusat ke pusat","Centroid":"Sentroid","Chamfer Type":"Tipe Chamfer","Channel":"Kanal","Check collisions":"Periksa tabrakan","Checked":"Dicentang","Choose Variable radius or Spline in Type.":"Pilih Radius variabel atau Spline pada Tipe.","Choose a new plane. Sketch geometry and dimensions stay unchanged in its two-dimensional coordinates.":"Pilih bidang baru. Geometri dan dimensi sketsa tidak berubah dalam koordinat dua dimensinya.","Choose…":"Pilih…","Circle center":"Pusat lingkaran","Circle or sphere":"Lingkaran atau bola","Circular":"Melingkar","Circumference":"Keliling","Clockwise":"Searah jarum jam","Close draft":"Tutup draf","Collapse":"Ciutkan","Collisions":"Tabrakan","Colour":"Warna","Command":"Perintah","Comment":"Komentar","Component 1":"Komponen 1","Component 2":"Komponen 2","Component1":"Komponen1","Components":"Komponen","Config Table":"Tabel Konfigurasi","Configuration":"Konfigurasi","Configuration rules":"Aturan konfigurasi","Constant radius":"Radius konstan","Contact":"Kontak","Contact Sets":"Set Kontak","Contact sets":"Set kontak","Continue on GitHub":"Lanjutkan di GitHub","Continuity":"Kontinuitas","Control Radius":"Radius Kontrol","Copies the definition only. Assign it from Physical Material when ready.":"Hanya menyalin definisinya. Tetapkan dari Material Fisik bila sudah siap.","Copy Error Message":"Salin Pesan Error","Copy Warning Message":"Salin Pesan Peringatan","Copy all licences":"Salin semua lisensi","Copy diagnostic information":"Salin informasi diagnostik","Copy report":"Salin laporan","Copy screenshot":"Salin tangkapan layar","Corner Relief":"Relief Sudut","Corner Relief Shape":"Bentuk Relief Sudut","Corner radius":"Radius sudut","Counterbore depth":"Kedalaman counterbore","Counterbore Ø":"Counterbore Ø","Countersink angle":"Sudut countersink","Countersink Ø":"Countersink Ø","Create Hole":"Buat Lubang","Create Issue — review draft":"Buat Issue — tinjau draf","Create Issue…":"Buat Issue…","Cross curves":"Kurva silang","Ctrl+Enter continues on GitHub.":"Ctrl+Enter melanjutkan di GitHub.","Cube":"Kubus","Current orthographic view (1:1 mm)":"Tampilan ortografis saat ini (1:1 mm)","Current perspective view":"Tampilan perspektif saat ini","Current plane":"Bidang saat ini","Curv. Comb":"Sisir Lengk.","Curvature (G2)":"Kelengkungan (G2)","Curvature change (G3)":"Perubahan kelengkungan (G3)","Custom":"Kustom","Customize Toolbar":"Kustomisasi Toolbar","Customize…":"Kustomisasi…","Cylindrical":"Silindris","Cylindrical face":"Muka silindris","Deboss":"Deboss","Delete":"Hapus","Delete Folders and Features…":"Hapus Folder dan Fitur…","Delete Selected Features…":"Hapus Fitur Terpilih…","Delete Selected Folders":"Hapus Folder Terpilih","Delete all":"Hapus semua","Delete rule":"Hapus aturan","Delete the row":"Hapus baris","Delete the set":"Hapus set","Density":"Massa jenis","Dependents":"Dependen","Describe the problem you saw":"Jelaskan masalah yang Anda lihat","Describe what happened before continuing.":"Jelaskan apa yang terjadi sebelum melanjutkan.","Designs you open or save appear here.":"Desain yang Anda buka atau simpan muncul di sini.","Determined by To Object. Choose Angle to edit the angular extent.":"Ditentukan oleh To Object. Pilih Angle untuk mengedit rentang sudut.","Diameter":"Diameter","Did this assembly open the wrong way up?":"Apakah rakitan ini terbuka dengan orientasi yang salah?","Did this part open the wrong way up?":"Apakah part ini terbuka dengan orientasi yang salah?","Dimension new shapes":"Beri dimensi bentuk baru","Direction":"Arah","Discard":"Buang","Distance":"Jarak","Distance 1":"Jarak 1","Do not export hidden edges":"Jangan ekspor tepi tersembunyi","Don't ask again":"Jangan tanya lagi","Double-click to rename":"Klik dua kali untuk mengganti nama","Double-clicking the middle button in the view: Home (the home view, framing what is shown), Fit (frame what is shown, keeping the orientation) or nothing":"Klik dua kali tombol tengah di tampilan: Home (tampilan awal, membingkai yang ditampilkan), Fit (membingkai yang ditampilkan, orientasi tetap) atau tidak ada","Drag to move the boss across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"Seret untuk memindahkan boss di sepanjang model. Boss menempel ke titik sketsa pada muka.","Drag to move the hole; click to remove it":"Seret untuk memindahkan lubang; klik untuk menghapusnya","Drag to move the rest across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"Seret untuk memindahkan rest di sepanjang model. Rest menempel ke titik sketsa pada muka.","Drag to move the snap fit across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"Seret untuk memindahkan snap fit di sepanjang model. Snap fit menempel ke titik sketsa pada muka.","Drag to point the catch in another direction.":"Seret untuk mengarahkan bagian tangkap ke arah lain.","Drag to turn the rest in 5° steps. Hold Alt or Ctrl to turn it freely.":"Seret untuk memutar rest dengan langkah 5°. Tahan Alt atau Ctrl untuk memutarnya bebas.","Drive Joint":"Gerakkan Sambungan","Duration":"Durasi","Each new shape is also dimensioned from the sketch origin until nothing of it is left free. A shape already attached to the origin or to placed geometry gets none.":"Setiap bentuk baru juga diberi dimensi dari titik asal sketsa hingga tidak ada yang bebas. Bentuk yang sudah terhubung ke titik asal atau geometri yang ditempatkan tidak mendapat apa pun.","Each shape you draw gets all its dimensions, at the sizes you drew (typed values win). A size the sketch already sets is left out.":"Setiap bentuk yang Anda gambar mendapat semua dimensinya sesuai ukuran yang digambar (nilai yang diketik diutamakan). Ukuran yang sudah ditetapkan sketsa dilewati.","Edge":"Tepi","Edges":"Tepi","Edit":"Edit","Edit Profile Sketch":"Edit Sketsa Profil","Edit shortcuts":"Edit pintasan","Enable rule":"Aktifkan aturan","Enabled":"Aktif","End Radius":"Radius Akhir","End bulge":"Bulge akhir","End continuity":"Kontinuitas akhir","Equal Distance":"Jarak Sama","Expand":"Perluas","Expected result (optional)":"Hasil yang diharapkan (opsional)","Explode":"Urai","Explode Text":"Teks Urai","Export Animation…":"Ekspor Animasi…","Export Bend Table…":"Ekspor Tabel Tekukan…","Export CSV…":"Ekspor CSV…","Export Current View as DXF":"Ekspor Tampilan Saat Ini sebagai DXF","Export Current View as DXF…":"Ekspor Tampilan Saat Ini sebagai DXF…","Export DXF":"Ekspor DXF","Export DXF…":"Ekspor DXF…","Export JSON…":"Ekspor JSON…","Export design library...":"Ekspor pustaka desain...","Export hidden edges as dashed lines":"Ekspor tepi tersembunyi sebagai garis putus-putus","Exported by SolidWorks, which usually saves Y up":"Diekspor oleh SolidWorks, yang biasanya menyimpan dengan Y ke atas","Expression":"Ekspresi","Extend to meet":"Perpanjang hingga bertemu","Extents":"Ekstensi","FILES":"FILE","FLAT":"DATAR","Face":"Muka","Face Appearance":"Tampilan Muka","Face attachment lost":"Lampiran muka hilang","Face center":"Pusat muka","Faces":"Muka","Faces / edges / vertices":"Muka / tepi / titik sudut","Faces to split":"Muka yang dibelah","Faces/Body":"Muka/Bodi","Factor must be a positive number":"Faktor harus berupa bilangan positif","Fastener":"Pengencang","Favorites":"Favorit","Favourite":"Favorit","Feature":"Fitur","Files from many CAD programs have Y up, so they open lying on their back here (Z up).":"File dari banyak program CAD memakai Y ke atas, sehingga terbuka dalam posisi telentang di sini (Z ke atas).","Filter":"Filter","Filter…":"Filter…","Find in Browser":"Cari di Penjelajah","Finish":"Hasil Akhir","First edge":"Tepi pertama","First plane":"Bidang pertama","First point":"Titik pertama","Fit and G2 corners require Constant radius.":"Fit dan sudut G2 memerlukan Radius konstan.","Fixed Face":"Muka Tetap","Flange Gap":"Celah Flens","Flange thickness":"Tebal flens","Flanges":"Flens","Flat Pattern":"Pola Datar","Flat size":"Ukuran datar","Flat size X":"Ukuran datar X","Flat size Y":"Ukuran datar Y","Follow camera (Look At sketches)":"Ikuti kamera (sketsa Look At)","Follow the camera (Look At sketches)":"Ikuti kamera (sketsa Look At)","Font":"Font","Free Move":"Pemindahan Bebas","From":"Dari","From Bodies":"Dari Bodi","From Snap":"Dari Snap","From edges":"Dari tepi","Full Length":"Panjang Penuh","Full thread depth":"Kedalaman ulir penuh","Further Bends":"Tekukan Lanjutan","G2 corners require a constant radius and Exact fit. G2 corner construction is not supported yet.":"Sudut G2 memerlukan radius konstan dan Exact fit. Konstruksi sudut G2 belum didukung.","Gap":"Celah","Grid":"Grid","HISTORY":"RIWAYAT","Halo under sketch curves":"Halo di bawah kurva sketsa","Height":"Tinggi","Height From":"Tinggi Dari","Hem Gap":"Celah Hem","Hidden edges":"Tepi tersembunyi","History layout":"Tata letak riwayat","History names":"Nama riwayat","Hole (optional)":"Lubang (opsional)","Hole Depth":"Kedalaman Lubang","Hole Diameter":"Diameter Lubang","Holes":"Lubang","Holes (edges on them)":"Lubang (tepi di atasnya)","Home view":"Tampilan awal","Horiz./Vert.":"Horiz./Vert.","I-Beam":"Balok I","IMAGES":"GAMBAR","If you are offline or GitHub does not open, use Copy report and keep the text to submit later.":"Jika Anda offline atau GitHub tidak terbuka, gunakan Salin laporan dan simpan teksnya untuk dikirim nanti.","Import material into design":"Impor material ke desain","Import…":"Impor…","In This Design":"Di Desain Ini","In place (surfaces)":"Di tempat (permukaan)","In plane":"Pada bidang","Included":"Disertakan","Inner Sharp":"Tajam Dalam","Inside":"Dalam","Instant":"Instan","Interface font":"Font antarmuka","Interferes":"Berinterferensi","Invert":"Inversi","Isocurve":"Isocurve","Issue title":"Judul issue","Items":"Item","JOINTS":"SAMBUNGAN","Joint 1":"Sambungan 1","Joint 2":"Sambungan 2","Joint Origin1":"Origin Sambungan1","K Factor":"Faktor K","Keep (points on it)":"Pertahankan (titik di atasnya)","Keep Tools":"Pertahankan Alat","Keep of the other surface":"Pertahankan dari permukaan lain","Key a joint's value at this step":"Beri kunci pada nilai sambungan di langkah ini","Keys":"Kunci","Knife Edge":"Tepi Pisau","L-Angle":"Siku L","LIBRARY":"PUSTAKA","LINKS":"TAUTAN","Later":"Nanti","Leave it":"Biarkan","Left Middle":"Tengah Kiri","Legacy face attachment. Rebinding to a certified face creates an exact attachment.":"Lampiran muka lama. Mengikat ulang ke muka tersertifikasi akan membuat lampiran yang tepat.","Length":"Panjang","Length units":"Satuan panjang","Letter Spacing":"Spasi Huruf","Library":"Pustaka","Library file":"File pustaka","Library response is missing":"Respons pustaka tidak ada","Limits":"Limit","Line Spacing":"Spasi Baris","Line Type":"Tipe Garis","Line on plane":"Garis pada bidang","Lines":"Garis","Listing the installed fonts…":"Mencari font terpasang…","Load library":"Muat pustaka","Local library":"Pustaka lokal","Loop":"Loop","M5 or M5x0.5":"M5 atau M5x0.5","M5, M5x0.5, 1/4-20 UNC":"M5, M5x0.5, 1/4-20 UNC","MANAGE":"KELOLA","MATERIALS":"MATERIAL","MODEL":"MODEL","MOTION":"GERAKAN","Margin":"Margin","Mass":"Massa","Mass Center":"Pusat Massa","Matched restrictions check the final values.":"Pembatasan yang cocok memeriksa nilai akhir.","Material":"Material","Material Outside":"Material Luar","Material copied. Existing body assignments are unchanged.":"Material disalin. Penetapan bodi yang ada tidak berubah.","Max":"Maks","Max Thickness":"Ketebalan Maks","Maximum":"Maksimum","Mesh body":"Bodi mesh","Mid Radius":"Radius Tengah","Middle double-click":"Klik dua kali tombol tengah","Min":"Min","Min Draft":"Draft Min","Min Thickness":"Ketebalan Min","Minimum":"Minimum","Mirror Plane":"Bidang Cermin","Mitre":"Miter","Model Parameters":"Parameter Model","Modeled":"Dimodelkan","More toolbar panels":"Panel toolbar lainnya","Motion":"Gerakan","Mouse gestures":"Gestur mouse","Mouse gestures only work with the SolidWorks mouse mode (the wheel orbits, Ctrl + wheel pans).":"Gestur mouse hanya berfungsi dengan mode mouse SolidWorks (roda mengorbit, Ctrl + roda menggeser).","Move / Copy":"Pindah / Salin","Move Type":"Tipe Pemindahan","Move down":"Pindah ke bawah","Move earlier":"Pindah lebih awal","Move holes by clicking or dragging":"Pindahkan lubang dengan klik atau seret","Move later":"Pindah lebih akhir","Move up":"Pindah ke atas","Name":"Nama","Name on import":"Nama saat impor","Nearest":"Terdekat","Neutral plane":"Bidang netral","New":"Baru","New Comp.":"Komp. Baru","New Sketch":"Sketsa Baru","New rule…":"Aturan baru…","New study":"Studi baru","No crash reports.":"Tidak ada laporan crash.","No matching appearance presets.":"Tidak ada preset tampilan yang cocok.","No matching appearances":"Tidak ada tampilan yang cocok","No matching physical materials.":"Tidak ada material fisik yang cocok.","No visible bodies or sketches to export.":"Tidak ada bodi atau sketsa terlihat untuk diekspor.","Nominal Radius":"Radius Nominal","Nominal diameter":"Diameter nominal","None":"Tidak ada","Not available yet":"Belum tersedia","Not saved yet":"Belum disimpan","Notch":"Takik","OUTPUT":"KELUARAN","Of":"Dari","On your computer":"Di komputer Anda","Opacity":"Opasitas","Open GitHub":"Buka GitHub","Open GitHub draft":"Buka draf GitHub","Open GitHub issue form":"Buka formulir issue GitHub","Open bodies (no volume)":"Bodi terbuka (tanpa volume)","Open library...":"Buka pustaka...","Open local libraries in the desktop app. You can export this design's library here.":"Buka pustaka lokal di aplikasi desktop. Anda dapat mengekspor pustaka desain ini di sini.","Open surface — no volume":"Permukaan terbuka — tanpa volume","Open-source parametric 3D CAD in Rust. Licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0.":"CAD 3D parametrik sumber terbuka dalam Rust. Berlisensi MIT OR Apache-2.0.","Opens your browser and copies the report text for you to paste into GitHub.":"Membuka browser Anda dan menyalin teks laporan untuk Anda tempel ke GitHub.","Opens your browser and copies the report text. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"Membuka browser Anda dan menyalin teks laporan. Tinjau dan kirim laporan Anda di GitHub.","Opens your browser. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"Membuka browser Anda. Tinjau dan kirim laporan Anda di GitHub.","Operator":"Operator","Orbit (right drag)":"Orbit (seret kanan)","Other side":"Sisi lain","Other surface (mutual trim)":"Permukaan lain (trim timbal balik)","Other way":"Arah lain","Outer Sharp":"Tajam Luar","Outer radius":"Radius luar","Outside":"Luar","Overall length":"Panjang keseluruhan","Param. Graph":"Graf Param.","Parameter":"Parameter","Part length must be greater than zero and at most 2000 mm":"Panjang part harus lebih besar dari nol dan paling besar 2000 mm","Parts":"Part","Pass through":"Lewatkan","Path":"Jalur","Pattern":"Pola","Per Edge":"Per Tepi","Physical material definitions":"Definisi material fisik","Pick a part size":"Pilih ukuran part","Pick the tool bodies":"Pilih bodi alat","Picked":"Terpilih","Picked point":"Titik terpilih","Pin-slot":"Pin-slot","Pitch":"Pitch","Pivot":"Pivot","Place at the origin instead":"Tempatkan di origin saja","Planar":"Planar","Plastic Rules":"Aturan Plastik","Play the joint's motion in the view":"Putar gerakan sambungan di tampilan","Playback":"Putar","Plot":"Plot","Point on line":"Titik pada garis","Point on plane":"Titik pada bidang","Position":"Posisi","Position (0 to 1)":"Posisi (0 sampai 1)","Position (G0)":"Posisi (G0)","Position along the edge, 0 at the start end, 1 at the other":"Posisi sepanjang tepi, 0 di ujung awal, 1 di ujung lainnya","Preferences › Design turns the offer back on":"Preferensi › Desain mengaktifkan kembali tawaran ini","Preview":"Pratinjau","Preview Row":"Pratinjau Baris","Preview leaves the current design unchanged.":"Pratinjau tidak mengubah desain saat ini.","Profile / Edges":"Profil / Tepi","Profiles or curves":"Profil atau kurva","Profiles/Curves":"Profil/Kurva","Quantity":"Jumlah","Quantity must be at least 2":"Jumlah minimal 2","RECENT":"TERBARU","REFERENCE":"REFERENSI","RULED SURFACE":"PERMUKAAN RULED","RULES":"ATURAN","Radius":"Radius","Radius Fit":"Fit Radius","Ratio":"Rasio","Read-only list: shortcuts can't be changed here.":"Daftar hanya-baca: pintasan tidak dapat diubah di sini.","Reattach selected face":"Pasang ulang muka terpilih","Recover":"Pulihkan","Recover unsaved design?":"Pulihkan desain yang belum disimpan?","Rectangular":"Persegi panjang","Rectangular Tube":"Pipa Persegi Panjang","Reference face":"Muka referensi","Relief Depth":"Kedalaman Relief","Relief Width":"Lebar Relief","Remove Tools":"Hapus Alat","Remove condition":"Hapus kondisi","Remove from Folder":"Hapus dari Folder","Remove from list":"Hapus dari daftar","Remove override":"Hapus override","Remove private design details or paths before sharing.":"Hapus detail atau jalur desain pribadi sebelum membagikan.","Remove screenshot":"Hapus tangkapan layar","Remove the column":"Hapus kolom","Remove the track":"Hapus track","Remove this bend":"Hapus tekukan ini","Remove this point":"Hapus titik ini","Rename Feature":"Ganti Nama Fitur","Rename Folder":"Ganti Nama Folder","Render Stage":"Tahap Render","Reopen designs":"Buka kembali desain","Reopen the designs that were open when SolidCraft was last closed":"Buka kembali desain yang terbuka saat SolidCraft terakhir ditutup","Replace existing library file":"Ganti file pustaka yang ada","Report a bug — review a screenshot and open a GitHub draft":"Laporkan bug — tinjau tangkapan layar dan buka draf GitHub","Report copied. Keep this text to submit on GitHub when you are online.":"Laporan disalin. Simpan teks ini untuk dikirim ke GitHub saat Anda online.","Report text copied. Paste it into GitHub and submit your report there.":"Teks laporan disalin. Tempel ke GitHub dan kirim laporan Anda di sana.","Reports are public. A GitHub account is required.":"Laporan bersifat publik. Akun GitHub diperlukan.","Reset Toolbar":"Reset Toolbar","Resize Part":"Ubah Ukuran Part","Restore View":"Pulihkan Tampilan","Restore outer boundary":"Pulihkan batas luar","Restore the inherited component or physical material appearance":"Pulihkan tampilan komponen atau material fisik yang diwarisi","Restore this studio's tools":"Pulihkan alat studio ini","Result":"Hasil","Retake screenshot":"Ambil ulang tangkapan layar","Reveal Height":"Tinggi Terlihat","Reverse":"Balik","Reverse Direction":"Balik Arah","Revert":"Kembalikan","Revert All Positions":"Kembalikan Semua Posisi","Revert Pos.":"Kembalikan Pos.","Revert Position":"Kembalikan Posisi","Review the report and screenshot before opening GitHub.":"Tinjau laporan dan tangkapan layar sebelum membuka GitHub.","Review your report on GitHub and click Submit new issue to publish it.":"Tinjau laporan Anda di GitHub lalu klik Submit new issue untuk menerbitkannya.","Revolute":"Putar","Rib Length":"Panjang Rib","Rib Offset":"Offset Rib","Rib Thickness":"Tebal Rib","Ribs":"Rib","Right Middle":"Tengah Kanan","Rigid":"Kaku","Rim Edge":"Tepi Rim","Rim face":"Muka rim","Ring of tools on the right button":"Cincin alat pada tombol kanan","Roll Back Here":"Mundurkan ke Sini","Roll History Marker Here":"Pindahkan Penanda Riwayat ke Sini","Root radius":"Radius akar","Round":"Bulat","Round Bar":"Batang Bulat","Round Tube":"Pipa Bulat","Rule":"Aturan","Rule name":"Nama aturan","Rules run from top to bottom. Matched drives change effective values.":"Aturan dijalankan dari atas ke bawah. Drive yang cocok mengubah nilai efektif.","SECTION":"PENAMPANG","SURFACE QUALITY":"KUALITAS PERMUKAAN","Same way":"Arah sama","Save Rule":"Simpan Aturan","Save View":"Simpan Tampilan","Save screenshot…":"Simpan tangkapan layar…","Save the study as an animated GIF, seen as the viewport shows it":"Simpan studi sebagai GIF animasi, seperti yang tampil di viewport","Saved preview. Geometry is being checked before editing.":"Pratinjau tersimpan. Geometri sedang diperiksa sebelum diedit.","Scale factor":"Faktor skala","Scene":"Scene","Screenshot (optional)":"Tangkapan layar (opsional)","Search":"Cari","Search commands":"Cari perintah","Search this library":"Cari di pustaka ini","Second edge":"Tepi kedua","Second plane":"Bidang kedua","Second point":"Titik kedua","Section":"Penampang","Section (optional)":"Penampang (opsional)","Section position":"Posisi penampang","Sections (one sketch each)":"Penampang (satu sketsa per penampang)","Select Other":"Pilih Lainnya","Select Other: hold the left button still on the model (or right-click › Select Other…) to list everything under the cursor; click again on the same spot to select the next thing there. Double-click the middle button to go Home (Preferences › Navigation).":"Select Other: tahan tombol kiri diam di model (atau klik kanan › Select Other…) untuk mendaftar semua yang ada di bawah kursor; klik lagi di titik yang sama untuk memilih benda berikutnya. Klik dua kali tombol tengah untuk ke Home (Preferensi › Navigasi).","Select Same Look":"Pilih Tampilan yang Sama","Select bodies (a face picks its body)":"Pilih bodi (memilih muka berarti memilih bodinya)","Select bodies or faces instead":"Pilih bodi atau muka saja","Select edges":"Pilih tepi","Select points of the sketch being edited":"Pilih titik pada sketsa yang sedang diedit","Select the centre the pattern turns around first":"Pilih dahulu pusat tempat pola berputar","Select the curves to offset first":"Pilih dahulu kurva yang akan di-offset","Select the mirror line":"Pilih garis cermin","Select the sketch curves or points to mirror first":"Pilih dahulu kurva atau titik sketsa yang akan dicerminkan","Select the sketch curves or points to move first":"Pilih dahulu kurva atau titik sketsa yang akan dipindahkan","Select the sketch curves or points to pattern first":"Pilih dahulu kurva atau titik sketsa yang akan dibuat polanya","Select the sketch curves or points to scale first":"Pilih dahulu kurva atau titik sketsa yang akan diskalakan","Select the sketch curves or points to transform first":"Pilih dahulu kurva atau titik sketsa yang akan ditransformasikan","Selection filter":"Filter pilihan","Semantic faces share their appearance across instances.":"Muka semantik berbagi tampilannya di antara instans.","Send your report on GitHub":"Kirim laporan Anda di GitHub","Shaded":"Berbayang","Shape":"Bentuk","Sheet Rules":"Aturan Pelat","Show Agent Cursor":"Tampilkan Kursor Agen","Show ghost":"Tampilkan ghost","Show in folder":"Tampilkan di folder","Show the pointer an AI agent moves (#35)":"Tampilkan penunjuk yang digerakkan agen AI (#35)","Show tool at cursor":"Tampilkan alat di dekat kursor","Signed axes":"Sumbu bertanda","Size":"Ukuran","Sketch constraints":"Batasan sketsa","Sketch curves":"Kurva sketsa","Sketch dimensions":"Dimensi sketsa","Sketch geometry and profiles":"Geometri dan profil sketsa","Sketch plane has no body-face attachment.":"Bidang sketsa tidak memiliki lampiran muka bodi.","Sketch points":"Titik sketsa","Slider":"Geser","Slot width":"Lebar slot","Snap to face and edge centres":"Snap ke pusat muka dan tepi","SolidCraft cannot submit reports directly. Submit on GitHub; no token is needed in the app.":"SolidCraft tidak dapat mengirim laporan secara langsung. Kirim di GitHub; token tidak diperlukan di aplikasi.","SolidCraft closed before these designs were saved. Their last autosave can be opened.":"SolidCraft tertutup sebelum desain ini disimpan. Simpan otomatis terakhirnya dapat dibuka.","Sort A to Z":"Urutkan A ke Z","Sort Z to A":"Urutkan Z ke A","Spacing 2 must be a non-zero number":"Jarak antar 2 harus berupa bilangan bukan nol","Spacing must be a non-zero number":"Jarak antar harus berupa bilangan bukan nol","Specialise":"Spesialisasikan","Speed":"Kecepatan","Splitting tool":"Alat pemisah","Square":"Persegi","Stand it up":"Tegakkan","Stand it up: a quarter turn about X, as one Move feature you can undo.":"Tegakkan: putaran seperempat terhadap X, sebagai satu fitur Move yang dapat dibatalkan.","Stand this assembly up?":"Tegakkan rakitan ini?","Stand this part up?":"Tegakkan part ini?","Start angle":"Sudut awal","Start bulge":"Bulge awal","Start continuity":"Kontinuitas awal","Stationary Side":"Sisi Diam","Step":"Langkah","Steps":"Langkah","Steps to reproduce (optional)":"Langkah untuk mereproduksi (opsional)","Stitch the kept pieces":"Jahit bagian yang dipertahankan","Stitch to both bodies":"Jahit ke kedua bodi","Studio":"Studio","Study":"Studi","Style":"Gaya","Summary":"Ringkasan","Suppress":"Tekan","Suppress Selected Folders":"Tekan Folder Terpilih","Suppressed":"Ditekan","Surface":"Permukaan","Surface, or faces to turn over":"Permukaan, atau muka yang akan dibalik","Surfaces":"Permukaan","Swap Ends":"Tukar Ujung","TRIM":"TRIM","Tangent":"Tangen","Tangent (G1)":"Tangen (G1)","Tangent Chain":"Rantai Tangen","Tangent chain":"Rantai tangen","Tangent to Edge":"Tangen ke Tepi","Tap drill diameter":"Diameter bor tap","Target":"Target","Target Body":"Bodi Target","Target Face (optional)":"Muka Target (opsional)","Tear":"Sobek","Technical details":"Detail teknis","The dashed sketch is a saved plane guide. Select a new face to repair the attachment.":"Sketsa putus-putus adalah panduan bidang yang tersimpan. Pilih muka baru untuk memperbaiki lampiran.","The design changed. Reopen Change Part Size for the component.":"Desain berubah. Buka kembali Ubah Ukuran Part untuk komponen ini.","The direction must be an axis or a straight sketch curve that lies in the sketch plane":"Arah harus berupa sumbu atau kurva sketsa lurus yang terletak pada bidang sketsa","The mirror line cannot also be mirrored":"Garis cermin tidak dapat ikut dicerminkan","The mirror line must be a straight curve of this sketch, not an origin axis":"Garis cermin harus berupa kurva lurus dari sketsa ini, bukan sumbu origin","The saved author occurrence is missing. Select a valid author placement before rebinding.":"Kemunculan author yang tersimpan hilang. Pilih penempatan author yang valid sebelum mengikat ulang.","Then":"Lalu","These features will be deleted:":"Fitur berikut akan dihapus:","These features will fail:":"Fitur berikut akan gagal:","Thickness Outside":"Ketebalan Luar","Thickness Variation":"Variasi Ketebalan","Thin":"Tipis","Thin Extrude":"Ekstrusi Tipis","Third plane":"Bidang ketiga","Third point":"Titik ketiga","This child is shared. Deleting it removes it from every copy of its parent.":"Anak ini dibagikan. Menghapusnya akan menghilangkannya dari setiap salinan induknya.","This child is shared. Position changes apply to every copy of its parent.":"Anak ini dibagikan. Perubahan posisi berlaku untuk setiap salinan induknya.","This component is inside a subassembly placed more than once: aligning it moves it in every placement.":"Komponen ini berada di dalam subrakitan yang ditempatkan lebih dari sekali: menyejajarkannya akan memindahkannya di setiap penempatan.","This face cannot provide a durable attachment. Choose another face or explicitly use a fixed plane.":"Muka ini tidak dapat menyediakan lampiran yang tahan lama. Pilih muka lain atau gunakan bidang tetap secara eksplisit.","This image is not attached to GitHub yet. Copy or save it, then attach it on GitHub.":"Gambar ini belum dilampirkan ke GitHub. Salin atau simpan, lalu lampirkan di GitHub.","Thread depth":"Kedalaman ulir","Thread diameter":"Diameter ulir","Through point":"Melalui titik","To":"Hingga","To Offset":"Hingga Offset","To Snap":"Hingga Snap","To edges":"Ke tepi","Toe radius":"Radius ujung","Tolerance":"Toleransi","Too close":"Terlalu dekat","Tool Bodies":"Bodi Alat","Tools":"Alat","Tools, clockwise from the top":"Alat, searah jarum jam dari atas","Top Left":"Kiri Atas","Top Middle":"Tengah Atas","Top Right":"Kanan Atas","Trimming tool (plane, face or curves)":"Alat trim (bidang, muka, atau kurva)","Turn off section analysis before exporting the view.":"Matikan analisis penampang sebelum mengekspor tampilan.","Type":"Tipe","Type a distance or an angle to move by":"Ketik jarak atau sudut untuk memindahkan","UNTRIM":"UNTRIM","Unit":"Satuan","Unsuppress":"Lepas Tekan","Unsuppress Selected Folders":"Lepas Tekan Folder Terpilih","Updating the preview":"Memperbarui pratinjau","Use active author placement":"Gunakan penempatan author aktif","Use fixed plane":"Gunakan bidang tetap","Use saved fixed plane":"Gunakan bidang tetap tersimpan","Use selected face as fixed plane":"Gunakan muka terpilih sebagai bidang tetap","Use the SolidWorks mouse mode":"Gunakan mode mouse SolidWorks","User Parameters":"Parameter Pengguna","VIEW":"TAMPILAN","VIEWS":"TAMPILAN","Value":"Nilai","Variable Radius":"Radius Variabel","Velocity":"Kecepatan","Vertices":"Titik sudut","View navigator":"Navigator tampilan","Volume":"Volume","Wall":"Dinding","Wall Location":"Lokasi Dinding","Wall Thickness":"Tebal Dinding","Web thickness":"Tebal web","What did you do just before the problem? A short list is enough":"Apa yang Anda lakukan sesaat sebelum masalah terjadi? Daftar singkat sudah cukup","What did you expect to see?":"Apa yang Anda harapkan terlihat?","What happened?":"Apa yang terjadi?","When":"Saat","Width":"Lebar","Will fail":"Akan gagal","With gestures on, the right button no longer orbits the view: hold it and move to open the ring, then touch a tool's zone. A plain right-click still opens the menu.":"Saat gestur aktif, tombol kanan tidak lagi mengorbit tampilan: tahan dan gerakkan untuk membuka cincin, lalu sentuh zona sebuah alat. Klik kanan biasa tetap membuka menu.","X":"X","X Angle":"Sudut X","X angle":"Sudut X","X distance":"Jarak X","Y":"Y","Y Angle":"Sudut Y","Y angle":"Sudut Y","Y distance":"Jarak Y","Z":"Z","Z Angle":"Sudut Z","Z Distance":"Jarak Z","Z angle":"Sudut Z","Z distance":"Jarak Z","Zebra":"Zebra","`joint` must be an id or a name":"`joint` harus berupa id atau nama","`params` must be an object":"`params` harus berupa objek","`values` must be a list":"`values` harus berupa daftar","a chamfer needs a corner of exactly two lines":"chamfer memerlukan sudut dari tepat dua garis","a file operation is in progress":"operasi file sedang berlangsung","a picked curve is no longer in a sketch":"kurva yang dipilih tidak lagi berada dalam sketsa","a picked curve's sketch has not been solved":"sketsa dari kurva yang dipilih belum diselesaikan","a picked edge has no points":"tepi yang dipilih tidak memiliki titik","a picked edge is gone":"tepi yang dipilih sudah tidak ada","a picked edge's body is gone":"bodi dari tepi yang dipilih sudah tidak ada","add a key for a joint first":"tambahkan kunci untuk sambungan terlebih dahulu","ai.connected_toast":"SolidCraft kini tersedia di {clients}. Mulai ulang untuk menggunakannya (Pengaturan > Asisten).","ai.prefs.allow_control":"Izinkan agen AI terhubung (kanal kontrol / MCP)","ai.prefs.allow_control_note":"Membuka kanal kontrol hanya di komputer ini (127.0.0.1, port 27878 atau port kosong berikutnya). Program yang terhubung juga harus menunjukkan token rahasia yang hanya dapat dibaca akun pengguna Anda, dibuat baru setiap kali dimulai. Berlaku saat SolidCraft dimulai berikutnya. Nonaktif: tidak ada yang mendengarkan kecuali Anda memulai SolidCraft dengan --control.","ai.prefs.availability":"Kontrol asisten","ai.prefs.background_commands":"Jalankan perintah agen di latar belakang","ai.prefs.connect_apps":"Sediakan SolidCraft untuk aplikasi AI di komputer ini","ai.prefs.connect_apps_note":"Saat SolidCraft dimulai, menambahkannya sebagai server MCP ke aplikasi AI yang ditemukan di komputer ini (OpenCode, Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Gemini CLI, Copilot CLI, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code), sehingga agen dapat memakainya tanpa pengaturan apa pun. Hanya entri solidcraft yang ditambahkan atau path-nya diperbarui; entri yang Anda ubah dibiarkan, dan file dicadangkan lebih dulu. Nonaktif: entri yang ditambahkannya dihapus. Bantuan > Hubungkan asisten AI… melakukannya secara manual.","ai.prefs.connect_at_start":"Hubungkan agen yang terakhir dipakai saat SolidCraft dimulai","ai.prefs.connect_at_start_note":"Memulai agen yang terakhir Anda hubungkan (atau yang default) di latar belakang setiap kali SolidCraft dimulai, sehingga siap untuk mengobrol. Tidak berlaku jika SolidCraft dimulai dengan --control. Jika tidak dapat terhubung, Asisten menampilkan Koneksi gagal dan tombol Coba lagi.","ai.prefs.follow_camera":"Arahkan kamera ke sketsa","ai.prefs.follow_camera_off":"Kamera mengikuti otomatis nonaktif.","ai.prefs.follow_camera_on":"Kamera berputar menghadap sketsa yang dibuat agen.","ai.prefs.intro":"Agen, izin, dan tampilan hasil kerjanya.","ai.prefs.make_default":"Pakai sebagai default","ai.prefs.no_agents":"Belum ada agen. Tambah agen atau segarkan untuk menemukan agen yang terpasang.","ai.prefs.no_saved_approvals":"Tidak ada persetujuan tersimpan.","ai.prefs.open_at_start":"Buka panel Asisten saat SolidCraft dimulai","ai.prefs.open_at_start_note":"Menampilkan panel Asisten (atau jendelanya sendiri) setiap kali SolidCraft dimulai. Tidak berlaku jika SolidCraft dimulai dengan --control.","ai.prefs.override_all_warning":"Agen ini dapat menyimpan, menimpa, mengekspor, atau mengganti desain tanpa bertanya.","ai.prefs.permission_all":"Izinkan semuanya","ai.prefs.permission_all_summary":"Alat SolidCraft yang tersedia berjalan tanpa bertanya.","ai.prefs.permission_ask":"Tanya sebelum mengubah","ai.prefs.permission_ask_summary":"Setujui setiap perubahan desain dan aksi file.","ai.prefs.permission_edits":"Izinkan edit model","ai.prefs.permission_edits_summary":"Edit model berjalan; aksi file dan aksi yang merusak tetap bertanya.","ai.prefs.permission_scope":"Hanya untuk alat SolidCraft. Shell dan edit file agen memakai izinnya sendiri.","ai.prefs.pointer_preview_hidden":"Penunjuk disembunyikan","ai.prefs.pointer_preview_speed":"Penunjuk agen · {speed}","ai.prefs.pointer_speed":"Kecepatan gerak","ai.prefs.privacy_note":"Hanya agen atau endpoint pilihan Anda yang menerima percakapan. Kunci endpoint disimpan di keychain sistem Anda.","ai.prefs.show_pointer":"Tampilkan penunjuk agen","ai.prefs.turn_limit_hint":"Jumlah maksimum pemanggilan alat pengubah desain yang boleh dilakukan Asisten untuk satu pesan.","angle, height":"sudut, tinggi","appearance.dielectric_ior":"IOR Dielektrik","appearance.metallic":"Metalik","appearance.only_available":"Hanya tampilan yang tersedia","appearance.pbr_help":"Lihat permukaan ini di Render atau PNG produk. Tanpa refraksi atau transmisi.","appearance.pbr_opaque":"PBR Opak","appearance.roughness":"Kekasaran","appearance.surface_response":"Respons permukaan","at the face":"di muka","bom.group_children":"Sub-part dalam baris part induknya","browser.body_name":"Bodi{number}","browser.calibrate_click_a":"Klik gambar untuk Titik A, atau ketik koordinatnya.","browser.calibrate_click_b":"Klik gambar untuk Titik B, atau ketik koordinatnya.","browser.calibrate_title":"Kalibrasi: {name}","browser.capture_many":"{count} komponen dipindahkan tetapi posisinya belum ditangkap.","browser.capture_note":"Tangkap menyimpan posisi baru; Kembalikan memulihkannya.","browser.capture_one":"Sebuah komponen dipindahkan tetapi posisinya belum ditangkap.","brow