ersion}): ela não verifica atualizações.","update.prefs_flatpak":"O Flatpak atualiza esta cópia ({version}): execute {command} ou use sua central de programas. O SolidCraft não verifica.","update.prefs_label":"Atualizações","update.prefs_note":"Este é o SolidCraft {version} ({kind}). Uma verificação pergunta ao GitHub pela versão mais recente e não envia mais nada.","update.release_page":"Abrir página da versão","update.restart":"Reiniciar agora","update.restart_later":"Depois","update.show":"Mostrar a atualização para {version}","update.skip":"Pular esta versão","update.system_hint":"Esta cópia é um {kind}. Atualize-a com:","update.title":"Atualização disponível","update.up_to_date":"O SolidCraft está atualizado.","update.update_now":"Atualizar agora","update.you_have":"Você tem a {version}.","↑ ↓ choose · Enter / Tab complete · Esc dismiss":"↑ ↓ escolher · Enter / Tab completar · Esc fechar"}␀␀␀+"␀␀zh-TW繁體中文{"(active rule)":"（目前規則）","0 turns it off":"0 表示關閉","1. Open GitHub draft below, then paste the report copied to your clipboard.":"1. 點擊下方按鈕開啟 GitHub 草稿，然後貼上已複製到剪貼簿的報告。","1. Open GitHub draft below. Your title and report will be filled in.":"1. 點擊下方按鈕開啟 GitHub 草稿。標題和報告將自動填入。","2. Attach your screenshot: copy and paste it, or save and upload the PNG.":"2. 附上截圖：複製並貼上，或儲存為 PNG 後上傳。","2D":"2D","3. Click Submit new issue on GitHub to send your report.":"3. 在 GitHub 上點擊 Submit new issue 傳送報告。","A Single hole snaps to the middle of its face and to the centres of its round edges":"單一孔會吸附到其所在面的中心與圓形邊的中心","A new configuration, a copy of the active one":"新建組態，為目前組態的副本","A placed Single hole has a handle to drag it, and picking its face again moves the hole there instead of taking it out":"已放置的單一孔帶有可拖曳的控點，再次選取該面會將孔移到該處，而不是移除它","A short title for the problem (optional)":"問題的簡短標題（可選）","ARRANGE":"排列","About SolidCraft":"關於 SolidCraft","Acceleration":"加速度","Access":"可達性","Actions":"操作","Active":"作用中","Active rule":"作用中規則","Add":"新增","Add Column":"新增欄","Add Key":"新增按鍵","Add Mid Radius":"新增中間半徑","Add Row":"新增列","Add a tool":"新增工具","Add all bodies":"新增所有實體","Add bend":"新增折彎","Add condition":"新增條件","Add or edit rule":"新增或編輯規則","Add to New Folder":"新增到新資料夾","Add visible bodies":"新增可見實體","Advanced":"進階","Against":"對照","Alignment":"對齊","All Lines":"所有直線","All Sketch Points":"所有草圖點","All components":"所有元件","All open designs":"所有開啟的設計","Allowed expressions, separated by semicolons":"允許的運算式，以分號分隔","Also deletes":"同時刪除","Also place them from the origin (fully constrained)":"同時從原點定位（完全約束）","Anchor":"錨點","Angle 2":"角度 2","Angle Display":"角度顯示","Animate":"動畫","Another bend on the far edge of the last flange":"在最後一個凸緣的遠端邊上再加一道折彎","App/system information and command settings are included. Review private details before sharing.":"報告包含應用程式與系統資訊以及命令設定。分享前請檢查私人資訊。","Appearance name":"外觀名稱","Applied Radius":"套用半徑","Apply To":"套用於","Apply library appearance":"套用外觀庫中的外觀","Apply to selection":"套用到選擇","Apply your appearance first. Exports assigned appearances and materials created in this design.":"請先套用外觀。匯出已指定的外觀和在此設計中建立的材質。","Arc length":"弧長","Area":"面積","As Picked":"依選取","As-Built":"現有位置","Assign Rule":"指派規則","Attachment":"附著","BLEND SURFACE":"混合曲面","BOUNDARY SURFACE":"邊界曲面","BROWSER":"瀏覽器","Back to the original order":"還原原始順序","Ball":"球","Bar":"扁鋼","Base Center":"底面中心","Base Height":"底座高度","Bend":"折彎角度","Bend Edges":"折彎邊","Bend Line":"折彎線","Bend Line Position":"彎折線位置","Bend Position":"折彎位置","Bend Radius":"折彎半徑","Bend Table":"折彎表","Bends":"折彎","Bodies":"實體","Bodies (optional)":"實體（可選）","Body":"實體","Body (last if none)":"實體（未指定時為最後一個）","Body to split":"要分割的實體","Body, or faces to take out":"實體，或要移除的面","Both":"兩側","Bottom Left":"左下","Bottom Middle":"下中","Bottom Right":"右下","Boundary":"邊界","Bounding box":"邊界框","CHECK":"檢查","COMPONENTS":"元件","CONFIGURATIONS":"組態","CONSTRAIN":"拘束","CONTACT":"接觸","CONVERT":"轉換","CSV or JSON: updates existing parameters, adds new ones":"CSV 或 JSON：更新現有參數、新增新參數","Capture All Positions":"擷取所有位置","Capture Pos.":"擷取位置","Catch Depth":"卡扣深度","Catch Direction":"卡扣方向","Catch Length":"卡扣長度","Cells":"區域","Center X":"中心 X","Center Y":"中心 Y","Center of mass":"質心","Centre to centre":"中心距","Centroid":"形心","Chamfer Type":"倒角類型","Channel":"槽鋼","Check collisions":"檢查碰撞","Checked":"已檢查","Choose Variable radius or Spline in Type.":"請在「類型」中選擇「可變半徑」或「樣條曲線」。","Choose a new plane. Sketch geometry and dimensions stay unchanged in its two-dimensional coordinates.":"選擇一個新平面。草圖幾何和尺寸在其二維座標中保持不變。","Choose…":"選擇…","Circle center":"圓心","Circle or sphere":"圓或球","Circular":"環形","Circumference":"周長","Clockwise":"順時針","Close draft":"關閉草稿","Collapse":"收合","Collisions":"碰撞","Colour":"顏色","Command":"命令","Comment":"註解","Component 1":"元件 1","Component 2":"元件 2","Component1":"元件1","Components":"元件","Config Table":"組態表","Configuration":"組態","Configuration rules":"組態規則","Constant radius":"等半徑","Contact":"接觸","Contact Sets":"接觸集","Contact sets":"接觸集","Continue on GitHub":"在 GitHub 上繼續","Continuity":"連續性","Control Radius":"控制半徑","Copies the definition only. Assign it from Physical Material when ready.":"僅複製定義。準備好後，可從物理材質中指派。","Copy Error Message":"複製錯誤訊息","Copy Warning Message":"複製警告訊息","Copy all licences":"複製所有授權","Copy diagnostic information":"複製診斷資訊","Copy report":"複製報告","Copy screenshot":"複製截圖","Corner Relief":"轉角釋壓","Corner Relief Shape":"轉角釋壓形狀","Corner radius":"圓角半徑","Counterbore depth":"柱孔深度","Counterbore Ø":"柱孔 Ø","Countersink angle":"錐孔角度","Countersink Ø":"錐孔 Ø","Create Hole":"建立孔","Create Issue — review draft":"建立 Issue——檢閱草稿","Create Issue…":"建立問題回報…","Cross curves":"交叉曲線","Ctrl+Enter continues on GitHub.":"按 Ctrl+Enter 在 GitHub 上繼續。","Cube":"立方體","Current orthographic view (1:1 mm)":"目前正交檢視（1:1毫米）","Current perspective view":"目前透視檢視","Current plane":"目前平面","Curv. Comb":"曲率梳","Curvature (G2)":"曲率 (G2)","Curvature change (G3)":"曲率變化 (G3)","Custom":"自訂","Customize Toolbar":"自訂工具列","Customize…":"自訂…","Cylindrical":"圓柱","Cylindrical face":"圓柱面","Deboss":"凹雕","Delete":"刪除","Delete Folders and Features…":"刪除資料夾及其特徵…","Delete Selected Features…":"刪除所選特徵…","Delete Selected Folders":"刪除所選資料夾","Delete all":"全部刪除","Delete rule":"刪除規則","Delete the row":"刪除此列","Delete the set":"刪除此集合","Density":"密度","Dependents":"相依項","Describe the problem you saw":"請描述您遇到的問題","Describe what happened before continuing.":"繼續之前，請先描述發生了什麼事。","Designs you open or save appear here.":"您開啟或儲存的設計會顯示在此處。","Determined by To Object. Choose Angle to edit the angular extent.":"由「到物件」確定。選擇「角度」可編輯角度範圍。","Diameter":"直徑","Did this assembly open the wrong way up?":"此組合件開啟時的朝向是否不對？","Did this part open the wrong way up?":"此零件開啟時的朝向是否不對？","Dimension new shapes":"為新圖形標註尺寸","Direction":"方向","Discard":"捨棄","Distance":"距離","Distance 1":"距離 1","Do not export hidden edges":"不匯出隱藏線","Don't ask again":"不再詢問","Double-click to rename":"雙擊重新命名","Double-clicking the middle button in the view: Home (the home view, framing what is shown), Fit (frame what is shown, keeping the orientation) or nothing":"在檢視中雙擊中鍵：主檢視（主檢視，框住所顯示的內容）、適合視窗（框住所顯示的內容，保持方向）或無動作","Drag to move the boss across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"拖曳以在模型上移動凸台。它會吸附到面上的草圖點。","Drag to move the hole; click to remove it":"拖曳以移動孔，點擊以移除","Drag to move the rest across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"拖曳以在模型上移動墊塊。它會吸附到面上的草圖點。","Drag to move the snap fit across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"拖曳以在模型上移動卡扣。它會吸附到面上的草圖點。","Drag to point the catch in another direction.":"拖曳以將卡扣指向另一個方向。","Drag to turn the rest in 5° steps. Hold Alt or Ctrl to turn it freely.":"拖曳以 5° 為間隔旋轉墊塊。按住 Alt 或 Ctrl 可自由旋轉。","Drive Joint":"驅動接頭","Duration":"時長","Each new shape is also dimensioned from the sketch origin until nothing of it is left free. A shape already attached to the origin or to placed geometry gets none.":"每個新圖形也會從草圖原點標註尺寸，直到沒有任何自由度。已連接到原點或已放置幾何的圖形不會再加。","Each shape you draw gets all its dimensions, at the sizes you drew (typed values win). A size the sketch already sets is left out.":"您繪製的每個圖形都會依繪製的大小取得所有尺寸（輸入的值優先）。草圖已決定的尺寸會略過。","Edge":"邊","Edges":"邊","Edit":"編輯","Edit Profile Sketch":"編輯輪廓草圖","Edit shortcuts":"編輯快捷鍵","Enable rule":"啟用規則","Enabled":"已啟用","End Radius":"終止半徑","End bulge":"終止鼓度","End continuity":"終止連續性","Equal Distance":"等距離","Expand":"展開","Expected result (optional)":"預期結果（可選）","Explode":"爆炸","Explode Text":"分解文字","Export Animation…":"匯出動畫…","Export Bend Table…":"匯出折彎表…","Export CSV…":"匯出 CSV…","Export Current View as DXF":"將目前檢視匯出為DXF","Export Current View as DXF…":"將目前檢視匯出為DXF…","Export DXF":"匯出DXF","Export DXF…":"匯出DXF…","Export JSON…":"匯出 JSON…","Export design library...":"匯出設計零件庫...","Export hidden edges as dashed lines":"以虛線匯出隱藏線","Exported by SolidWorks, which usually saves Y up":"由 SolidWorks 匯出，通常以 Y 軸向上儲存","Expression":"運算式","Extend to meet":"延伸至相交","Extents":"範圍","FILES":"檔案","FLAT":"展開","Face":"面","Face Appearance":"面外觀","Face attachment lost":"面附著遺失","Face center":"面中心","Faces":"面","Faces / edges / vertices":"面 / 邊 / 頂點","Faces to split":"要分割的面","Faces/Body":"面/實體","Factor must be a positive number":"係數必須是正數","Fastener":"扣件","Favorites":"收藏","Favourite":"收藏","Feature":"特徵","Files from many CAD programs have Y up, so they open lying on their back here (Z up).":"許多 CAD 程式的檔案以 Y 為上軸，因此在此處開啟時會平躺（Z 朝上）。","Filter":"篩選","Filter…":"篩選…","Find in Browser":"在瀏覽器中查詢","Finish":"完成","First edge":"第一條邊","First plane":"第一個平面","First point":"第一點","Fit and G2 corners require Constant radius.":"擬合與 G2 轉角需要「等半徑」。","Fixed Face":"固定面","Flange Gap":"凸緣間隙","Flange thickness":"翼緣厚度","Flanges":"凸緣","Flat Pattern":"展開圖","Flat size":"展開尺寸","Flat size X":"展開尺寸 X","Flat size Y":"展開尺寸 Y","Follow camera (Look At sketches)":"跟隨相機（注視草圖）","Follow the camera (Look At sketches)":"跟隨相機（注視草圖）","Font":"字型","Free Move":"自由移動","From":"起點","From Bodies":"從實體建立","From Snap":"起始鎖點","From edges":"從邊","Full Length":"全長","Full thread depth":"完整螺紋深度","Further Bends":"更多折彎","G2 corners require a constant radius and Exact fit. G2 corner construction is not supported yet.":"G2 轉角需要恆定半徑與 「精確擬合」。尚不支援建構 G2 轉角。","Gap":"間隙","Grid":"網格","HISTORY":"歷程記錄","Halo under sketch curves":"在草圖曲線下方顯示光暈","Height":"高度","Height From":"高度基準","Hem Gap":"摺邊間隙","Hidden edges":"隱藏線","History layout":"歷程配置","History names":"歷程名稱","Hole (optional)":"孔（可選）","Hole Depth":"孔深","Hole Diameter":"孔徑","Holes":"孔","Holes (edges on them)":"孔（孔上的邊）","Home view":"主檢視","Horiz./Vert.":"水平 / 垂直","I-Beam":"工字鋼","IMAGES":"影像","If you are offline or GitHub does not open, use Copy report and keep the text to submit later.":"如果您處於離線狀態或 GitHub 無法開啟，請使用「複製報告」並保留文字，稍後再提交。","Import material into design":"將材質匯入設計","Import…":"匯入…","In This Design":"在此設計中","In place (surfaces)":"原位（曲面）","In plane":"在平面內","Included":"夾角","Inner Sharp":"內側虛擬尖角","Inside":"內側","Instant":"即時","Interface font":"介面字型","Interferes":"發生干涉","Invert":"反轉","Isocurve":"等參線","Issue title":"Issue 標題","Items":"項目","JOINTS":"接頭","Joint 1":"接頭 1","Joint 2":"接頭 2","Joint Origin1":"接頭原點1","K Factor":"K 因子","Keep (points on it)":"保留（其上的點）","Keep Tools":"保留工具","Keep of the other surface":"另一曲面保留的部分","Key a joint's value at this step":"在此步驟為接頭值設定關鍵影格","Keys":"關鍵影格","Knife Edge":"刀口","L-Angle":"角鋼","LIBRARY":"零件庫","LINKS":"連結","Later":"稍後","Leave it":"保持原樣","Left Middle":"左中","Legacy face attachment. Rebinding to a certified face creates an exact attachment.":"舊版面附著。重新繫結到經驗證的面可建立精確附著。","Length":"長度","Length units":"長度單位","Letter Spacing":"字間距","Library":"零件庫","Library file":"零件庫檔案","Library response is missing":"缺少零件庫的回應","Limits":"限制","Line Spacing":"行間距","Line Type":"線型","Line on plane":"直線在平面上","Lines":"直線","Listing the installed fonts…":"正在列出已安裝的字型…","Load library":"載入零件庫","Local library":"本機零件庫","Loop":"迴圈","M5 or M5x0.5":"M5 或 M5x0.5","M5, M5x0.5, 1/4-20 UNC":"M5, M5x0.5, 1/4-20 UNC","MANAGE":"管理","MATERIALS":"材質","MODEL":"模型","MOTION":"運動","Margin":"餘量","Mass":"質量","Mass Center":"質心","Matched restrictions check the final values.":"滿足條件的限制規則檢查最終值。","Material":"材質","Material Outside":"材料在外側","Material copied. Existing body assignments are unchanged.":"材質已複製。現有的實體指派維持不變。","Max":"最大","Max Thickness":"最大厚度","Maximum":"最大值","Mesh body":"網格實體","Mid Radius":"中間半徑","Middle double-click":"中鍵雙擊","Min":"最小","Min Draft":"最小拔模","Min Thickness":"最小厚度","Minimum":"最小值","Mirror Plane":"鏡射平面","Mitre":"斜接","Model Parameters":"模型參數","Modeled":"已建模","More toolbar panels":"更多工具列面板","Motion":"運動","Mouse gestures":"滑鼠手勢","Mouse gestures only work with the SolidWorks mouse mode (the wheel orbits, Ctrl + wheel pans).":"滑鼠手勢僅適用於 SolidWorks 滑鼠模式（滾輪可環轉，Ctrl + 滾輪可平移）。","Move / Copy":"移動 / 複製","Move Type":"移動類型","Move down":"下移","Move earlier":"向前移動","Move holes by clicking or dragging":"以點擊或拖曳來移動孔","Move later":"向後移動","Move up":"上移","Name":"名稱","Name on import":"匯入時的名稱","Nearest":"最近","Neutral plane":"中性面","New":"新建","New Comp.":"新建元件","New Sketch":"新建草圖","New rule…":"新建規則…","New study":"新建研究","No crash reports.":"沒有當機報告。","No matching appearance presets.":"沒有符合的外觀預設。","No matching appearances":"沒有符合的外觀","No matching physical materials.":"沒有符合的物理材質。","No visible bodies or sketches to export.":"沒有可匯出的可見實體或草圖。","Nominal Radius":"公稱半徑","Nominal diameter":"公稱直徑","None":"無","Not available yet":"暫不可用","Not saved yet":"尚未儲存","Notch":"缺口","OUTPUT":"輸出","Of":"的值","On your computer":"在此電腦上","Opacity":"不透明度","Open GitHub":"開啟 GitHub","Open GitHub draft":"開啟 GitHub 草稿","Open GitHub issue form":"開啟 GitHub Issue 表單","Open bodies (no volume)":"未閉合實體（無體積）","Open library...":"開啟零件庫...","Open local libraries in the desktop app. You can export this design's library here.":"請在桌面應用程式中開啟本機零件庫。您可以在此匯出目前設計的零件庫。","Open surface — no volume":"未閉合曲面 — 無體積","Open-source parametric 3D CAD in Rust. Licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0.":"使用 Rust 編寫的開源參數化 3D CAD。基於 MIT OR Apache-2.0 授權。","Opens your browser and copies the report text for you to paste into GitHub.":"開啟瀏覽器，並複製報告文字，供您貼到 GitHub。","Opens your browser and copies the report text. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"開啟瀏覽器並複製報告文字。請在 GitHub 上檢閱並提交報告。","Opens your browser. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"開啟瀏覽器。請在 GitHub 上檢查並提交報告。","Operator":"運算子","Orbit (right drag)":"環轉（右鍵拖曳）","Other side":"另一側","Other surface (mutual trim)":"另一曲面（相互修剪）","Other way":"反方向","Outer Sharp":"外側虛擬尖角","Outer radius":"外圓角半徑","Outside":"外側","Overall length":"總長","Param. Graph":"參數圖","Parameter":"參數","Part length must be greater than zero and at most 2000 mm":"零件長度必須大於零且不超過 2000 mm","Parts":"零件","Pass through":"通過點","Path":"路徑","Pattern":"陣列","Per Edge":"每條邊","Physical material definitions":"物理材質定義","Pick a part size":"請選取零件尺寸","Pick the tool bodies":"選擇工具實體","Picked":"所選","Picked point":"選取的點","Pin-slot":"銷槽","Pitch":"螺距","Pivot":"樞軸","Place at the origin instead":"改為放置在原點","Planar":"平面","Plastic Rules":"塑膠規則","Play the joint's motion in the view":"在檢視中播放接頭運動","Playback":"播放","Plot":"繪圖","Point on line":"點在直線上","Point on plane":"點在平面上","Position":"位置","Position (0 to 1)":"位置（0 到 1）","Position (G0)":"位置 (G0)","Position along the edge, 0 at the start end, 1 at the other":"沿邊的位置，起點端為 0，另一端為 1","Preferences › Design turns the offer back on":"可在 偏好設定 › 設計 中重新開啟此提示","Preview":"預覽","Preview Row":"預覽列","Preview leaves the current design unchanged.":"預覽不會變更目前設計。","Profile / Edges":"輪廓 / 邊","Profiles or curves":"輪廓或曲線","Profiles/Curves":"輪廓/曲線","Quantity":"數量","Quantity must be at least 2":"數量至少為 2","RECENT":"最近使用","REFERENCE":"參考","RULED SURFACE":"直紋曲面","RULES":"規則","Radius":"半徑","Radius Fit":"半徑擬合","Ratio":"比率","Read-only list: shortcuts can't be changed here.":"唯讀清單：無法在此變更快捷鍵。","Reattach selected face":"重新附著所選面","Recover":"復原","Recover unsaved design?":"復原未儲存的設計？","Rectangular":"矩形","Rectangular Tube":"矩形管","Reference face":"參考面","Relief Depth":"止裂槽深度","Relief Width":"止裂槽寬度","Remove Tools":"移除工具","Remove condition":"移除條件","Remove from Folder":"從資料夾移除","Remove from list":"從清單移除","Remove override":"移除覆蓋","Remove private design details or paths before sharing.":"共享前請移除私密設計細節或路徑。","Remove screenshot":"移除截圖","Remove the column":"移除此欄","Remove the track":"移除軌跡","Remove this bend":"移除此折彎","Remove this point":"移除此點","Rename Feature":"重新命名特徵","Rename Folder":"重新命名資料夾","Render Stage":"彩現階段","Reopen designs":"重新開啟設計","Reopen the designs that were open when SolidCraft was last closed":"重新開啟上次關閉 SolidCraft 時開啟的設計","Replace existing library file":"取代現有零件庫檔案","Report a bug — review a screenshot and open a GitHub draft":"回報錯誤 — 檢閱截圖並開啟 GitHub 草稿","Report copied. Keep this text to submit on GitHub when you are online.":"已複製報告。請保留此文字，待連線後在 GitHub 上提交。","Report text copied. Paste it into GitHub and submit your report there.":"報告文字已複製。請貼到 GitHub 並在該處提交報告。","Reports are public. A GitHub account is required.":"報告為公開內容，需要 GitHub 帳號。","Reset Toolbar":"重設工具列","Resize Part":"調整零件大小","Restore View":"還原檢視","Restore outer boundary":"還原外邊界","Restore the inherited component or physical material appearance":"還原繼承的元件或物理材質外觀","Restore this studio's tools":"還原此工作室的工具","Result":"結果","Retake screenshot":"重新截圖","Reveal Height":"階差高度","Reverse":"反向","Reverse Direction":"反向","Revert":"還原","Revert All Positions":"還原所有位置","Revert Pos.":"還原位置","Revert Position":"還原位置","Review the report and screenshot before opening GitHub.":"開啟 GitHub 前請審閱報告和截圖。","Review your report on GitHub and click Submit new issue to publish it.":"請在 GitHub 上檢閱報告，再按一下 Submit new issue 發佈。","Revolute":"旋轉","Rib Length":"肋長度","Rib Offset":"肋偏移","Rib Thickness":"肋厚度","Ribs":"肋","Right Middle":"右中","Rigid":"剛性","Rim Edge":"輪緣邊","Rim face":"邊緣面","Ring of tools on the right button":"右鍵工具環","Roll Back Here":"回溯到此處","Roll History Marker Here":"將歷程標記滾動到此處","Root radius":"根部圓角半徑","Round":"圓角","Round Bar":"圓棒","Round Tube":"圓管","Rule":"規則","Rule name":"規則名稱","Rules run from top to bottom. Matched drives change effective values.":"規則從上到下依次執行。滿足條件的驅動規則變更有效值。","SECTION":"剖面","SURFACE QUALITY":"曲面品質","Same way":"同方向","Save Rule":"儲存規則","Save View":"儲存檢視","Save screenshot…":"儲存截圖…","Save the study as an animated GIF, seen as the viewport shows it":"按檢視區中的顯示將研究儲存為動畫 GIF","Saved preview. Geometry is being checked before editing.":"已儲存預覽。編輯前正在檢查幾何。","Scale factor":"比例因子","Scene":"場景","Screenshot (optional)":"截圖（可選）","Search":"搜尋","Search commands":"搜尋命令","Search this library":"搜尋此零件庫","Second edge":"第二條邊","Second plane":"第二個平面","Second point":"第二點","Section":"剖面","Section (optional)":"剖面（可選）","Section position":"截面位置","Sections (one sketch each)":"剖面（每個一張草圖）","Select Other":"選取其他","Select Other: hold the left button still on the model (or right-click › Select Other…) to list everything under the cursor; click again on the same spot to select the next thing there. Double-click the middle button to go Home (Preferences › Navigation).":"「選擇其他」：在模型上按住左鍵（或右鍵點擊 › 選擇其他…）列出游標下的所有物件；在同一位置再次點擊可選擇該處的下一個物件。雙擊中鍵轉到主檢視（偏好設定 › 導覽）。","Select Same Look":"選擇相同外觀","Select bodies (a face picks its body)":"選擇實體（點擊面即選擇其所屬實體）","Select bodies or faces instead":"改為選擇實體或面","Select edges":"選取邊","Select points of the sketch being edited":"請選取正在編輯的草圖中的點","Select the centre the pattern turns around first":"請先選取陣列旋轉所繞的中心","Select the curves to offset first":"請先選取要偏移的曲線","Select the mirror line":"請選取鏡射線","Select the sketch curves or points to mirror first":"請先選取要鏡射的草圖曲線或點","Select the sketch curves or points to move first":"請先選取要移動的草圖曲線或點","Select the sketch curves or points to pattern first":"請先選取要陣列的草圖曲線或點","Select the sketch curves or points to scale first":"請先選取要縮放的草圖曲線或點","Select the sketch curves or points to transform first":"請先選取要變換的草圖曲線或點","Selection filter":"選擇篩選","Semantic faces share their appearance across instances.":"語意面在各實例間共享外觀。","Send your report on GitHub":"在 GitHub 上傳送報告","Shaded":"著色","Shape":"形狀","Sheet Rules":"鈑金規則","Show Agent Cursor":"顯示代理游標","Show ghost":"顯示虛影","Show in folder":"在資料夾中顯示","Show the pointer an AI agent moves (#35)":"顯示 AI 代理移動的指標（#35）","Show tool at cursor":"在游標旁顯示工具","Signed axes":"帶符號軸","Size":"大小","Sketch constraints":"草圖拘束條件","Sketch curves":"草圖曲線","Sketch dimensions":"草圖尺寸","Sketch geometry and profiles":"草圖幾何和輪廓","Sketch plane has no body-face attachment.":"草圖平面沒有實體面附著。","Sketch points":"草圖點","Slider":"滑塊","Slot width":"槽寬","Snap to face and edge centres":"吸附到面和邊的中心","SolidCraft cannot submit reports directly. Submit on GitHub; no token is needed in the app.":"SolidCraft 無法直接提交報告。請在 GitHub 上提交；應用程式內不需要權杖。","SolidCraft closed before these designs were saved. Their last autosave can be opened.":"SolidCraft 在這些設計儲存前已關閉。可以開啟它們的上次自動儲存。","Sort A to Z":"A 到 Z 排序","Sort Z to A":"Z 到 A 排序","Spacing 2 must be a non-zero number":"間距 2 必須是非零數字","Spacing must be a non-zero number":"間距必須是非零數字","Specialise":"專用操作","Speed":"速度","Splitting tool":"分割工具","Square":"正方形","Stand it up":"將其立起","Stand it up: a quarter turn about X, as one Move feature you can undo.":"將其立起：繞 X 軸旋轉四分之一週，作為一個可復原的移動特徵。","Stand this assembly up?":"立起此組合件？","Stand this part up?":"立起此零件？","Start angle":"起始角度","Start bulge":"起始鼓度","Start continuity":"起始連續性","Stationary Side":"固定側","Step":"步驟","Steps":"步數","Steps to reproduce (optional)":"重現步驟（可選）","Stitch the kept pieces":"縫合保留的部分","Stitch to both bodies":"縫合到兩個實體","Studio":"工作室","Study":"研究","Style":"樣式","Summary":"摘要","Suppress":"抑制","Suppress Selected Folders":"抑制所選資料夾","Suppressed":"已抑制","Surface":"曲面","Surface, or faces to turn over":"曲面，或要翻轉的面","Surfaces":"曲面","Swap Ends":"交換端點","TRIM":"修剪","Tangent":"相切","Tangent (G1)":"相切 (G1)","Tangent Chain":"相切鏈","Tangent chain":"相切鏈","Tangent to Edge":"與邊相切","Tap drill diameter":"攻牙底孔直徑","Target":"目標","Target Body":"目標實體","Target Face (optional)":"目標面（選用）","Tear":"撕裂","Technical details":"技術詳細資料","The dashed sketch is a saved plane guide. Select a new face to repair the attachment.":"虛線草圖是已儲存的平面引導。選擇一個新面以修復附著。","The design changed. Reopen Change Part Size for the component.":"設計已變更。請為該元件重新開啟「變更零件尺寸」。","The direction must be an axis or a straight sketch curve that lies in the sketch plane":"方向必須是軸，或位於草圖平面內的直線草圖曲線","The mirror line cannot also be mirrored":"鏡射線本身不能再被鏡射","The mirror line must be a straight curve of this sketch, not an origin axis":"鏡射線必須是此草圖中的直線曲線，不能是原點軸","The saved author occurrence is missing. Select a valid author placement before rebinding.":"儲存的作者實例缺失。重新繫結前請選擇有效的作者放置。","Then":"動作","These features will be deleted:":"以下特徵將被刪除：","These features will fail:":"以下特徵將失敗：","Thickness Outside":"外側厚度","Thickness Variation":"厚度變化","Thin":"薄壁","Thin Extrude":"薄壁擠出","Third plane":"第三個平面","Third point":"第三點","This child is shared. Deleting it removes it from every copy of its parent.":"此子項是共享的。刪除它會從其父項的每個副本中移除。","This child is shared. Position changes apply to every copy of its parent.":"此子項是共享的。位置變更會套用到其父項的每個副本。","This component is inside a subassembly placed more than once: aligning it moves it in every placement.":"此元件位於放置了多次的子組合件內：對齊它會使它在每個放置位置中都跟著移動。","This face cannot provide a durable attachment. Choose another face or explicitly use a fixed plane.":"此面無法提供持久附著。請選擇其他面或明確使用固定平面。","This image is not attached to GitHub yet. Copy or save it, then attach it on GitHub.":"此圖片尚未附加到 GitHub。請複製或儲存圖片，再到 GitHub 附加。","Thread depth":"螺紋深度","Thread diameter":"螺紋直徑","Through point":"通過點","To":"至","To Offset":"偏移","To Snap":"目標鎖點","To edges":"終止邊","Toe radius":"趾端圓角半徑","Tolerance":"公差","Too close":"過近","Tool Bodies":"工具實體","Tools":"工具","Tools, clockwise from the top":"工具，從頂部起順時針排列","Top Left":"左上","Top Middle":"上中","Top Right":"右上","Trimming tool (plane, face or curves)":"修剪工具（平面、面或曲線）","Turn off section analysis before exporting the view.":"請關閉截面分析後再匯出檢視。","Type":"類型","Type a distance or an angle to move by":"請輸入要移動的距離或角度","UNTRIM":"取消修剪","Unit":"單位","Unsuppress":"取消抑制","Unsuppress Selected Folders":"取消抑制所選資料夾","Updating the preview":"正在更新預覽","Use active author placement":"使用活動作者放置","Use fixed plane":"使用固定平面","Use saved fixed plane":"使用已儲存的固定平面","Use selected face as fixed plane":"使用所選面作為固定平面","Use the SolidWorks mouse mode":"使用 SolidWorks 滑鼠模式","User Parameters":"使用者參數","VIEW":"檢視","VIEWS":"檢視","Value":"值","Variable Radius":"可變半徑","Velocity":"速度","Vertices":"頂點","View navigator":"檢視導覽器","Volume":"體積","Wall":"壁厚","Wall Location":"壁位置","Wall Thickness":"壁厚度","Web thickness":"腹板厚度","What did you do just before the problem? A short list is enough":"問題發生前您做了哪些操作？簡短列出即可","What did you expect to see?":"您原本預期看到什麼？","What happened?":"發生了什麼事？","When":"條件","Width":"寬度","Will fail":"將失敗","With gestures on, the right button no longer orbits the view: hold it and move to open the ring, then touch a tool's zone. A plain right-click still opens the menu.":"開啟滑鼠手勢後，右鍵不再旋轉檢視：按住右鍵並移動即可開啟工具環，再觸碰某個工具的區域。單純按一下右鍵仍會開啟選單。","X":"X","X Angle":"X 角度","X angle":"X 角度","X distance":"X 距離","Y":"Y","Y Angle":"Y 角度","Y angle":"Y 角度","Y distance":"Y 距離","Z":"Z","Z Angle":"Z 角度","Z Distance":"Z 距離","Z angle":"Z 角度","Z distance":"Z 距離","Zebra":"斑馬紋","`joint` must be an id or a name":"「joint」必須是編號或名稱","`params` must be an object":"「params」必須是物件","`values` must be a list":"「values」必須是清單","a chamfer needs a corner of exactly two lines":"倒角需要恰好由兩條直線構成的角","a file operation is in progress":"正在進行檔案操作","a picked curve is no longer in a sketch":"所選曲線已不在任何草圖中","a picked curve's sketch has not been solved":"所選曲線所在的草圖尚未求解","a picked edge has no points":"所選邊沒有點","a picked edge is gone":"所選邊已不存在","a picked edge's body is gone":"所選邊所屬的實體已不存在","add a key for a joint first":"請先為接頭新增關鍵影格","ai.connected_toast":"SolidCraft 現已可在 {clients} 中使用。請重新啟動它們（設定 > 助理）。","ai.prefs.allow_control":"允許 AI 代理連線（控制通道 / MCP）","ai.prefs.allow_control_note":"僅在本機開放控制通道（127.0.0.1，連接埠 27878 或下一個可用的連接埠）。連線的程式還必須出示一個每次啟動時重新產生、只有您的使用者帳號能讀取的秘密權杖。下次啟動 SolidCraft 時生效。關閉：除非以 --control 啟動 SolidCraft，否則不會監聽任何連接埠。","ai.prefs.availability":"助理控制","ai.prefs.background_commands":"在背景執行代理命令","ai.prefs.connect_apps":"讓此電腦上的 AI 應用程式可以使用 SolidCraft","ai.prefs.connect_apps_note":"SolidCraft 啟動時，會把自己以 MCP 伺服器的形式加入此電腦上找到的 AI 應用程式（OpenCode、Claude Desktop、Claude Code、Cursor、Codex、Gemini CLI、Copilot CLI、Windsurf、Zed、VS Code），讓代理無需任何設定即可使用。只會新增 solidcraft 項目或更新其路徑；您修改過的項目不會被更動，並且會先備份檔案。關閉：會移除它所新增的項目。「說明 > 連接 AI 助理」可手動完成同樣的操作。","ai.prefs.connect_at_start":"SolidCraft 啟動時連線上次使用的代理","ai.prefs.connect_at_start_note":"每次啟動 SolidCraft 時，在背景啟動您上次連線的代理（或預設代理），以便隨時開始對話。以 --control 啟動 SolidCraft 時不會這樣做。若無法連線，助理會顯示「連線失敗」與「重試」按鈕。","ai.prefs.follow_camera":"將相機轉向草圖","ai.prefs.follow_camera_off":"相機自動跟隨已關閉。","ai.prefs.follow_camera_on":"相機會轉向代理建立的草圖。","ai.prefs.intro":"代理、權限，以及其作業的呈現方式。","ai.prefs.make_default":"設為預設","ai.prefs.no_agents":"尚無代理。請新增代理，或重新整理以尋找已安裝的代理。","ai.prefs.no_saved_approvals":"沒有已儲存的核准。","ai.prefs.open_at_start":"SolidCraft 啟動時開啟助理面板","ai.prefs.open_at_start_note":"每次啟動 SolidCraft 時顯示助理面板（或其獨立視窗）。以 --control 啟動 SolidCraft 時不會這樣做。","ai.prefs.override_all_warning":"此代理可能在不詢問的情況下儲存、覆寫、匯出或取代設計。","ai.prefs.permission_all":"全部允許","ai.prefs.permission_all_summary":"可用的 SolidCraft 工具無需詢問即可執行。","ai.prefs.permission_ask":"變更前詢問","ai.prefs.permission_ask_summary":"每次設計變更與檔案操作都需要核准。","ai.prefs.permission_edits":"允許模型編輯","ai.prefs.permission_edits_summary":"模型編輯會自動執行；檔案與破壞性操作仍會詢問。","ai.prefs.permission_scope":"僅適用於 SolidCraft 工具。代理的終端機與檔案編輯使用其自身的權限。","ai.prefs.pointer_preview_hidden":"指標已隱藏","ai.prefs.pointer_preview_speed":"代理指標 · {speed}","ai.prefs.pointer_speed":"移動速度","ai.prefs.privacy_note":"對話只會傳送給您所選的代理或端點。端點金鑰儲存在系統鑰匙圈中。","ai.prefs.show_pointer":"顯示代理指標","ai.prefs.turn_limit_hint":"助理針對一則訊息可呼叫的變更設計工具次數上限。","angle, height":"角度、高度","appearance.dielectric_ior":"介電折射率","appearance.metallic":"金屬度","appearance.only_available":"僅顯示可用外觀","appearance.pbr_help":"在彩現工作區或產品 PNG 中檢視此表面。不支援折射或透射。","appearance.pbr_opaque":"不透明 PBR","appearance.roughness":"粗糙度","appearance.surface_response":"表面反應","at the face":"在面上","bom.group_children":"子零件併入所屬零件的列","browser.body_name":"實體{number}","browser.calibrate_click_a":"按一下影像以指定點 A，或輸入其座標。","browser.calibrate_click_b":"按一下影像以指定點 B，或輸入其座標。","browser.calibrate_title":"校準：{name}","browser.capture_many":"{count} 個元件已移動，但尚未擷取其位置。","browser.capture_note":"「擷取位置」保留新位置；「還原位置」還原原先的位置。","browser.capture_one":"一個元件已移動，但尚未擷取其位置。","browser.component_name":"元件{number}","browser.edit_canvas_title":"編輯畫布：{name}","browser.edit_point_cloud_title":"編輯點雲：{name}","browser.move_title":"移動：{name}","browser.parameters":"