eview the report and screenshot before opening GitHub.":"Controleer het rapport en de schermafbeelding voordat u GitHub opent.","Review your report on GitHub and click Submit new issue to publish it.":"Controleer uw rapport op GitHub en klik op Submit new issue om het te publiceren.","Revolute":"Draaiend","Rib Length":"Riblengte","Rib Offset":"Riboffset","Rib Thickness":"Ribdikte","Ribs":"Ribben","Right Middle":"Midden rechts","Rigid":"Star","Rim Edge":"Rand van rand","Rim face":"Randvlak","Ring of tools on the right button":"Ring van gereedschappen op de rechtermuisknop","Roll Back Here":"Hier terugdraaien","Roll History Marker Here":"Terugdraaimarkering hier plaatsen","Root radius":"Wortelstraal","Round":"Afronden","Round Bar":"Ronde staaf","Round Tube":"Ronde buis","Rule":"Regel","Rule name":"Regelnaam","Rules run from top to bottom. Matched drives change effective values.":"Regels worden van boven naar beneden uitgevoerd. Overeenkomende aandrijvingen wijzigen de effectieve waarden.","SECTION":"DOORSNEDE","SURFACE QUALITY":"OPPERVLAKTEKWALITEIT","Same way":"Zelfde richting","Save Rule":"Regel opslaan","Save View":"Weergave opslaan","Save screenshot…":"Schermafbeelding opslaan…","Save the study as an animated GIF, seen as the viewport shows it":"De studie opslaan als geanimeerde GIF, zoals de viewport deze toont","Saved preview. Geometry is being checked before editing.":"Voorbeeld opgeslagen. De geometrie wordt gecontroleerd voordat u bewerkt.","Scale factor":"Schaalfactor","Scene":"Scène","Screenshot (optional)":"Schermafbeelding (optioneel)","Search":"Zoeken","Search commands":"Opdrachten zoeken","Search this library":"Deze bibliotheek doorzoeken","Second edge":"Tweede rand","Second plane":"Tweede vlak","Second point":"Tweede punt","Section":"Doorsnede","Section (optional)":"Doorsnede (optioneel)","Section position":"Positie van de doorsnede","Sections (one sketch each)":"Doorsneden (één schets per doorsnede)","Select Other":"Overige selecteren","Select Other: 