 selectie. Sleep naar het model. Als niets is geselecteerd, activeert een klik Verf.","render.stage_panels.apply":"Toepassen","render.stage_panels.apply_studio":"Studio toepassen","render.stage_panels.badge_blocked":"geblokkeerd","render.stage_panels.badge_native":"systeemeigen","render.stage_panels.badge_projection":"projectie","render.stage_panels.badge_reference":"referentie","render.stage_panels.badge_specification":"alleen specificatie","render.stage_panels.candidate_summary":"Kandidaten: {count} waarden met bronvermelding. Klasse en afwerking moeten worden gecontroleerd.","render.stage_panels.captured_bounds":"Vastgelegde scènegrenzen gebruiken","render.stage_panels.centre":"Midden","render.stage_panels.depth":"diepte","render.stage_panels.environments":"Omgevingen","render.stage_panels.extent":"Omvang","render.stage_panels.fit_save":"Passend maken en opslaan","render.stage_panels.gpu_required":"Vereist GPU-pathtracing","render.stage_panels.keep":"Behouden","render.stage_panels.kept":"Behoudt","render.stage_panels.kept_fields":"Camera, sampling, afmetingen, optische bindingen, CAD-geometrie en technische eigenschappen.","render.stage_panels.kept_quality":"Methode, camera, verlichting, omgeving, opstelling, optiek, belichting en tonemapping.","render.stage_panels.mine":"Mijn","render.stage_panels.mine_pending":"Het opslaan van persoonlijke studio's wordt nog niet ondersteund.","render.stage_panels.omits":"Laat weg","render.stage_panels.paint_pending":"Verf en toewijzen door te slepen worden nog niet ondersteund. Kies een doel om een look toe te passen.","render.stage_panels.partial_reference":"Kandidaten: alleen waarden met bron; controleer klasse, conditie en bronnen. Onbekende waarden blijven onbekend.","render.stage_panels.plane":"Vlak","render.stage_panels.prepare_plan":"Aanmaakplan voorbereiden","render.stage_panels.projects":"Projecten","render.stage_panels.quality_ack":"Ik erken het vaste budget en de weggelaten onderdelen","render.stage_panels.quality_o