alues must be numbers or expressions":"waarden moeten getallen of expressies zijn","view.auto_ortho_faces":"Perspectief tijdens roteren, orthogonaal op vlakken","view.render_inspector":"Renderinspecteur","web.files.insert_drawings_hint":"CAD-bestanden, meshes, DXF of SVG in het geopende ontwerp","web.files.insert_stored_drawings_hint":"In het geopende ontwerp (CAD-bestanden, meshes, DXF, SVG)","web.open_full":"Openen in SolidCraft","web.open_link":"Gekoppeld ontwerp openen?","web.open_link_confirm":"Er zijn niet-opgeslagen wijzigingen. Het gekoppelde ontwerp in een nieuw tabblad openen?","↑ ↓ choose · Enter / Tab complete · Esc dismiss":"↑ ↓ kiezen · Enter / Tab aanvullen · Esc sluiten","↑ ↓ choose · Enter applies what you typed · Esc dismiss":"↑ ↓ kiezen · Enter past toe wat je typte · Esc sluiten","⌘Enter continues on GitHub.":"⌘Enter gaat verder op GitHub."}msBahasa Melayu{"(active rule)":"(peraturan aktif)","0 turns it off":"0 untuk matikan","1. Open GitHub draft below, then paste the report copied to your clipboard.":"1. Buka draf GitHub di bawah, kemudian tampal laporan yang disalin ke papan klip anda.","1. Open GitHub draft below. Your title and report will be filled in.":"1. Buka draf GitHub di bawah. Tajuk dan laporan anda akan diisi secara automatik.","2. Attach your screenshot: copy and paste it, or save and upload the PNG.":"2. Lampirkan tangkapan skrin anda: salin dan tampal, atau simpan dan muat naik PNG.","2D":"2D","3. Click Submit new issue on GitHub to send your report.":"3. Klik Submit new issue di GitHub untuk menghantar laporan anda.","A Single hole snaps to the middle of its face and to the centres of its round edges":"Lubang Tunggal melekap ke tengah mukanya dan ke pusat tepi bulatnya","A new configuration, a copy of the active one":"Konfigurasi baharu, salinan konfigurasi aktif","A placed Single hole has a handle to drag it, and picking its face again moves the hole there instead of taking it out":"Lubang Tunggal yang diletakkan mempunyai pemegang untuk menyeretnya, dan memilih mukanya sekali lagi akan mengalihkan lubang ke situ dan bukannya mengeluarkannya","A short title for the problem (optional)":"Tajuk ringkas untuk masalah (pilihan)","ARRANGE":"SUSUN","About SolidCraft":"Tentang SolidCraft","Acceleration":"Pecutan","Access":"Akses","Actions":"Tindakan","Active":"Aktif","Active rule":"Peraturan aktif","Add":"Tambah","Add Column":"Tambah Lajur","Add Key":"Tambah Bingkai Utama","Add Mid Radius":"Tambah Jejari Tengah","Add Row":"Tambah Baris","Add a tool":"Tambah alat","Add all bodies":"Tambah semua jasad","Add bend":"Tambah lenturan","Add condition":"Tambah syarat","Add or edit rule":"Tambah atau sunting peraturan","Add to New Folder":"Tambah ke Folder Baharu","Add visible bodies":"Tambah jasad yang kelihatan","Advanced":"Lanjutan","Against":"Bertentangan","Alignment":"Penjajaran","All Lines":"Semua Garis","All Sketch Points":"Semua Titik Lakaran","All components":"Semua komponen","All open designs":"Semua reka bentuk terbuka","Allowed expressions, separated by semicolons":"Ungkapan yang dibenarkan, dipisahkan dengan titik koma","Also deletes":"Turut memadam","Also place them from the origin (fully constrained)":"Letakkan juga dari asalan (terkekang penuh)","Anchor":"Sauh","Angle 2":"Sudut 2","Angle Display":"Paparan Sudut","Animate":"Animasikan","Another bend on the far edge of the last flange":"Satu lagi lenturan pada tepi jauh bebibir terakhir","App/system information and command settings are included. Review private details before sharing.":"Maklumat apl/sistem dan tetapan perintah disertakan. Semak butiran peribadi sebelum berkongsi.","Appearance name":"Nama penampilan","Applied Radius":"Jejari Digunakan","Apply To":"Gunakan Pada","Apply library appearance":"Gunakan penampilan koleksi","Apply to selection":"Gunakan pada pilihan","Apply your appearance first. Exports assigned appearances and materials created in this design.":"Guna penampilan anda dahulu. Mengeksport penampilan yang ditetapkan dan bahan yang dicipta dalam reka bentuk ini.","Arc length":"Panjang lengkok","Area":"Luas","As Picked":"Seperti Dipilih","As-Built":"Seperti Dibina","Assign Rule":"Tetapkan Peraturan","Attachment":"Pautan","BLEND SURFACE":"PERMUKAAN GAUNAN","BOUNDARY SURFACE":"PERMUKAAN SEMPADAN","BROWSER":"PELAYAR","Back to the original order":"Kembali ke susunan asal","Ball":"Bebola","Bar":"Bar","Base Center":"Pusat Tapak","Base Height":"Ketinggian Tapak","Bend":"Lenturan","Bend Edges":"Tepi Lenturan","Bend Line":"Garis Lenturan","Bend Line Position":"Kedudukan Garis Lenturan","Bend Position":"Kedudukan Lenturan","Bend Radius":"Jejari Lenturan","Bend Table":"Jadual Lenturan","Bends":"Lenturan","Bodies":"Jasad","Bodies (optional)":"Jasad (pilihan)","Body":"Jasad","Body (last if none)":"Jasad (yang terakhir jika tiada)","Body to split":"Jasad untuk dibelah","Body, or faces to take out":"Jasad, atau muka untuk dikeluarkan","Both":"Kedua-duanya","Bottom Left":"Bawah Kiri","Bottom Middle":"Bawah Tengah","Bottom Right":"Bawah Kanan","Boundary":"Sempadan","Bounding box":"Kotak pembatas","CHECK":"SEMAK","COMPONENTS":"KOMPONEN","CONFIGURATIONS":"KONFIGURASI","CONSTRAIN":"KEKANG","CONTACT":"SENTUHAN","CONVERT":"TUKAR","CSV or JSON: updates existing parameters, adds new ones":"CSV atau JSON: kemas kini parameter lama, tambah yang baharu","Capture All Positions":"Rakam Semua Kedudukan","Capture Pos.":"Rakam Kedud.","Catch Depth":"Kedalaman Cangkuk","Catch Direction":"Arah Cangkuk","Catch Length":"Panjang Cangkuk","Cells":"Sel","Center X":"Pusat X","Center Y":"Pusat Y","Center of mass":"Pusat jisim","Centre to centre":"Pusat ke pusat","Centroid":"Sentroid","Chamfer Type":"Jenis Serong","Channel":"Saluran","Check collisions":"Semak perlanggaran","Checked":"Disemak","Choose Variable radius or Spline in Type.":"Pilih Jejari berubah atau Splin dalam Jenis.","Choose a new plane. Sketch geometry and dimensions stay unchanged in its two-dimensional coordinates.":"Pilih satah baharu. Geometri dan dimensi lakaran dikekalkan dalam koordinat dua dimensi lakaran tersebut.","Choose…":"Pilih…","Circle center":"Pusat bulatan","Circle or sphere":"Bulatan atau sfera","Circular":"Bulat","Circumference":"Lilitan","Clockwise":"Ikut arah jam","Close draft":"Tutup draf","Collapse":"Ringkaskan","Collisions":"Perlanggaran","Colour":"Warna","Command":"Perintah","Comment":"Ulasan","Component 1":"Komponen 1","Component 2":"Komponen 2","Component1":"Komponen1","Components":"Komponen","Config Table":"Jadual Konfigurasi","Configuration":"Konfigurasi","Configuration rules":"Peraturan konfigurasi","Constant radius":"Jejari malar","Contact":"Sentuhan","Contact Sets":"Set Sentuhan","Contact sets":"Set sentuhan","Continue on GitHub":"Teruskan di GitHub","Continuity":"Keselanjaran","Control Radius":"Jejari Kawalan","Copies the definition only. Assign it from Physical Material when ready.":"Menyalin takrifan sahaja. Tetapkan daripada Bahan Fizikal apabila sedia.","Copy Error Message":"Salin Mesej Ralat","Copy Warning Message":"Salin Mesej Amaran","Copy all licences":"Salin semua lesen","Copy diagnostic information":"Salin maklumat diagnostik","Copy report":"Salin laporan","Copy screenshot":"Salin tangkapan skrin","Corner Relief":"Pelega Sudut","Corner Relief Shape":"Bentuk Pelega Sudut","Corner radius":"Jejari sudut","Counterbore depth":"Kedalaman lubang benam rata","Counterbore Ø":"Lubang Benam Rata Ø","Countersink angle":"Sudut lubang benam tirus","Countersink Ø":"Lubang Benam Tirus Ø","Create Hole":"Cipta Lubang","Create Issue — review draft":"Cipta Isu — semak draf","Create Issue…":"Cipta Isu…","Cross curves":"Lengkung silang","Ctrl+Enter continues on GitHub.":"Ctrl+Enter meneruskan di GitHub.","Cube":"Kubus","Current orthographic view (1:1 mm)":"Pandangan ortografik semasa (1:1 mm)","Current perspective view":"Pandangan perspektif semasa","Current plane":"Satah semasa","Curv. Comb":"Sisir Kelen.","Curvature (G2)":"Kelengkungan (G2)","Curvature change (G3)":"Perubahan kelengkungan (G3)","Custom":"Tersuai","Customize Toolbar":"Sesuaikan Bar Alat","Customize…":"Suaikan…","Cylindrical":"Silinder","Cylindrical face":"Muka silinder","Deboss":"Tenggelamkan","Delete":"Padam","Delete Folders and Features…":"Padam Folder dan Ciri…","Delete Selected Features…":"Padam Ciri Terpilih…","Delete Selected Folders":"Padam Folder Terpilih","Delete all":"Padam semua","Delete rule":"Padam peraturan","Delete the row":"Padam baris","Delete the set":"Padam set","Density":"Ketumpatan","Dependents":"Bergantung","Describe the problem you saw":"Huraikan masalah yang anda lihat","Describe what happened before continuing.":"Huraikan apa yang berlaku sebelum meneruskan.","Designs you open or save appear here.":"Reka bentuk dibuka atau disimpan ada di sini.","Determined by To Object. Choose Angle to edit the angular extent.":"Ditentukan oleh tetapan Ke Objek. Pilih Sudut untuk mengubah julat sudut.","Diameter":"Diameter","Did this assembly open the wrong way up?":"Adakah pemasangan ini dibuka dengan orientasi yang salah?","Did this part open the wrong way up?":"Adakah bahagian ini dibuka dengan orientasi yang salah?","Dimension new shapes":"Dimensikan bentuk baharu","Direction":"Arah","Discard":"Buang","Distance":"Jarak","Distance 1":"Jarak 1","Do not export hidden edges":"Jangan eksport tepi tersembunyi","Don't ask again":"Jangan tanya lagi","Double-click to rename":"Klik dua kali untuk tukar nama","Double-clicking the middle button in the view: Home (the home view, framing what is shown), Fit (frame what is shown, keeping the orientation) or nothing":"Klik dua kali butang tengah: Utama (pandangan utama, muatkan objek), Muatkan (muatkan objek, kekalkan orientasi) atau tiada tindakan","Drag to move the boss across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"Seret untuk mengalihkan bonggol merentasi model. Ia melekap pada titik lakaran di muka.","Drag to move the hole; click to remove it":"Seret untuk mengalihkan lubang; klik untuk membuangnya","Drag to move the rest across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"Seret untuk mengalihkan penyokong merentasi model. Ia melekap pada titik lakaran di muka.","Drag to move the snap fit across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"Seret untuk mengalihkan sambungan sentap merentasi model. Ia melekap pada titik lakaran di muka.","Drag to point the catch in another direction.":"Seret untuk menghalakan cangkuk ke arah lain.","Drag to turn the rest in 5° steps. Hold Alt or Ctrl to turn it freely.":"Seret untuk memutar penyokong dalam langkah 5°. Tahan Alt atau Ctrl untuk memutarnya dengan bebas.","Drive Joint":"Gerakkan Sendi","Duration":"Tempoh","Each new shape is also dimensioned from the sketch origin until nothing of it is left free. A shape already attached to the origin or to placed geometry gets none.":"Setiap bentuk baharu juga didimensikan dari asalan lakaran sehingga tiada yang bebas. Bentuk yang sudah terikat pada asalan atau geometri yang diletakkan tidak mendapat apa-apa.","Each shape you draw gets all its dimensions, at the sizes you drew (typed values win). A size the sketch already sets is left out.":"Setiap bentuk yang anda lukis mendapat semua dimensinya pada saiz yang dilukis (nilai yang ditaip diutamakan). Saiz yang sudah ditetapkan oleh lakaran ditinggalkan.","Edge":"Tepi","Edges":"Tepi","Edit":"Sunting","Edit Profile Sketch":"Sunting Lakaran Profil","Edit shortcuts":"Sunting pintasan","Enable rule":"Aktifkan peraturan","Enabled":"Diaktifkan","End Radius":"Jejari Akhir","End bulge":"Bonjolan hujung","End continuity":"Keselanjaran hujung","Equal Distance":"Jarak Sama","Expand":"Kembangkan","Expected result (optional)":"Hasil yang dijangka (pilihan)","Explode":"Leraikan","Explode Text":"Leraikan Teks","Export Animation…":"Eksport Animasi…","Export Bend Table…":"Eksport Jadual Lenturan…","Export CSV…":"Eksport CSV…","Export Current View as DXF":"Eksport Pandangan Semasa sebagai DXF","Export Current View as DXF…":"Eksport Pandangan Semasa sebagai DXF…","