utral","New":"Baharu","New Comp.":"Komp. Baharu","New Sketch":"Lakaran Baharu","New rule…":"Peraturan baharu…","New study":"Kajian baharu","No crash reports.":"Tiada laporan ranap.","No matching appearance presets.":"Tiada pratetap penampilan yang sepadan.","No matching appearances":"Tiada penampilan yang sepadan","No matching physical materials.":"Tiada bahan fizikal yang sepadan.","No visible bodies or sketches to export.":"Tiada jasad atau lakaran kelihatan untuk dieksport.","Nominal Radius":"Jejari Nominal","Nominal diameter":"Diameter nominal","None":"Tiada","Not available yet":"Belum tersedia","Not saved yet":"Belum disimpan","Notch":"Takuk","OUTPUT":"KELUARAN","Of":"Dari","On your computer":"Pada komputer anda","Opacity":"Kelegapan","Open GitHub":"Buka GitHub","Open GitHub draft":"Buka draf GitHub","Open GitHub issue form":"Buka borang isu GitHub","Open bodies (no volume)":"Jasad terbuka (tiada isi padu)","Open library...":"Buka koleksi...","Open local libraries in the desktop app. You can export this design's library here.":"Buka koleksi setempat dalam aplikasi desktop. Anda boleh mengeksport koleksi reka bentuk ini di sini.","Open surface — no volume":"Permukaan terbuka — tiada isi padu","Open-source parametric 3D CAD in Rust. Licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0.":"CAD 3D parametrik sumber terbuka dalam Rust. Lesen MIT OR Apache-2.0.","Opens your browser and copies the report text for you to paste into GitHub.":"Membuka pelayar anda dan menyalin teks laporan untuk anda tampal ke dalam GitHub.","Opens your browser and copies the report text. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"Membuka pelayar anda dan menyalin teks laporan. Semak dan hantar laporan anda di GitHub.","Opens your browser. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"Membuka pelayar anda. Semak dan hantar laporan anda di GitHub.","Operator":"Operator","Orbit (right drag)":"Orbit (seret kanan)","Other side":"Sebelah lagi","Other surface (mutual trim)":"Permukaan lain (pangkas bersama)","Other way":"Arah bertentangan","Outer Sharp":"Tajam Luar","Outer radius":"Jejari luar","Outside":"Luar","Overall length":"Panjang keseluruhan","Param. Graph":"Graf Param.","Parameter":"Parameter","Part length must be greater than zero and at most 2000 mm":"Panjang bahagian mestilah lebih besar daripada sifar dan paling banyak 2000 mm","Parts":"Bahagian","Pass through":"Tembus","Path":"Laluan","Pattern":"Corak","Per Edge":"Setiap Tepi","Physical material definitions":"Takrifan bahan fizikal","Pick a part size":"Pilih saiz bahagian","Pick the tool bodies":"Pilih jasad alat","Picked":"Dipilih","Picked point":"Titik yang dipilih","Pin-slot":"Pin-slot","Pitch":"Pic","Pivot":"Pangsi","Place at the origin instead":"Letak di titik asal","Planar":"Satah","Plastic Rules":"Peraturan Plastik","Play the joint's motion in the view":"Mainkan gerakan sendi dalam paparan","Playback":"Main balik","Plot":"Plot","Point on line":"Titik pada garis","Point on plane":"Titik pada satah","Position":"Kedudukan","Position (0 to 1)":"Kedudukan (0 hingga 1)","Position (G0)":"Kedudukan (G0)","Position along the edge, 0 at the start end, 1 at the other":"Kedudukan pada tepi: 0 di hujung mula, 1 di hujung satu lagi","Preferences › Design turns the offer back on":"Aktifkan semula di Tetapan › Reka Bentuk","Preview":"Pratonton","Preview Row":"Pratonton Baris","Preview leaves the current design unchanged.":"Pratonton tidak mengubah reka bentuk semasa.","Profile / Edges":"Profil / Tepi","Profiles or curves":"Profil atau lengkung","Profiles/Curves":"Profil/Lengkung","Quantity":"Kuantiti","Quantity must be at least 2":"Kuantiti mestilah sekurang-kurangnya 2","RECENT":"TERKINI","REFERENCE":"RUJUKAN","RULED SURFACE":"PERMUKAAN BERGARIS","RULES":"PERATURAN","Radius":"Jejari","Radius Fit":"Padanan Jejari","Ratio":"Nisbah","Read-only list: shortcuts can't be changed here.":"Senarai baca sahaja: pintasan tidak boleh diubah di sini.","Reattach selected face":"Paut semula muka dipilih","Recover":"Pulihkan","Recover unsaved design?":"Pulihkan reka bentuk belum disimpan?","Rectangular":"Segi empat tepat","Rectangular Tube":"Tiub Segi Empat Tepat","Reference face":"Muka rujukan","Relief Depth":"Kedalaman Pelepasan","Relief Width":"Lebar Pelepasan","Remove Tools":"Buang Alat","Remove condition":"Buang syarat","Remove from Folder":"Buang daripada Folder","Remove from list":"Buang daripada senarai","Remove override":"Buang penggantian","Remove private design details or paths before sharing.":"Buang butiran peribadi reka bentuk atau laluan fail sebelum berkongsi.","Remove screenshot":"Buang tangkapan skrin","Remove the column":"Buang lajur","Remove the track":"Buang trek","Remove this bend":"Buang lenturan ini","Remove this point":"Buang titik ini","Rename Feature":"Tukar Nama Ciri","Rename Folder":"Tukar Nama Folder","Render Stage":"Pentas Render","Reopen designs":"Buka semula reka bentuk","Reopen the designs that were open when SolidCraft was last closed":"Buka semula reka bentuk yang terbuka semasa SolidCraft ditutup kali terakhir","Replace existing library file":"Gantikan fail koleksi sedia ada","Report a bug — review a screenshot and open a GitHub draft":"Laporkan pepijat — semak tangkapan skrin dan buka draf GitHub","Report copied. Keep this text to submit on GitHub when you are online.":"Laporan disalin. Simpan teks ini untuk dihantar di GitHub apabila anda dalam talian.","Report text copied. Paste it into GitHub and submit your report there.":"Teks laporan disalin. Tampalkannya ke dalam GitHub dan hantar laporan anda di sana.","Reports are public. A GitHub account is required.":"Laporan bersifat awam. Akaun GitHub diperlukan.","Reset Toolbar":"Set Semula Bar Alat","Resize Part":"Ubah Saiz Bahagian","Restore View":"Pulihkan Pandangan","Restore outer boundary":"Pulihkan sempadan luar","Restore the inherited component or physical material appearance":"Pulihkan penampilan yang diwarisi daripada komponen atau bahan fizikal","Restore this studio's tools":"Pulihkan alat studio ini","Result":"Hasil","Retake screenshot":"Tangkap semula","Reveal Height":"Ketinggian Terdedah","Reverse":"Songsangkan","Reverse Direction":"Songsangkan Arah","Revert":"Kembalikan","Revert All Positions":"Kembalikan Semua Kedudukan","Revert Pos.":"Kembalikan Kedud.","Revert Position":"Kembalikan Kedudukan","Review the report and screenshot before opening GitHub.":"Semak laporan dan tangkapan skrin sebelum membuka GitHub.","Review your report on GitHub and click Submit new issue to publish it.":"Semak laporan anda di GitHub dan klik Submit new issue untuk menerbitkannya.","Revolute":"Berputar","Rib Length":"Panjang Rusuk","Rib Offset":"Ofset Rusuk","Rib Thickness":"Ketebalan Rusuk","Ribs":"Rusuk","Right Middle":"Tengah Kanan","Rigid":"Tegar","Rim Edge":"Tepi Bibir","Rim face":"Muka bibir","Ring of tools on the right button":"Cincin alat pada butang kanan","Roll Back Here":"Undur ke Sini","Roll History Marker Here":"Alih Penanda Sejarah ke Sini","Root radius":"Jejari akar","Round":"Bulat","Round Bar":"Bar Bulat","Round Tube":"Tiub Bulat","Rule":"Peraturan","Rule name":"Nama peraturan","Rules run from top to bottom. Matched drives change effective values.":"Peraturan dijalankan dari atas ke bawah. Pemacu yang sepadan mengubah nilai berkesan.","SECTION":"KERATAN","SURFACE QUALITY":"KUALITI PERMUKAAN","Same way":"Arah sama","Save Rule":"Simpan Peraturan","Save View":"Simpan Pandangan","Save screenshot…":"Simpan tangkapan skrin…","Save the study as an animated GIF, seen as the viewport shows it":"Simpan kajian sebagai GIF beranimasi mengikut paparan","Saved preview. Geometry is being checked before editing.":"Pratonton disimpan. Geometri disemak sebelum disunting.","Scale factor":"Faktor skala","Scene":"Adegan","Screenshot (optional)":"Tangkapan skrin (pilihan)","Search":"Cari","Search commands":"Cari arahan","Search this library":"Cari dalam koleksi ini","Second edge":"Tepi kedua","Second plane":"Satah kedua","Second point":"Titik kedua","Section":"Keratan","Section (optional)":"Keratan (pilihan)","Section position":"Kedudukan keratan","Sections (one sketch each)":"Keratan (satu lakaran setiap satu)","Select Other":"Pilih Yang Lain","Select Other: hold the left button still on the model (or right-click › Select Other…) to list everything under the cursor; click again on the same spot to select the next thing there. Double-click the middle button to go Home (Preferences › Navigation).":"Pilih Lain: tahan butang kiri pada model tanpa bergerak (atau klik kanan › Pilih Lain…) untuk senarai objek di bawah kursor. Klik tempat sama untuk objek seterusnya. Klik dua kali butang tengah untuk ke Utama (Tetapan › Navigasi).","Select Same Look":"Pilih Rupa Sama","Select bodies (a face picks its body)":"Pilih jasad (klik muka untuk pilih jasadnya)","Select bodies or faces instead":"Pilih jasad atau muka","Select edges":"Pilih tepi","Select points of the sketch being edited":"Pilih titik bagi lakaran yang sedang disunting","Select the centre the pattern turns around first":"Pilih pusat putaran corak dahulu","Select the curves to offset first":"Pilih lengkung yang hendak diofset dahulu","Select the mirror line":"Pilih garis cermin","Select the sketch curves or points to mirror first":"Pilih lengkung atau titik lakaran yang hendak dicermin dahulu","Select the sketch curves or points to move first":"Pilih lengkung atau titik lakaran yang hendak dialihkan dahulu","Select the sketch curves or points to pattern first":"Pilih lengkung atau titik lakaran yang hendak dicorakkan dahulu","Select the sketch curves or points to scale first":"Pilih lengkung atau titik lakaran yang hendak diskalakan dahulu","Select the sketch curves or points to transform first":"Pilih lengkung atau titik lakaran yang hendak ditransformasikan dahulu","Selection filter":"Penapis pilihan","Semantic faces share their appearance across instances.":"Muka semantik berkongsi penampilan pada semua salinan.","Send your report on GitHub":"Hantar laporan anda di GitHub","Shaded":"Berbayang","Shape":"Bentuk","Sheet Rules":"Peraturan Kepingan","Show Agent Cursor":"Papar Kursor Ejen","Show ghost":"Papar imej bayang","Show in folder":"Papar dalam folder","Show the pointer an AI agent moves (#35)":"Papar penuding yang digerakkan oleh ejen AI (#35)","Show tool at cursor":"Tunjukkan alat di sebelah kursor","Signed axes":"Paksi bertanda","Size":"Saiz","Sketch constraints":"Kekangan lakaran","Sketch curves":"Lengkung lakaran","Sketch dimensions":"Dimensi lakaran","Sketch geometry and profiles":"Geometri dan profil lakaran","Sketch plane has no body-face attachment.":"Satah lakaran tiada pautan ke muka jasad.","Sketch points":"Titik lakaran","Slider":"Gelangsar","Slot width":"Lebar slot","Snap to face and edge centres":"Lekap pada pusat muka dan tepi","SolidCraft cannot submit reports directly. Submit on GitHub; no token is needed in the app.":"SolidCraft tidak dapat menghantar laporan secara terus. Hantar di GitHub; tiada token diperlukan dalam aplikasi.","SolidCraft closed before these designs were saved. Their last autosave can be opened.":"SolidCraft ditutup sebelum reka bentuk disimpan. Buka simpanan automatik terakhirnya.","Sort A to Z":"Isih A hingga Z","Sort Z to A":"Isih Z hingga A","Spacing 2 must be a non-zero number":"Selang 2 mestilah nombor bukan sifar","Spacing must be a non-zero number":"Selang mestilah nombor bukan sifar","Specialise":"Khususkan","Speed":"Kelajuan","Splitting tool":"Alat pembelah","Square":"Segi empat sama","Stand it up":"Tegakkan","Stand it up: a quarter turn about X, as one Move feature you can undo.":"Tegakkan: suku putaran pada X, satu ciri Alih yang boleh dibatalkan.","Stand this assembly up?":"Tegakkan pemasangan ini?","Stand this part up?":"Tegakkan bahagian ini?","Start angle":"Sudut mula","Start bulge":"Bonjolan permulaan","Start continuity":"Keselanjaran permulaan","Stationary Side":"Sisi Pegun","Step":"Langkah","Steps":"Langkah","Steps to reproduce (optional)":"Langkah untuk menghasilkan semula (pilihan)","Stitch the kept pieces":"Cantum kepingan yang dikekalkan","Stitch to both bodies":"Cantum pada kedua-dua jasad","Studio":"Studio","Study":"Kajian","Style":"Gaya","Summary":"Ringkasan","Suppress":"Nyahaktifkan","Suppress Selected Folders":"Nyahaktifkan Folder Terpilih","Suppressed":"Dinyahaktifkan","Surface":"Permukaan","Surface, or faces to turn over":"Permukaan, atau muka untuk diterbalikkan","Surfaces":"Permukaan","Swap Ends":"Tukar Hujung","TRIM":"PANGKAS","Tangent":"Tangen","Tangent (G1)":"Tangen (G1)","Tangent Chain":"Rantaian Tangen","Tangent chain":"Rantaian tangen","Tangent to Edge":"Tangen pada Tepi","Tap drill diameter":"Diameter gerudi tap","Target":"Sasaran","Target Body":"Jasad Sasaran","Target Face (optional)":"Muka Sasaran (pilihan)","Tear":"Koyakan","Technical details":"Butiran teknikal","The dashed sketch is a saved plane guide. Select a new face to repair the attachment.":"Lakaran putus-putus ialah panduan satah disimpan. Pilih muka baharu untuk baiki pautan.","The design changed. Reopen Change Part Size for the component.":"Reka bentuk telah berubah. Buka semula Tukar Saiz Bahagian untuk komponen itu.","The direction must be an axis or a straight sketch curve that lies in the sketch plane":"Arah mestilah paksi atau lengkung lakaran lurus yang terletak pada satah lakaran","The mirror line cannot also be mirrored":"Garis cermin tidak boleh turut dicerminkan","The mirror line must be a straight curve of this sketch, not an origin axis":"Garis cermin mestilah lengkung lurus bagi lakaran ini, bukan paksi titik asal","The saved author occurrence is missing. Select a valid author placement before rebinding.":"Salinan asal komponen lakaran tiada. Pilih penempatan komponen yang sah sebelum paut semula.","Then":"Kemudian","These features will be deleted:":"Ciri-ciri berikut akan dipadam:","These features will fail:":"Ciri-ciri berikut akan gagal:","Thickness Outside":"Ketebalan Luar","Thickness Variation":"Variasi Ketebalan","Thin":"Nipis","Thin Extrude":"Penyemperitan Nipis","Third plane":"Satah ketiga","Third point":"Titik ketiga","This child is shared. Deleting it removes it from every copy of its parent.":"Komponen anak dikongsi. Jika dipadam, semua salinan induk turut kehilangannya.","This child is shared. Position changes apply to every copy of its parent.":"Komponen anak dikongsi. Kedudukan berubah pada semua salinan induk.","This component is inside a subassembly placed more than once: aligning it moves it in every placement.":"Komponen ini berada dalam subpemasangan yang diletakkan lebih daripada sekali: menjajarkannya akan mengalihkannya dalam setiap penempatan.","This face cannot provide a durable attachment. Choose another face or explicitly use a fixed plane.":"Muka ini tidak dapat kekalkan pautan. Pilih muka lain atau gunakan satah tetap.","This image is not attached to GitHub yet. Copy or save it, then attach it on GitHub.":"Imej ini belum dilampirkan pada GitHub. Salin atau simpannya, kemudian lampirkan di GitHub.","Thread depth":"Kedalaman bebenang","Thread diameter":"Diameter bebenang","Through point":"Melalui titik","To":"Ke","To Offset":"Ke Ofset","To Snap":"Ke Lekapan","To edges":"Ke tepi","Toe radius":"Jejari hujung","Tolerance":"Toleransi","Too close":"Terlalu dekat","Tool Bodies":"Jasad Alat","Tools":"Alat","Tools, clockwise from the top":"Alat, ikut arah jam dari atas","Top Left":"Atas Kiri","Top Middle":"Tengah Atas","Top Right":"Atas Kanan","Trimming tool (plane, face or curves)":"Alat pemangkas (satah, muka atau lengkung)","Turn off section analysis before exporting the view.":"Matikan analisis keratan sebelum mengeksport pandangan.","Type":"Jenis","Type a distance or an angle to move by":"Taip jarak atau sudut untuk mengalihkan","UNTRIM":"NYAHPANGKAS","Unit":"Unit","Unsuppress":"Aktifkan Semula","Unsuppress Selected Folders":"Aktifkan Semula Folder Terpilih","Updating the preview":"Mengemas kini pratonton","Use active author placement":"Guna penempatan komponen aktif","Use fixed plane":"Guna satah tetap","Use saved fixed plane":"Guna satah tetap disimpan","Use selected face as fixed plane":"Guna muka dipilih sebagai satah tetap","Use the SolidWorks mouse mode":"Guna mod tetikus SolidWorks","User Parameters":"Parameter Pengguna","VIEW":"PANDANGAN","VIEWS":"PANDANGAN","Value":"Nilai","Variable Radius":"Jejari Berubah","Velocity":"Halaju","Vertices":"Bucu","View navigator":"Kawalan pandangan","Volume":"Isi padu","Wall":"Dinding","Wall Location":"Lokasi Dinding","Wall Thickness":"Ketebalan Dinding","Web thickness":"Ketebalan pengukuh","What did you do just before the problem? A short list is enough":"Apakah yang anda lakukan sebelum masalah itu berlaku? Senarai ringkas sudah memadai","What did you expect to see?":"Apakah yang anda jangka akan lihat?","What happened?":"Apakah yang berlaku?","When":"Apabila","Width":"Lebar","Will fail":"Akan gagal","With gestures on, the right button no longer orbits the view: hold it and move to open the ring, then touch a tool's zone. A plain right-click still opens the menu.":"Apabila gerak isyarat dihidupkan, butang kanan tidak lagi mengorbit paparan: tahan dan gerakkan untuk membuka cincin, kemudian sentuh zon sesuatu alat. Klik kanan biasa masih membuka menu.","X":"X","X Angle":"Sudut X","X angle":"Sudut X","X distance":"Jarak X","Y":"Y","Y Angle":"Sudut Y","Y angle":"Sudut Y","Y distance":"Jarak Y","Z":"Z","Z Angle":"Sudut Z","Z Distance":"Jarak Z","Z angle":"Sudut Z","Z distance":"Jarak Z","Zebra":"Zebra","`joint` must be an id or a name":"`joint` mestilah id atau nama","`params` must be an object":"`params` mestilah objek","`values` must be a list":"`values` mestilah senarai","a chamfer needs a corner of exactly two lines":"serong memerlukan sudut yang terdiri daripada tepat dua garis","a file operation is in progress":"operasi fail sedang berjalan","a picked curve is no longer in a sketch":"lengkung yang dipilih tidak lagi berada dalam lakaran","a picked curve's sketch has not been solved":"lakaran bagi lengkung yang dipilih belum diselesaikan","a picked edge has no points":"tepi yang dipilih tidak mempunyai titik","a picked edge is gone":"tepi yang dipilih sudah tiada","a picked edge's body is gone":"jasad bagi tepi yang dipilih sudah tiada","add a key for a joint first":"tambah bingkai utama untuk sendi dahulu","ai.connected_toast":"SolidCraft kini tersedia dalam {clients}. Mulakan semula untuk menggunakannya (Tetapan > Pembantu).","ai.prefs.allow_control":"Benarkan ejen AI menyambung (saluran kawalan / MCP)","ai.prefs.allow_control_note":"Membuka saluran kawalan pada komputer ini sahaja (127.0.0.1, port 27878 atau port bebas yang seterusnya). Program yang menyambung juga mesti menunjukkan token rahsia yang hanya boleh dibaca oleh akaun pengguna anda, dijana baharu pada setiap permulaan. Berkuat kuasa apabila SolidCraft dimulakan seterusnya. Dimatikan: tiada apa-apa yang mendengar melainkan anda memulakan SolidCraft dengan --control.","ai.prefs.availability":"Kawalan pembantu","ai.prefs.background_commands":"Jalankan arahan ejen di latar belakang","ai.prefs.connect_apps":"Jadikan SolidCraft tersedia kepada apl AI pada komputer ini","ai.prefs.connect_apps_note":"Apabila SolidCraft bermula, ia menambah dirinya sebagai pelayan MCP kepada apl AI yang ditemui pada komputer ini (OpenCode, Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Gemini CLI, Copilot CLI, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code), supaya ejen boleh menggunakannya tanpa sebarang persediaan. Hanya entri solidcraft yang ditambah atau laluannya disegarkan; entri yang telah anda ubah dibiarkan, dan fail disandarkan dahulu. Dimatikan: entri yang ditambahnya dibuang. Bantuan > Sambung pembantu AI… melakukannya secara manual.","ai.prefs.connect_at_start":"Sambung ejen yang terakhir digunakan apabila SolidCraft bermula","ai.prefs.connect_at_start_note":"Memulakan ejen yang anda sambungkan kali terakhir (atau yang lalai) di latar belakang setiap kali SolidCraft bermula, supaya sedia untuk bersembang. Tidak apabila SolidCraft dimulakan dengan --control. Jika tidak dapat disambung, Pembantu memaparkan Sambungan gagal dan butang Cuba lagi.","ai.prefs.follow_camera":"Pusingkan kamera ke lakaran","ai.prefs.follow_camera_off":"Pengikutan kamera automatik dimatikan.","ai.prefs.follow_camera_on":"Kamera berpusing menghadap lakaran yang dicipta oleh ejen.","ai.prefs.intro":"Ejen, kebenaran dan cara kerja mereka dipaparkan.","ai.prefs.make_default":"Guna secara lalai","ai.prefs.no_agents":"Belum ada ejen. Tambah ejen atau muat semula untuk mencari ejen yang dipasang.","ai.prefs.no_saved_approvals":"Tiada kelulusan tersimpan.","ai.prefs.open_at_start":"Buka panel Pembantu apabila SolidCraft bermula","ai.prefs.open_at_start_note":"Memaparkan panel Pembantu (atau tetingkapnya sendiri) setiap kali SolidCraft bermula. Tidak apabila SolidCraft dimulakan dengan --control.","ai.prefs.override_all_warning":"Ejen ini boleh menyimpan, menulis ganti, mengeksport atau menggantikan reka bentuk tanpa bertanya.","ai.prefs.permission_all":"Benarkan semua","ai.prefs.permission_all_summary":"Alat SolidCraft yang tersedia berjalan tanpa bertanya.","ai.prefs.permission_ask":"Tanya sebelum perubahan","ai.prefs.permission_ask_summary":"Luluskan setiap perubahan reka bentuk dan tindakan fail.","ai.prefs.permission_edits":"Benarkan suntingan model","ai.prefs.permission_edits_summary":"Suntingan model dijalankan; tindakan fail dan tindakan yang memusnahkan masih meminta kebenaran.","ai.prefs.permission_scope":"Untuk alat SolidCraft sahaja. Shell dan suntingan fail ejen menggunakan kebenarannya sendiri.","ai.prefs.pointer_preview_hidden":"Penuding disembunyikan","ai.prefs.pointer_preview_speed":"Penuding ejen · {speed}","ai.prefs.pointer_speed":"Kelajuan gerakan","ai.prefs.privacy_note":"Hanya ejen atau titik akhir pilihan anda yang menerima perbualan. Kunci titik akhir disimpan dalam rantai kunci sistem anda.","ai.prefs.show_pointer":"Papar penuding ejen","ai.prefs.turn_limit_hint":"Bilangan maksimum panggilan alat pengubah reka bentuk yang boleh dibuat 