rovjera pita GitHub za najnovije izdanje i ne šalje ništa drugo; ažurirajte SolidCraft u {manager}.","update.prefs_note":"Ovo je SolidCraft {version} ({kind}). Provjera pita GitHub za najnovije izdanje i ne šalje ništa drugo.","update.prefs_web":"Ponovo učitajte stranicu da dobijete najnoviju web aplikaciju. Ako mreža nije dostupna ili se ažuriranje ne može preuzeti na vrijeme, otvara se sačuvana verzija; preuzimanje u toku nastavlja se za sljedeće ponovno učitavanje.","update.refresh_checking":"Provjera najnovijeg izdanja…","update.refresh_fallback":"Provjera novijeg izdanja nije uspjela; ažurira se na verziju {version}, pronađenu ranije.","update.refresh_selected":"Ažuriranje na {version}.","update.release_page":"Otvori stranicu izdanja","update.restart":"Ponovo pokreni sada","update.restart_later":"Kasnije","update.show":"Prikaži ažuriranje na {version}","update.skip":"Preskoči ovu verziju","update.system_hint":"Ova kopija je {kind}. Ažurirajte je pomoću:","update.title":"Dostupno je ažuriranje","update.up_to_date":"SolidCraft je ažuran.","update.update_now":"Ažuriraj sada","update.you_have":"Imate verziju {version}.","use a positive nominal diameter and a pitch smaller than it":"koristite pozitivan nazivni prečnik i korak manji od njega","values must be finite numbers":"vrijednosti moraju biti konačni brojevi","values must be numbers or expressions":"vrijednosti moraju biti brojevi ili izrazi","view.auto_ortho_faces":"Perspektiva tokom orbitiranja, ortografski na licima","view.render_inspector":"Inspektor renderovanja","web.files.insert_drawings_hint":"CAD datoteke, mreže, DXF ili SVG u otvoreni dizajn","web.files.insert_stored_drawings_hint":"U otvoreni dizajn (CAD datoteke, mreže, DXF, SVG)","web.open_full":"Otvori u SolidCraftu","web.open_link":"Otvoriti povezani dizajn?","web.open_link_confirm":"Postoje nesačuvane promjene. Otvoriti povezani dizajn u novoj kartici?","↑ ↓ choose · Enter / Tab complete · Esc dismiss":"↑ ↓ izaberi · Enter / Tab dovrši · Esc odbaci","↑ ↓ choose · Enter applies what you typed · Esc dismiss":"↑ ↓ izaberi · Enter primjenjuje ono što ste upisali · Esc odbaci","⌘Enter continues on GitHub.":"⌘Enter nastavlja na GitHubu."}zh中文{"(active rule)":"（当前规则）","0 turns it off":"0 表示关闭","1. Open GitHub draft below, then paste the report copied to your clipboard.":"1. 点击下方按钮打开 GitHub 草稿，然后粘贴已复制到剪贴板的报告。","1. Open GitHub draft below. Your title and report will be filled in.":"1. 点击下方按钮打开 GitHub 草稿。标题和报告将自动填入。","2. Attach your screenshot: copy and paste it, or save and upload the PNG.":"2. 附上截图：复制并粘贴，或保存为 PNG 后上传。","2D":"2D","3. Click Submit new issue on GitHub to send your report.":"3. 在 GitHub 上点击 Submit new issue 发送报告。","A Single hole snaps to the middle of its face and to the centres of its round edges":"单个孔捕捉到其所在面的中心和圆形边的中心","A new configuration, a copy of the active one":"新建配置，为当前配置的副本","A placed Single hole has a handle to drag it, and picking its face again moves the hole there instead of taking it out":"已放置的单个孔带有可拖动的控点，再次选择该面会将孔移到该处而不是删除它","A short title for the problem (optional)":"问题的简短标题（可选）","ARRANGE":"排列","About SolidCraft":"关于 SolidCraft","Acceleration":"加速度","Access":"可达性","Actions":"操作","Active":"活动","Active rule":"活动规则","Add":"添加","Add Column":"添加列","Add Key":"添加按键","Add Mid Radius":"添加中间半径","Add Row":"添加行","Add a tool":"添加工具","Add all bodies":"添加所有实体","Add bend":"添加折弯","Add condition":"添加条件","Add or edit rule":"添加或编辑规则","Add to New Folder":"添加到新文件夹","Add visible bodies":"添加可见实体","Advanced":"高级","Against":"对照","Alignment":"对齐","All Lines":"所有直线","All Sketch Points":"所有草图点","All components":"所有零部件","All open designs":"所有打开的设计","Allowed expressions, separated by semicolons":"允许的表达式，以分号分隔","Also deletes":"同时删除","Also place them from the origin (fully constrained)":"同时从原点定位（完全约束）","Anchor":"基准点","Angle 2":"角度 2","Angle Display":"角度显示","Animate":"动画","Another bend on the far edge of the last flange":"在最后一个法兰的远端边上再加一道折弯","App/system information and command settings are included. Review private details before sharing.":"报告包含应用和系统信息以及命令设置。共享前请检查私人信息。","Appearance name":"外观名称","Applied Radius":"应用半径","Apply To":"应用于","Apply library appearance":"应用库外观","Apply to selection":"应用到选择","Apply your appearance first. Exports assigned appearances and materials created in this design.":"请先应用外观。导出已指定的外观和在此设计中创建的材质。","Arc length":"弧长","Area":"面积","As Picked":"按选取","As-Built":"现有位置","Assign Rule":"分配规则","Attachment":"附着","BLEND SURFACE":"混合曲面","BOUNDARY SURFACE":"边界曲面","BROWSER":"浏览器","Back to the original order":"恢复原始顺序","Ball":"球","Bar":"扁钢","Base Center":"底面中心","Base Height":"底座高度","Bend":"折弯角度","Bend Edges":"折弯边","Bend Line":"折弯线","Bend Line Position":"弯折线位置","Bend Position":"折弯位置","Bend Radius":"折弯半径","Bend Table":"折弯表","Bends":"折弯","Bodies":"实体","Bodies (optional)":"实体（可选）","Body":"实体","Body (last if none)":"实体（未指定时为最后一个）","Body to split":"要分割的实体","Body, or faces to take out":"实体，或要移除的面","Both":"两侧","Bottom Left":"左下","Bottom Middle":"下中","Bottom Right":"右下","Boundary":"边界","Bounding box":"边界框","CHECK":"检查","COMPONENTS":"组件","CONFIGURATIONS":"配置","CONSTRAIN":"约束","CONTACT":"接触","CONVERT":"转换","CSV or JSON: updates existing parameters, adds new ones":"CSV 或 JSON：更新现有参数、添加新参数","Capture All Positions":"捕获所有位置","Capture Pos.":"捕获位置","Catch Depth":"卡扣深度","Catch Direction":"卡扣方向","Catch Length":"卡扣长度","Cells":"区域","Center X":"中心 X","Center Y":"中心 Y","Center of mass":"质心","Centre to centre":"中心距","Centroid":"形心","Chamfer Type":"倒角类型","Channel":"槽钢","Check collisions":"检查碰撞","Checked":"已检查","Choose Variable radius or Spline in Type.":"请在“类型”中选择 Variable radius 或样条曲线。","Choose a new plane. Sketch geometry and dimensions stay unchanged in its two-dimensional coordinates.":"选择一个新平面。草图几何和尺寸在其二维坐标中保持不变。","Choose…":"选择…","Circle center":"圆心","Circle or sphere":"圆或球","Circular":"圆周","Circumference":"周长","Clockwise":"顺时针","Close draft":"关闭草稿","Collapse":"折叠","Collisions":"碰撞","Colour":"颜色","Command":"命令","Comment":"注释","Component 1":"组件 1","Component 2":"组件 2","Component1":"组件1","Components":"组件","Config Table":"配置表","Configuration":"配置","Configuration rules":"配置规则","Constant radius":"等半径","Contact":"接触","Contact Sets":"接触集","Contact sets":"接触集","Continue on GitHub":"在GitHub中继续","Continuity":"连续性","Control Radius":"控制半径","Copies the definition only. Assign it from Physical Material when ready.":"仅复制定义。准备好后可在物理材质中指定。","Copy Error Message":"复制错误消息","Copy Warning Message":"复制警告消息","Copy all licences":"复制所有许可证","Copy diagnostic information":"复制诊断信息","Copy report":"复制报告","Copy screenshot":"复制截图","Corner Relief":"拐角释放","Corner Relief Shape":"拐角释放形状","Corner radius":"圆角半径","Counterbore depth":"沉孔深度","Counterbore Ø":"柱形沉孔 Ø","Countersink angle":"沉头角度","Countersink Ø":"锥形沉孔 Ø","Create Hole":"创建孔","Create Issue — review draft":"创建 Issue——审阅草稿","Create Issue…":"创建 Issue…","Cross curves":"交叉曲线","Ctrl+Enter continues on GitHub.":"按Ctrl+Enter在GitHub中继续。","Cube":"立方体","Current orthographic view (1:1 mm)":"当前正交视图（1:1毫米）","Current perspective view":"当前透视视图","Current plane":"当前平面","Curv. Comb":"曲率梳","Curvature (G2)":"曲率 (G2)","Curvature change (G3)":"曲率变化 (G3)","Custom":"自定义","Customize Toolbar":"自定义工具栏","Customize…":"自定义…","Cylindrical":"圆柱","Cylindrical face":"圆柱面","Deboss":"凹印","Delete":"删除","Delete Folders and Features…":"删除文件夹及其特征…","Delete Selected Features…":"删除所选特征…","Delete Selected Folders":"删除所选文件夹","Delete all":"全部删除","Delete rule":"删除规则","Delete the row":"删除此行","Delete the set":"删除此集合","Density":"密度","Dependents":"依赖项","Describe the problem you saw":"请描述您遇到的问题","Describe what happened before continuing.":"继续之前，请描述发生了什么。","Designs you open or save appear here.":"你打开或保存的设计会显示在此处。","Determined by To Object. Choose Angle to edit the angular extent.":"由“到对象”确定。选择“角度”可编辑角度范围。","Diameter":"直径","Did this assembly open the wrong way up?":"此装配是否以错误的方向打开？","Did this part open the wrong way up?":"此零件是否以错误的方向打开？","Dimension new shapes":"为新图形标注尺寸","Direction":"方向","Discard":"放弃","Distance":"距离","Distance 1":"距离 1","Do not export hidden edges":"不导出隐藏线","Don't ask again":"不再询问","Double-click to rename":"双击重命名","Double-clicking the middle button in the view: Home (the home view, framing what is shown), Fit (frame what is shown, keeping the orientation) or nothing":"在视图中双击中键：主视图（主视图，框住所显示的内容）、适合窗口（框住所显示的内容，保持方向）或无动作","Drag to move the boss across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"拖动以在模型上移动凸台。它会吸附到面上的草图点。","Drag to move the hole; click to remove it":"拖动以移动孔，单击以删除","Drag to move the rest across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"拖动以在模型上移动垫块。它会吸附到面上的草图点。","Drag to move the snap fit across the model. It snaps to sketch points on the face.":"拖动以在模型上移动卡扣。它会吸附到面上的草图点。","Drag to point the catch in another direction.":"拖动以将卡钩指向另一个方向。","Drag to turn the rest in 5° steps. Hold Alt or Ctrl to turn it freely.":"拖动以 5° 为步长旋转垫块。按住 Alt 或 Ctrl 可自由旋转。","Drive Joint":"驱动接头","Duration":"时长","Each new shape is also dimensioned from the sketch origin until nothing of it is left free. A shape already attached to the origin or to placed geometry gets none.":"每个新图形也会从草图原点标注尺寸，直到没有任何自由度。已连接到原点或已放置几何的图形不会再加。","Each shape you draw gets all its dimensions, at the sizes you drew (typed values win). A size the sketch already sets is left out.":"您绘制的每个图形都会按绘制的大小获得所有尺寸（输入的值优先）。草图已确定的尺寸会被跳过。","Edge":"边","Edges":"边","Edit":"编辑","Edit Profile Sketch":"编辑轮廓草图","Edit shortcuts":"编辑快捷键","Enable rule":"启用规则","Enabled":"已启用","End Radius":"结束半径","End bulge":"终止鼓度","End continuity":"终止连续性","Equal Distance":"等距离","Expand":"展开","Expected result (optional)":"预期结果（可选）","Explode":"爆炸","Explode Text":"分解文字","Export Animation…":"导出动画…","Export Bend Table…":"导出折弯表…","Export CSV…":"导出 CSV…","Export Current View as DXF":"将当前视图导出为DXF","Export Current View as DXF…":"将当前视图导出为DXF…","Export DXF":"导出DXF","Export DXF…":"导出DXF…","Export JSON…":"导出 JSON…","Export design library...":"导出设计库...","Export hidden edges as dashed lines":"以虚线导出隐藏线","Exported by SolidWorks, which usually saves Y up":"由 SolidWorks 导出，通常以 Y 轴向上保存","Expression":"表达式","Extend to meet":"延伸至相交","Extents":"范围","FILES":"文件","FLAT":"展开","Face":"面","Face Appearance":"面外观","Face attachment lost":"面附着丢失","Face center":"面中心","Faces":"面","Faces / edges / vertices":"面 / 边 / 顶点","Faces to split":"要分割的面","Faces/Body":"面/实体","Factor must be a positive number":"系数必须是正数","Fastener":"紧固件","Favorites":"收藏","Favourite":"收藏","Feature":"特征","Files from many CAD programs have Y up, so they open lying on their back here (Z up).":"许多 CAD 程序的文件以 Y 为上轴，因此在此处打开时会平躺（Z 朝上）。","Filter":"筛选","Filter…":"筛选…","Find in Browser":"在浏览器中查找","Finish":"完成","First edge":"第一条边","First plane":"第一个平面","First point":"第一点","Fit and G2 corners require Constant radius.":"拟合和 G2 拐角需要 Constant radius。","Fixed Face":"固定面","Flange Gap":"法兰间隙","Flange thickness":"翼缘厚度","Flanges":"法兰","Flat Pattern":"展开图","Flat size":"平板尺寸","Flat size X":"平板尺寸 X","Flat size Y":"平板尺寸 Y","Follow camera (Look At sketches)":"跟随相机（注视草图）","Follow the camera (Look At sketches)":"跟随相机（注视草图）","Font":"字体","Free Move":"自由移动","From":"起点","From Bodies":"从实体创建","From Snap":"起始捕捉","From edges":"起始边","Full Length":"全长","Full thread depth":"完整螺纹深度","Further Bends":"更多折弯","G2 corners require a constant radius and Exact fit. G2 corner construction is not supported yet.":"G2 拐角需要恒定半径和 Exact fit。尚不支持构建 G2 拐角。","Gap":"间隙","Grid":"网格","HISTORY":"历史","Halo under sketch curves":"在草图曲线下方显示光晕","Height":"高度","Height From":"高度基准","Hem Gap":"卷边间隙","Hidden edges":"隐藏线","History layout":"历史布局","History names":"历史名称","Hole (optional)":"孔（可选）","Hole Depth":"孔深","Hole Diameter":"孔径","Holes":"孔","Holes (edges on them)":"孔（孔上的边）","Home view":"主视图","Horiz./Vert.":"水平 / 垂直","I-Beam":"工字钢","IMAGES":"图像","If you are offline or GitHub does not open, use Copy report and keep the text to submit later.":"如果处于离线状态或 GitHub 无法打开，请使用“复制报告”并保留文本以便稍后提交。","Import material into design":"将材质导入设计","Import…":"导入…","In This Design":"在此设计中","In place (surfaces)":"原位（曲面）","In plane":"在平面内","Included":"夹角","Inner Sharp":"内侧虚拟尖点","Inside":"内侧","Instant":"即时","Interface font":"界面字体","Interferes":"发生干涉","Invert":"反转","Isocurve":"等参线","Issue title":"Issue 标题","Items":"项目","JOINTS":"关节","Joint 1":"接头 1","Joint 2":"接头 2","Joint Origin1":"接头原点1","K Factor":"K 因子","Keep (points on it)":"保留（其上的点）","Keep Tools":"保留工具","Keep of the other surface":"另一曲面保留的部分","Key a joint's value at this step":"在此步骤为接头值设置关键帧","Keys":"关键帧","Knife Edge":"刀口","L-Angle":"角钢","LIBRARY":"库","LINKS":"链接","Later":"稍后","Leave it":"保持原样","Left Middle":"左中","Legacy face attachment. Rebinding to a certified face creates an exact attachment.":"旧版面附着。重新绑定到经验证的面可创建精确附着。","Length":"长度","Length units":"长度单位","Letter Spacing":"字间距","Library":"零件库","Library file":"库文件","Library response is missing":"缺少零件库的响应","Limits":"限制","Line Spacing":"行间距","Line Type":"线型","Line on plane":"直线在平面上","Lines":"直线","Listing the installed fonts…":"正在列出已安装字体…","Load library":"加载库","Local library":"本地库","Loop":"循环","M5 or M5x0.5":"M5 或 M5x0.5","M5, M5x0.5, 1/4-20 UNC":"M5, M5x0.5, 1/4-20 UNC","MANAGE":"管理","MATERIALS":"材料","MODEL":"模型","MOTION":"运动","Margin":"余量","Mass":"质量","Mass Center":"质心","Matched restrictions check the final values.":"满足条件的限制规则检查最终值。","Material":"材质","Material Outside":"材料在外","Material copied. Existing body assignments are unchanged.":"材质已复制。现有实体指定保持不变。","Max":"最大","Max Thickness":"最大厚度","Maximum":"最大","Mesh body":"网格实体","Mid Radius":"中间半径","Middle double-click":"中键双击","Min":"最小","Min Draft":"最小拔模","Min Thickness":"最小厚度","Minimum":"最小","Mirror Plane":"镜像平面","Mitre":"斜接","Model Parameters":"模型参数","Modeled":"已建模","More toolbar panels":"更多工具栏面板","Motion":"运动","Mouse gestures":"鼠标手势","Mouse gestures only work with the SolidWorks mouse mode (the wheel orbits, Ctrl + wheel pans).":"鼠标手势仅在 SolidWorks 鼠标模式下有效（滚轮旋转，Ctrl + 滚轮平移）。","Move / Copy":"移动 / 复制","Move Type":"移动类型","Move down":"下移","Move earlier":"向前移动","Move holes by clicking or dragging":"通过单击或拖动移动孔","Move later":"向后移动","Move up":"上移","Name":"名称","Name on import":"导入名称","Nearest":"最近","Neutral plane":"中性面","New":"新建","New Comp.":"新建组件","New Sketch":"新建草图","New rule…":"新建规则…","New study":"新建研究","No crash reports.":"没有崩溃报告。","No matching appearance presets.":"没有匹配的外观预设。","No matching appearances":"没有匹配的外观","No matching physical materials.":"没有匹配的物理材质。","No visible bodies or sketches to export.":"没有可导出的可见实体或草图。","Nominal Radius":"公称半径","Nominal diameter":"公称直径","None":"无","Not available yet":"暂不可用","Not saved yet":"尚未保存","Notch":"缺口","OUTPUT":"输出","Of":"的值","On your computer":"在此计算机上","Opacity":"不透明度","Open GitHub":"打开 GitHub","Open GitHub draft":"打开 GitHub 草稿","Open GitHub issue form":"打开 GitHub 问题表单","Open bodies (no volume)":"未闭合实体（无体积）","Open library...":"打开库...","Open local libraries in the desktop app. You can export this design's library here.":"请在桌面应用中打开本地库。您可以在此导出当前设计的库。","Open surface — no volume":"未闭合曲面 — 无体积","Open-source parametric 3D CAD in Rust. Licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0.":"使用 Rust 编写的开源参数化 3D CAD。基于 MIT OR Apache-2.0 许可。","Opens your browser and copies the report text for you to paste into GitHub.":"打开浏览器，并复制报告文本以便粘贴到GitHub。","Opens your browser and copies the report text. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"打开浏览器并复制报告文本。请在 GitHub 上检查并提交报告。","Opens your browser. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"打开浏览器。请在GitHub中检查并提交报告。","Operator":"运算符","Orbit (right drag)":"旋转（右键拖动）","Other side":"另一侧","Other surface (mutual trim)":"另一曲面（相互修剪）","Other way":"反方向","Outer Sharp":"外侧虚拟尖点","Outer radius":"外圆角半径","Outside":"外侧","Overall length":"总长","Param. Graph":"参数图","Parameter":"参数","Part length must be greater than zero and at most 2000 mm":"零件长度必须大于零且不超过 2000 mm","Parts":"零件","Pass through":"通过点","Path":"路径","Pattern":"阵列","Per Edge":"每条边","Physical material definitions":"物理材质定义","Pick a part size":"请选择零件尺寸","Pick the tool bodies":"选择工具实体","Picked":"所选","Picked point":"选取的点","Pin-slot":"销槽","Pitch":"螺距","Pivot":"枢轴","Place at the origin instead":"改为放置在原点","Planar":"平面","Plastic Rules":"塑料规则","Play the joint's motion in the view":"在视图中播放接头运动","Playback":"播放","Plot":"图表","Point on line":"点在直线上","Point on plane":"点在平面上","Position":"位置","Position (0 to 1)":"位置（0 到 1）","Position (G0)":"位置 (G0)","Position along the edge, 0 at the start end, 1 at the other":"沿边的位置，起点端为 0，另一端为 1","Preferences › Design turns the offer back on":"可在 首选项 › 设计 中重新开启此提示","Preview":"预览","Preview Row":"预览行","Preview leaves the current design unchanged.":"预览不会更改当前设计。","Profile / Edges":"轮廓 / 边","Profiles or curves":"轮廓或曲线","Profiles/Curves":"轮廓/曲线","Quantity":"数量","Quantity must be at least 2":"数量至少为 2","RECENT":"最近使用","REFERENCE":"参考","RULED SURFACE":"直纹曲面","RULES":"规则","Radius":"半径","Radius Fit":"半径拟合","Ratio":"比率","Read-only list: shortcuts can't be changed here.":"只读列表：此处无法更改快捷键。","Reattach selected face":"重新附着所选面","Recover":"恢复","Recover unsaved design?":"恢复未保存的设计？","Rectangular":"矩形","Rectangular Tube":"矩形管","Reference face":"参考面","Relief Depth":"止裂槽深度","Relief Width":"止裂槽宽度","Remove Tools":"移除工具","Remove condition":"删除条件","Remove from Folder":"从文件夹中移除","Remove from list":"从列表移除","Remove override":"移除覆盖","Remove private design details or paths before sharing.":"共享前请移除私密设计细节或路径。","Remove screenshot":"移除截图","Remove the column":"移除此列","Remove the track":"移除轨迹","Remove this bend":"移除此折弯","Remove this point":"移除此点","Rename Feature":"重命名特征","Rename Folder":"重命名文件夹","Render Stage":"渲染阶段","Reopen designs":"重新打开设计","Reopen the designs that were open when SolidCraft was last closed":"重新打开上次关闭 SolidCraft 时打开的设计","Replace existing library file":"替换现有库文件","Report a bug — review a screenshot and open a GitHub draft":"报告缺陷 — 复核截图并开启 GitHub 草稿","Report copied. Keep this text to submit on GitHub when you are online.":"报告已复制。请保留此文本，联网后在 GitHub 上提交。","Report text copied. Paste it into GitHub and submit your report there.":"报告文本已复制。请在GitHub中粘贴并提交。","Reports are public. A GitHub account is required.":"报告将公开发布。您需要GitHub账户。","Reset Toolbar":"重置工具栏","Resize Part":"调整零件大小","Restore View":"恢复视图","Restore outer boundary":"恢复外边界","Restore the inherited component or physical material appearance":"还原继承的组件或物理材质外观","Restore this studio's tools":"恢复此工作室的工具","Result":"结果","Retake screenshot":"重新截图","Reveal Height":"台阶高度","Reverse":"反向","Reverse Direction":"反向","Revert":"还原","Revert All Positions":"还原所有位置","Revert Pos.":"还原位置","Revert Position":"恢复位置","Review the report and screenshot before opening GitHub.":"打开 GitHub 前请审阅报告和截图。","Review your report on GitHub and click Submit new issue to publish it.":"请在GitHub中检查报告，然后点击Submit new issue发布。","Revolute":"旋转","Rib Length":"筋板长度","Rib Offset":"筋板偏移","Rib Thickness":"筋板厚度","Ribs":"筋板","Right Middle":"右中","Rigid":"刚性","Rim Edge":"轮缘边","Rim face":"边缘面","Ring of tools on the right button":"右键工具环","Roll Back Here":"回滚到此处","Roll History Marker Here":"将历史标记滚动到此处","Root radius":"根部圆角半径","Round":"圆角","Round Bar":"圆钢","Round Tube":"圆管","Rule":"规则","Rule name":"规则名称","Rules run from top to bottom. Matched drives change effective values.":"规则从上到下依次运行。满足条件的驱动规则更改有效值。","SECTION":"剖面","SURFACE QUALITY":"曲面质量","Same way":"同方向","Save Rule":"保存规则","Save View":"保存视图","Save screenshot…":"保存屏幕截图…","Save the study as an animated GIF, seen as the viewport shows it":"按视口中的显示将研究保存为动画 GIF","Saved preview. Geometry is being checked before editing.":"已保存预览。编辑前正在检查几何。","Scale factor":"比例因子","Scene":"场景","Screenshot (optional)":"屏幕截图（可选）","Search":"搜索","Search commands":"搜索命令","Search this library":"搜索此库","Second edge":"第二条边","Second plane":"第二个平面","Second point":"第二点","Section":"剖面","Section (optional)":"截面（可选）","Section position":"截面位置","Sections (one sketch each)":"截面（每个一个草图）","Select Other":"选择其他","Select Other: hold the left button still on the model (or right-click › Select Other…) to list everything under the cursor; click again on the same spot to select the next thing there. Double-click the middle button to go Home (Preferences › Navigation).":"“选择其他”：在模型上按住左键（或右键单击 › 选择其他…）列出光标下的所有对象；在同一位置再次单击可选择该处的下一个对象。双击中键转到主视图（首选项 › 导航）。","Select Same Look":"选择相同外观","Select bodies (a face picks its body)":"选择实体（单击面即选择其所属实体）","Select bodies or faces instead":"改为选择实体或面","Select edges":"选择边","Select points of the sketch being edited":"请选择正在编辑的草图中的点","Select the centre the pattern turns around first":"请先选择阵列旋转所绕的中心","Select the curves to offset first":"请先选择要偏移的曲线","Select the mirror line":"请选择镜像线","Select the sketch curves or points to mirror first":"请先选择要镜像的草图曲线或点","Select the sketch curves or points to move first":"请先选择要移动的草图曲线或点","Select the sketch curves or points to pattern first":"请先选择要阵列的草图曲线或点","Select the sketch curves or points to scale first":"请先选择要缩放的草图曲线或点","Select the sketch curves or points to transform first":"请先选择要变换的草图曲线或点","Selection filter":"选择筛选","Semantic faces share their appearance across instances.":"语义面在各实例间共享外观。","Send your report on GitHub":"在 GitHub 上发送报告","Shaded":"着色","Shape":"形状","Sheet Rules":"钣金规则","Show Agent Cursor":"显示代理光标","Show ghost":"显示虚影","Show in folder":"在文件夹中显示","Show the pointer an AI agent moves (#35)":"显示 AI 代理移动的指针（#35）","Show tool at cursor":"在光标旁显示工具","Signed axes":"带符号轴","Size":"大小","Sketch constraints":"草图约束","Sketch curves":"草图曲线","Sketch dimensions":"草图尺寸","Sketch geometry and profiles":"草图几何和轮廓","Sketch plane has no body-face attachment.":"草图平面没有实体面附着。","Sketch points":"草图点","Slider":"滑块","Slot width":"槽宽","Snap to face and edge centres":"捕捉到面和边的中心","SolidCraft cannot submit reports directly. Submit on GitHub; no token is needed in the app.":"SolidCraft 无法直接提交报告。请在 GitHub 上提交；应用中不需要令牌。","SolidCraft closed before these designs were saved. Their last autosave can be opened.":"SolidCraft 在这些设计保存前已关闭。可以打开它们的上次自动保存。","Sort A to Z":"升序排序","Sort Z to A":"降序排序","Spacing 2 must be a non-zero number":"间距 2 必须是非零数字","Spacing must be a non-zero number":"间距必须是非零数字","Specialise":"专用操作","Speed":"速度","Splitting tool":"分割工具","Square":"正方形","Stand it up":"将其立起","Stand it up: a quarter turn about X, as one Move feature you can undo.":"将其立起：绕 X 轴旋转四分之一周，作为一个可撤销的移动特征。","Stand this assembly up?":"立起此装配？","Stand this part up?":"立起此零件？","Start angle":"起始角度","Start bulge":"起始鼓度","Start continuity":"起始连续性","Stationary Side":"固定侧","Step":"步骤","Steps":"步数","Steps to reproduce (optional)":"重现步骤（可选）","Stitch the kept pieces":"缝合保留的部分","Stitch to both bodies":"缝合到两个实体","Studio":"工作室","Study":"研究","Style":"样式","Summary":"摘要","Suppress":"抑制","Suppress Selected Folders":"抑制所选文件夹","Suppressed":"已抑制","Surface":"曲面","Surface, or faces to turn over":"曲面，或要翻转的面","Surfaces":"曲面","Swap Ends":"交换端点","TRIM":"修剪","Tangent":"相切","Tangent (G1)":"相切 (G1)","Tangent Chain":"相切链","Tangent chain":"相切链","Tangent to Edge":"与边相切","Tap drill diameter":"攻丝底孔直径","Target":"目标","Target Body":"目标实体","Target Face (optional)":"目标面（可选）","Tear":"撕裂","Technical details":"技术详情","The dashed sketch is a saved plane guide. Select a new face to repair the attachment.":"虚线草图是已保存的平面引导。选择一个新面以修复附着。","The design changed. Reopen Change Part Size for the component.":"设计已更改。请为该组件重新打开“更改零件尺寸”。","The direction must be an axis or a straight sketch curve that lies in the sketch plane":"方向必须是轴，或位于草图平面内的直线草图曲线","The mirror line cannot also be mirrored":"镜像线本身不能再被镜像","The mirror line must be a straight curve of this sketch, not an origin axis":"镜像线必须是此草图中的直线曲线，不能是原点轴","The saved author occurrence is missing. Select a valid author placement before rebinding.":"保存的作者实例缺失。重新绑定前请选择有效的作者放置。","Then":"操作","These features will be deleted:":"以下特征将被删除：","These features will fail:":"以下特征将失败：","Thickness Outside":"外侧厚度","Thickness Variation":"厚度变化","Thin":"薄壁","Thin Extrude":"薄壁拉伸","Third plane":"第三个平面","Third point":"第三点","This child is shared. Deleting it removes it from every copy of its parent.":"此子项是共享的。删除它会从其父项的每个副本中移除。","This child is shared. Position changes apply to every copy of its parent.":"此子项是共享的。位置更改会应用到其父项的每个副本。","This component is inside a subassembly placed more than once: aligning it moves it in every placement.":"此组件位于多次放置的子装配体中：对齐它会使其在每个放置位置中都移动。","This face cannot provide a durable attachment. Choose another face or explicitly use a fixed plane.":"此面无法提供持久附着。请选择其他面或显式使用固定平面。","This image is not attached to GitHub yet. Copy or save it, then attach it on GitHub.":"此图片尚未附加到GitHub。请复制或保存图片，然后在GitHub中附加。","Thread depth":"螺纹深度","Thread diameter":"螺纹直径","Through point":"通过点","To":"终点","To Offset":"偏移","To Snap":"目标捕捉","To edges":"终止边","Toe radius":"肢端圆角半径","Tolerance":"公差","Too close":"过近","Tool Bodies":"工具实体","Tools":"工具","Tools, clockwise from the top":"工具，从顶部顺时针排列","Top Left":"左上","Top Middle":"上中","Top Right":"右上","Trimming tool (plane, face or curves)":"修剪工具（平面、面或曲线）","Turn off section analysis before exporting the view.":"请关闭截面分析后再导出视图。","Type":"类型","Type a distance or an angle to move by":"请输入要移动的距离或角度","UNTRIM":"取消修剪","Unit":"单位","Unsuppress":"取消抑制","Unsuppress Selected Folders":"取消抑制所选文件夹","Updating the preview":"正在更新预览","Use active author placement":"使用活动作者放置","Use fixed plane":"使用固定平面","Use saved fixed plane":"使用已保存的固定平面","Use selected face as fixed plane":"使用所选面作为固定平面","Use the SolidWorks mouse mode":"使用 SolidWorks 鼠标模式","User Parameters":"用户参数","VIEW":"视图","VIEWS":"视图","Value":"值","Variable Radius":"可变半径","Velocity":"速度","Vertices":"顶点","View navigator":"视图导航器","Volume":"体积","Wall":"壁厚","Wall Location":"壁位置","Wall Thickness":"壁厚度","Web thickness":"腹板厚度","What did you do just before the problem? A short list is enough":"问题发生前您进行了哪些操作？简要列出即可","What did you expect to see?":"您期望看到什么结果？","What happened?":"发生了什么？","When":"条件","Width":"宽度","Will fail":"将失败","With gestures on, the right button no longer orbits the view: hold it and move to open the ring, then touch a tool's zone. A plain right-click still opens the menu.":"开启鼠标手势后，右键不再旋转视图：按住右键并移动以打开工具环，然后触碰某个工具的区域。普通右键单击仍会打开菜单。","X":"X","X Angle":"X 角度","X angle":"X 角度","X distance":"X 距离","Y":"Y","Y Angle":"Y 角度","Y angle":"Y 角度","Y distance":"Y 距离","Z":"Z","Z Angle":"Z 角度","Z Distance":"Z 距离","Z angle":"Z 角度","Z distance":"Z 距离","Zebra":"斑马纹","`joint` must be an id or a name":"“joint”必须是编号或名称","`params` must be an object":"“params”必须是对象","`values` must be a list":"“values”必须是列表","a chamfer needs a corner of exactly two lines":"倒角需要恰好由两条直线构成的角","a file operation is in progress":"正在进行文件操作","a picked curve is no longer in a sketch":"所选曲线已不在任何草图中","a picked curve's sketch has not been solved":"所选曲线所在的草图尚未求解","a picked edge has no points":"所选边没有点","a picked edge is gone":"所选边已不存在","a picked edge's body is gone":"所选边所属的实体已不存在","add a key for a joint first":"请先为接头添加关键帧","ai.connected_toast":"SolidCraft 现已可在 {clients} 中使用。请重启它们（设置 > 助手）。","ai.prefs.allow_control":"允许 AI 代理连接（控制通道 / MCP）","ai.prefs.allow_control_note":"仅在本机开放控制通道（127.0.0.1，端口 27878 或下一个空闲端口）。连接的程序还必须出示一个每次启动时新生成、只有你的用户账户能读取的秘密令牌。下次启动 SolidCraft 时生效。关闭：除非用 --control 启动，否则不监听任何端口。","ai.prefs.availability":"助手控制","ai.prefs.background_commands":"在后台执行代理命令","ai.prefs.connect_apps":"让此电脑上的 AI 应用可以使用 SolidCraft","ai.prefs.connect_apps_note":"SolidCraft 启动时，会把自己作为 MCP 服务器添加到此电脑上找到的 AI 应用（OpenCode、Claude Desktop、Claude Code、Cursor、Codex、Gemini CLI、Copilot CLI、Windsurf、Zed、VS Code）。只添加或更新 solidcraft 条目；你修改过的条目不会被改动，文件会先备份。关闭后，会删除它添加的条目。","ai.prefs.connect_at_start":"SolidCraft 启动时连接上次使用的智能体","ai.prefs.connect_at_start_note":"每次启动 SolidCraft 时，在后台启动上次连接的智能体（或默认智能体），以便随时开始聊天。使用 --control 启动 SolidCraft 时不会这样做。如果无法连接，助手会显示“连接失败”和“重试”按钮。","ai.prefs.follow_camera":"将相机转向草图","ai.prefs.follow_camera_off":"相机自动跟随已关闭。","ai.prefs.follow_camera_on":"相机将转向代理创建的草图。","ai.prefs.intro":"设置代理、权限及其工作方式。","ai.prefs.make_default":"设为默认","ai.prefs.no_agents":"尚无代理。添加代理或刷新以查找已安装的代理。","ai.prefs.no_saved_approvals":"没有已保存的批准。","ai.prefs.open_at_start":"SolidCraft 启动时打开助手面板","ai.prefs.open_at_start_note":"每次启动 SolidCraft 时显示助手面板（或其独立窗口）。使用 --control 启动 SolidCraft 时不会这样做。","ai.prefs.override_all_warning":"此代理可在不询问的情况下保存、覆盖、导出或替换设计。","ai.prefs.permission_all":"全部允许","ai.prefs.permission_all_summary":"可用的 SolidCraft 工具无需询问即可运行。","ai.prefs.permission_ask":"更改前询问","ai.prefs.permission_ask_summary":"每次设计更改和文件操作均需批准。","ai.prefs.permission_edits":"允许模型编辑","ai.prefs.permission_edits_summary":"模型编辑自动执行；文件及破坏性操作仍需询问。","ai.prefs.permission_scope":