omplete · Esc dismiss":"↑ ↓ 选择 · Enter / Tab 补全 · Esc 关闭","↑ ↓ choose · Enter applies what you typed · Esc dismiss":"↑ ↓ 选择 · Enter 按原样应用 · Esc 关闭","⌘Enter continues on GitHub.":"按⌘Enter在GitHub中继续。"}enEnglish{"(active rule)":"(active rule)","0 turns it off":"0 turns it off","1. Open GitHub draft below, then paste the report copied to your clipboard.":"1. Open GitHub draft below, then paste the report copied to your clipboard.","1. Open GitHub draft below. Your title and report will be filled in.":"1. Open GitHub draft below. Your title and report will be filled in.","2. Attach your screenshot: copy and paste it, or save and upload the PNG.":"2. Attach your screenshot: copy and paste it, or save and upload the PNG.","2D":"2D","3. Click Submit new issue on GitHub to send your report.":"3. Click Submit new issue on GitHub to send your report.","A Single hole snaps to the middle of its face and to the centres of its round edges":"A Single hole snaps to the middle of its face and to the centers of its round edges","A new configuration, a copy of the active one":"A new configuration, a copy of the active one","A placed Single hole has a handle to drag it, and picking its face again moves the hole there instead of taking it out":"A placed Single hole has a handle to drag it, and picking its face again moves the hole there instead of taking it out","A short title for the problem (optional)":"A short title for the problem (optional)","ARRANGE":"ARRANGE","About SolidCraft":"About SolidCraft","Acceleration":"Acceleration","Access":"Access","Actions":"Actions","Active":"Active","Active rule":"Active rule","Add":"Add","Add Column":"Add Column","Add Key":"Add Key","Add Mid Radius":"Add Mid Radius","Add Row":"Add Row","Add a tool":"Add a tool","Add all bodies":"Add all bodies","Add bend":"Add bend","Add condition":"Add condition","Add or edit rule":"Add or edit rule","Add to New Folder":"Add to New Folder","Add visible bodies":"Add visible bodies","Advanced":"Advanced","Against":"