eters","VIEW":"VIEW","VIEWS":"VIEWS","Value":"Value","Variable Radius":"Variable Radius","Velocity":"Velocity","Vertices":"Vertices","View navigator":"View navigator","Volume":"Volume","Wall":"Wall","Wall Location":"Wall Location","Wall Thickness":"Wall Thickness","Web thickness":"Web thickness","What did you do just before the problem? A short list is enough":"What did you do just before the problem? A short list is enough","What did you expect to see?":"What did you expect to see?","What happened?":"What happened?","When":"When","Width":"Width","Will fail":"Will fail","With gestures on, the right button no longer orbits the view: hold it and move to open the ring, then touch a tool's zone. A plain right-click still opens the menu.":"With gestures on, the right button no longer orbits the view: hold it and move to open the ring, then touch a tool's zone. A plain right-click still opens the menu.","X":"X","X Angle":"X Angle","X angle":"X angle","X distance":"X distance","Y":"Y","Y Angle":"Y Angle","Y angle":"Y angle","Y distance":"Y distance","Z":"Z","Z Angle":"Z Angle","Z Distance":"Z Distance","Z angle":"Z angle","Z distance":"Z distance","Zebra":"Zebra","`joint` must be an id or a name":"`joint` must be an id or a name","`params` must be an object":"`params` must be an object","`values` must be a list":"`values` must be a list","a chamfer needs a corner of exactly two lines":"a chamfer needs a corner of exactly two lines","a file operation is in progress":"a file operation is in progress","a picked curve is no longer in a sketch":"a picked curve is no longer in a sketch","a picked curve's sketch has not been solved":"a picked curve's sketch has not been solved","a picked edge has no points":"a picked edge has no points","a picked edge is gone":"a picked edge is gone","a picked edge's body is gone":"a picked edge's body is gone","add a key for a joint first":"add a key for a joint first","ai.connected_toast":"SolidCraft is now available in {clients}. Restart them to use it (Preferences > Assistant).","ai.prefs.allow_control":"Let AI agents connect (control channel / MCP)","ai.prefs.allow_control_note":"Opens a control channel on this computer only (127.0.0.1, port 27878 or the next free one). A program that connects must also show a secret token that only your user account can read, made fresh at every start. Takes effect the next time SolidCraft starts. Off: nothing listens unless you start SolidCraft with --control.","ai.prefs.availability":"Assistant controls","ai.prefs.background_commands":"Run agent commands in the background","ai.prefs.connect_apps":"Make SolidCraft available to AI apps on this computer","ai.prefs.connect_apps_note":"When SolidCraft starts, adds it as an MCP server to the AI apps found on this computer (OpenCode, Claude Desktop, Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Gemini CLI, Copilot CLI, Windsurf, Zed, VS Code), so an agent can use it without any setup. Only the solidcraft entry is added or its path refreshed; an entry you changed is left alone, and the file is backed up first. Off: the entries it added are removed. Help > Connect AI assistants… does this by hand.","ai.prefs.connect_at_start":"Connect the last-used agent when SolidCraft starts","ai.prefs.connect_at_start_note":"Starts the agent you connected last (or the default one) in the background each time SolidCraft starts, so it is ready for chatting. Not when SolidCraft is started with --control. If it cannot connect, the Assistant shows Connection failed and a Retry button.","ai.prefs.follow_camera":"Turn the camera to sketches","ai.prefs.follow_camera_off":"Automatic camera following is off.","ai.prefs.follow_camera_on":"The camera turns to face sketches the agent creates.","ai.prefs.intro":"Agents, permissions and how their work appears.","ai.prefs.make_default":"Use by default","ai.prefs.no_agents":"No agents yet. Add an agent or refresh to find installed agents.","ai.prefs.no_saved_approvals":"No saved approvals.","ai.prefs.open_at_start":"Open the Assistant panel when SolidCraft starts","ai.prefs.open_at_start_note":"Shows the Assistant panel (or its own window) each time SolidCraft starts. Not when SolidCraft is started with --control.","ai.prefs.override_all_warning":"This agent may save, overwrite, export or replace the design without asking.","ai.prefs.permission_all":"Allow everything","ai.prefs.permission_all_summary":"Available SolidCraft tools run without asking.","ai.prefs.permission_ask":"Ask before changes","ai.prefs.permission_ask_summary":"Approve every design change and file action.","ai.prefs.permission_edits":"Allow model edits","ai.prefs.permission_edits_summary":"Model edits run; file and destructive actions still ask.","ai.prefs.permission_scope":"For SolidCraft tools only. The agent’s shell and file edits use its own permissions.","ai.prefs.pointer_preview_hidden":"Pointer hidden","ai.prefs.pointer_preview_speed":"Agent pointer · {speed}","ai.prefs.pointer_speed":"Motion speed","ai.prefs.privacy_note":"Only your chosen agent or endpoint receives the conversation. Endpoint keys are stored in your system keychain.","ai.prefs.show_pointer":"Show agent pointer","ai.prefs.turn_limit_hint":"Maximum design-changing tool calls the Assistant may make for one message.","angle, height":"angle, height","appearance.dielectric_ior":"Dielectric IOR","appearance.metallic":"Metallic","appearance.only_available":"Available appearances only","appearance.pbr_help":"View this surface in Render or a product PNG. No refraction or transmission.","appearance.pbr_opaque":"Opaque PBR","appearance.roughness":"Roughness","appearance.surface_response":"Surface response","at the face":"at the face","bom.group_children":"Sub-parts in their part's row","browser.body_name":"Body{number}","browser.calibrate_click_a":"Click the image for Point A, or type its coordinates.","browser.calibrate_click_b":"Click the image for Point B, or type its coordinates.","browser.calibrate_title":"Calibrate: {name}","browser.capture_many"