splayed result is a frozen completed image. Editing a background does not repaint that result automatically. Use Regrade for camera-only changes, or Render for a new physical stage.","render.background_hdr_separate":"The current HDR resources illuminate and reflect on surfaces; they are not automatically displayed as a panorama behind the subject. Changing a gradient does not rotate or recolour the lighting.","render.background_lighting_section":"HDR illumination · separate from camera background","render.background_no_alpha_override":"A camera background is not added to transparent output silently. Raw-master regrading uses captured coverage and does not reapply denoising; the source EXR remains unchanged.","render.background_not_light":"Background color is presentation, not an additional lighting source.","render.background_regrade":"Apply to retained raw master","render.background_stage_occlusion":"This shot includes physical stage geometry. A large floor or wall can fill the frame and hide a camera-only background. Clear or resize the stage deliberately, or change its physical reflectance. Regrading cannot remove captured geometry.","render.background_workflow":"Choose the background you intend: a camera-only color/gradient, a physical stage that receives light, or HDR illumination. They are independent. Live Preview is a modeling view; render a new image or regrade a retained master to see camera finishing.","render.base_appearance":"Editable body appearance","render.base_apply":"Apply body appearance","render.base_apply_help":"One undoable visual assignment to the reviewed exact body. Existing face-specific looks and engineering materials remain separate.","render.base_color":"Base color · sRGB","render.base_metallic":"Metallic fraction","render.base_opaque_only":"This editor preserves opaque body semantics. Use the explicit glass controls for optical transmission.","render.bloom_enable":"Display bloom","render.bloom_help":"Creative output-only glow from positive linear highlights, spread with three normalized box passes. Radius is in output pixels. Added in linear display light before sRGB; not a lens, volumetric effect or convergence improvement. The raw EXR is unchanged.","render.bloom_opaque":"Bloom requires opaque output. Transparent PNG is refused, not silently flattened.","render.bloom_radius":"Bloom radius","render.bloom_strength":"Bloom strength","render.bloom_threshold":"Linear highlight threshold","render.browse_capabilities":"Inspect complete capability catalog","render.browse_environments":"Browse original HDR environments","render.browse_looks":"Browse…","render.browse_native_scenes":"Browse native studios","render.browse_physical":"Inspect physical references","render.browse_quality":"Inspect quality specifications","render.browse_rigs":"Browse authored light rigs","render.browse_scene_specs":"Browse advanced scene specifications","render.browse_surfaces":"Browse authored surfaces","render.browser_library":"Library","render.browser_model":"Model","render.camera_distance":"Eye-to-target distance","render.camera_exact_help":"World millimeters; angles are displayed in degrees and saved as radians. Navigation uses the same camera as the viewport.","render.camera_fov":"Vertical field of view","render.camera_pitch":"Camera pitch","render.camera_roll":"Roll","render.camera_set":"Set Render Camera","render.camera_target":"Target position · mm","render.camera_yaw":"Yaw","render.category_metal":"Metal","render.category_paint":"Paint","render.category_plastic":"Plastic","render.category_wood":"Wood","render.check_opaque":"Transparency: opaque surfaces only; background alpha is supported.","render.check_sorted_alpha":"Transparency: sorted alpha approximation.","render.check_transmission":"Transparency: physical transmission.","render.children.absolute_floor":"Absolute floor","render.children.adaptive":"Adaptive","render.children.add_look_reason":"Add a look to edit its enabled state and strength.","render.children.all