oose Progressive to edit its sample count and seed.","render.children.radius":"Radius","render.children.reflect_depth":"Reflect depth","render.children.reflect_samples":"Reflect samples","render.children.regrade":"Regrade","render.children.relative_error":"Relative error","render.children.render":"Render","render.children.render_shot":"Render shot","render.children.renderer":"Renderer","render.children.renderers":"Renderers","render.children.request":"This request","render.children.reset_finishing":"Reset finishing","render.children.review_quality":"Review a quality specification…","render.children.rgb_gain":"RGB gain","render.children.samples":"Samples","render.children.sampling":"Sampling","render.children.saturation":"Saturation","render.children.scene_summary":"{bodies} bodies · {triangles} triangles","render.children.seed":"Seed","render.children.sharpening":"Sharpening","render.children.single_image":"Single image","render.children.soft_focus":"Soft focus","render.children.streak":"Streak","render.children.strength":"Strength","render.children.studio":"Studio","render.children.threshold":"Threshold","render.children.tone":"Tone","render.children.under_hood":"Under the hood","render.children.vignette":"Vignette","render.children.workstation":"Workstation","render.choose_look":"Choose a look in Appearances first","render.chromatic_offset":"Chromatic edge offset","render.clear_stage":"Remove saved stage","render.copy_request":"Copy JSON","render.cpu_aa_help":"Spatial samples: more samples improve edges and increase render time.","render.cpu_area_add":"Add rectangular CPU light","render.cpu_area_editor":"CPU rectangular lights","render.cpu_area_editor_help":"Full side vectors in millimeters; U cross V points toward the emitting side. This differs from GPU half-edge vectors.","render.cpu_area_full_u":"Full U side · mm","render.cpu_area_full_v":"Full V side · mm","render.cpu_area_samples":"Area-light samples","render.cpu_binding_confirm":"Confirm this body","render.cpu_binding_stale":"The scene changed. Confirm this reflection target again before rendering.","render.cpu_body_choose":"Choose a body","render.cpu_body_filter":"Filter bodies by name","render.cpu_body_filter_more":"Refine the filter to see more bodies.","render.cpu_body_missing":"A reflection target is missing, hidden, ambiguous or has a name longer than 128 bytes. Choose it again.","render.cpu_budget":"CPU resource profile","render.cpu_budget_bodies":"Body ceiling","render.cpu_budget_compact":"Compact (legacy limits)","render.cpu_budget_details":"Resource limits","render.cpu_budget_help":"Choose larger limits explicitly. Resolution and samples are never reduced automatically.","render.cpu_budget_memory":"Job memory ceiling","render.cpu_budget_not_guarantee":"These are admission ceilings, not a RAM reservation or a speed guarantee. Geometry, film and retained previews share the memory budget; rendering remains cancellable.","render.cpu_budget_resize":"The draft exceeds this CPU profile or its camera-sample budget. Accept smaller dimensions explicitly or select a larger profile.","render.cpu_budget_studio":"Studio (large images)","render.cpu_budget_triangles":"Triangle ceiling","render.cpu_budget_workstation":"Workstation (heavy scenes)","render.cpu_captured_hdr":"HDR captured for this image","render.cpu_check_capture_help":"Check and Start verify the same file digest or use the embedded HDR. Each image keeps its captured source.","render.cpu_check_changed":"The controls or model changed after this check. Check again before rendering.","render.cpu_constant_help":"Constant radiance is visible to reflected or transmitted rays. It does not provide direct diffuse lighting.","render.cpu_custom_directions":"Replace preset with custom directional lights","render.cpu_direction":"Direction toward light (X, Y, Z)","render.cpu_directional":"Directional light","render.cpu_directional_add":"Add directional light","render.cpu_environment":"CPU environment","render.cpu_environment_background":"The image background stays separate from environment lighting.","render.cpu_environment_bounds":"CPU intensity must be 0–64, HDR rotation finite within ±1,000,000 radians, and HDR samples 1, 4, 16 or 64.","render.cpu_environment_constant":"Constant secondary-ray environment","render.cpu_environment_none":"No CPU environment","render.cpu_environment_samples":"HDR lighting samples","render.cpu_exposure_help":"CPU exposure must be between −16 and 16 EV. A GPU exposure outside that range is retained until you change it.","render.cpu_fixed":"Single image","render.cpu_hdr_help":"Radiance .hdr, 2:1 panorama, up to 2048 × 1024 and 16 MiB. CPU requires explicit sRGB/D65 primaries in the file; unspecified primaries and EXR are refused.","render.cpu_hdr_reflection_help":"HDR rough reflections require fully metallic body and face surfaces. Check reports unsupported combinations.","render.cpu_key_rim":"Key and rim","render.cpu_last_check":"Last CPU check","render.cpu_light_help":"Up to eight directional lights. An empty custom list turns them off; selecting a preset restores its lights. Colors are linear RGB and intensity is relative, not watts.","render.cpu_light_intensity":"Relative intensity (0–64)","render.cpu_light_minimum":"Minimum distance for attenuation","render.cpu_light_position":"World position (X, Y, Z)","render.cpu_light_reference":"Reference distance for intensity","render.cpu_light_remove":"Remove light","render.cpu_lighting":"Lighting preset","render.cpu_lights":"CPU lights","render.cpu_linear_color":"Linear color (R, G, B)","render.cpu_neutral":"Neutral","render.cpu_opaque_required":"CPU ray tracing needs an opaque background. Clear Transparent background to continue.","render.cpu_options_pending":"This CPU panel cannot edit emission, surface effects, glass or anisotropy yet. Clear those API options before using it.","render.cpu_point":"Point light","render.cpu_point_add":"Add point light","render.cpu_point_help":"Up to eight point lights, added to the selected directional lighting. Distances are in mm; the minimum must not exceed the reference distance.","render.cpu_primary_samples":"Edge samples per pixel","render.cpu_progressive":"CPU progressive","render.cpu_progressive_help":"Accumulate the existing CPU integrator in passes of one primary sample. Selected reflections require one sample; area lights, dielectrics and anisotropy require Single image.","render.cpu_progressive_limits":"At most 1,048,576 pixels and 16,777,216 pixel × sample evaluations. Changing samples never resizes the image automatically.","render.cpu_progressive_seed":"CPU sampling seed","render.cpu_progressive_spp":"samples per pixel","render.cpu_reflection_add":"Add rough reflection","render.cpu_reflection_depth":"Reflection depth (1–8)","render.cpu_reflection_empty":"No bodies selected: scene reflections are off.","render.cpu_reflection_help":"Choose bodies and set Off, Mirror or Rough. Rough uses the assigned surface roughness. More samples and bounces increase time; this is bounded specular transport, not global illumination.","render.cpu_reflection_limit":"Up to 64 reflected bodies are supported.","render.cpu_reflection_mirror":"Mirror","render.cpu_reflection_off":"Off","render.cpu_reflection_rough":"Rough","render.cpu_reflection_samples":"Reflection samples (1–64)","render.cpu_reflections":"CPU reflections","render.cpu_runtime_help":"Numeric light and environment settings are saved with the setup. Body reflections and HDR files remain temporary. Existing area-light and spot-cone values are retained.","render.cpu_sampling_mode":"CPU sampling mode","render.cpu_shadows":"Cast shadows","render.cpu_summary":"CPU ray tracing · reflections · HDR · directional and point lights","render.cpu_warm_cool":"Warm and cool","render.diag_bodies":"Visible bodies","render.diag_job_details":"Captured job details","render.diag_last_check":"Last preflight","render.diag_memory":"Logical admission estimate","render.diag_not_implemented":"Explicit capability boundaries","render.diag_preflight_details":"Preflight details","render.diag_request":"Exact current request","render.diag_triangles":"Triangles","render.discard_continue":"Discard draft and continue","render.draft_confirm_help":"The current render draft has unapplied edits. Save them before switching, discard them explicitly, or keep editing.","render.draft_confirm_title":"Preserve edited render settings","render.effects_gpu_only":"These effects require GPU path tracing. Changing the page never switches the renderer automatically.","render.effects_help":"Combine ordered color looks and image-space lens effects. Rendering and raw-master regrading use the same saved settings. Raw EXR stays unchanged. These are original artistic controls, not calibrated lens or branded-film emulations.","render.effects_reset_lens":"Reset lens effects","render.effects_seed":"Pattern seed","render.emitted_axis":"Emitted axis","render.env_advanced":"Advanced","render.env_backdrop":"Backdrop","render.env_backdrop_pending":"Environment visibility and background blur are not supported by the renderer yet.","render.env_blur":"Blur","render.env_change":"Change","render.env_choose_source":"Choose an environment in Studios and Environments before editing the lighting.","render.env_clear":"Clear","render.env_colour":"Color","render.env_environments":"Environments","render.env_ground":"Ground","render.env_ground_pending":"Physical ground receives shadows as a finite diffuse surface. Shadow-only catching and ground reflections are not supported yet.","render.env_intensity":"Intensity","render.env_invalid_edit":"Invalid environment edit.","render.env_physical_ground":"Physical ground","render.env_preview_help":"Illustrative sphere sample; not a preview of the selected environment.","render.env_reflection":"Reflection","render.env_ring_help":"Drag the ring to rotate the lighting. Hold Shift to snap to 15°.","render.env_rotate":"Rotate","render.env_set":"Set Render Environment","render.env_shadow_