e base unchanged.","render.material_color_map":"Base color image (sRGB)","render.material_color_replace":"Base map replaces body color","render.material_custom":"Custom illustrative optics","render.material_enable":"Use these GPU material overrides","render.material_filter":"Filter scene bodies…","render.material_filter_help":"Up to 128 matching bodies are shown. Refine the filter for large scenes.","render.material_glass":"Glass and optical absorption","render.material_glass_enable":"Use physical glass on this body","render.material_glass_exclusive":"Glass cannot share a body with clear coat or runtime maps in this renderer.","render.material_glass_help":"Original illustrative recipes. Swatches show transmittance, not a rendered preview. Absorption is −ln(linear transmittance) / reference distance; alpha is unchanged.","render.material_gpu_required":"These active material overrides require GPU path tracing. Select GPU or disable the overrides before Check or Start.","render.material_ior":"Index of refraction (IOR)","render.material_limits":"At most 128 body overrides, 32 disjoint glass bodies, 64 coats and 128 texture bindings. Identical maps share storage; actual device and total memory limits still apply.","render.material_map_invalid":"Map paths must be bounded local paths; normal strength must be finite and between 0 and 1.","render.material_map_required":"Choose a color image or a normal image before using maps.","render.material_maps":"Planar color and normal maps","render.material_maps_enable":"Enable maps for this opaque body","render.material_maps_help":"PNG/JPEG up to 1024×1024; 16 MiB encoded total. U and V are orthogonal world-mm repeat vectors (maximum 128 repeats). Color is sRGB; normal data uses OpenGL +Y. Files are captured at Check/Start.","render.material_metallic_map":"Metallic map (linear)","render.material_normal_map":"Normal image (OpenGL, +Y)","render.material_normal_strength":"Normal strength (0–1)","render.material_origin":"Mapping origin X