stand this partial reference needs grade, condition and source review","render.physical_associations":"Physical candidates and roles","render.physical_background_help":"Real passive floor and wall, separate from the camera backdrop. Cyclorama uses 24 polygonal strips; it is not an infinite or analytically smooth surface. Replaces the saved stage only with your consent.","render.physical_copy_plan":"Copy plan with sources and omissions","render.physical_cyclorama":"Fit polygonal cyclorama","render.physical_floor_wall":"Fit physical floor and wall","render.physical_material_name":"Proposed reference material name","render.physical_omissions":"Properties not representable in the native card","render.physical_plan_only":"Read-only plan prepared. No material was created or assigned. Keep its extended profile and omissions when reviewing the native card.","render.physical_prepare_plan":"Prepare creation plan (does not apply)","render.physical_separate":"Appearance is not material identification. These are sourced references, not certified effective properties. Existing mass, engineering materials and optics are unchanged.","render.physical_unknown":"No numerical candidate is established. Grade, formulation or construction must be specified; unknown is not zero.","render.pick_body":"Body","render.pick_component":"Component","render.pick_face":"Face","render.pick_help":"Choose Body, Face or Component. Click empty space to clear; Shift or Ctrl adds or toggles. Highlights appear only in the live product view.","render.pick_label":"Pick","render.pick_up_label":"Pick Up","render.pick_up_prompt":"Click an object to pick up its look","render.pick_waiting":"Product picking is not supported yet.","render.post_contrast":"Contrast","render.post_gain_b":"Blue gain","render.post_gain_g":"Green gain","render.post_gain_r":"Red gain","render.post_help":"Creative presentation only. RGB gains precede tone mapping; contrast, saturation and vignette follow in display-linear light. Start Render creates new transport samples. Regrade uses the selected retained raw master without denoising or new rays.","render.post_reset":"Reset presentation filters","render.post_saturation":"Saturation","render.post_title":"Presentation filters","render.post_vignette":"Vignette","render.preview":"Integrated preview","render.preview_help":"Raster shading and blended transparency. Refraction, HDRI and final rendering are not available yet.","render.preview_image_settings_help":"Live Preview keeps fixed studio lighting. Exposure and image lighting apply to the image job when you Check or Start.","render.preview_lighting_help":"The live preview shows direct light only and no shadows.","render.preview_retry":"Retry live preview","render.preview_unavailable_help":"The live preview is unavailable. Saved setups and image-job controls remain accessible. Change the scene or explicitly retry; a refused scene is not rebuilt on every frame.","render.preview_upload":"Live-preview vertex payload","render.preview_upload_help":"Exact preview vertex bytes, not total GPU or process memory. Geometry is not simplified. Image jobs use their own admission and lighting.","render.progressive_image_summary":"Preview PNG · PBR and glass · progressive samples","render.property_conditions":"Conditions: {value}","render.property_fallback":"property","render.property_qualifier":"Qualifier: {value}","render.property_source":"Source: {id} - {locator}","render.property_uncertainty":"Uncertainty: {value}","render.property_unknown":"unknown","render.quality_ack":"Acknowledge the fixed-budget projection and omissions","render.quality_apply":"Use this fixed sampling budget","render.quality_balanced":"Balanced","render.quality_custom":"Custom","render.quality_draft":"Draft","render.quality_high":"High","render.quality_projection_help":"Q presets include future requirements. This action projects only a supported fixed-sample PNG budget and explicitly omits adaptive stopping, raw linear output and independent t