nce plan","render.stage_panels.review_quality":"Use a fixed sampling budget","render.stage_panels.review_rig":"Fit light rig","render.stage_panels.review_saved_maps":"Review saved maps","render.stage_panels.review_stage":"Review ground and stage","render.stage_panels.review_studio":"Review native studio","render.stage_panels.review_uniform":"Review uniform appearance","render.stage_panels.rig_summary":"Authored light rig · {emitters} emitters, {cards} cards","render.stage_panels.rigs":"Rigs","render.stage_panels.save_maps":"Save maps to this shot","render.stage_panels.scope":"Scope","render.stage_panels.search_studios":"Search studios","render.stage_panels.search_surfaces":"Search surfaces and references","render.stage_panels.source_note":"Authored base-color source map. Not a measured material.","render.stage_panels.specifications":"Specifications · read-only","render.stage_panels.studio_ack":"Confirm replacing lighting, environment, exposure and stage","render.stage_panels.studio_note":"Click to review. Applying replaces lighting, environment and stage only after you confirm. Lights stay editable.","render.stage_panels.studios":"Studios","render.stage_panels.subtitle_environment":"Original HDR environment · whole scene","render.stage_panels.subtitle_maps":"Authored spatial maps · temporary preview","render.stage_panels.subtitle_physical":"Read-only plan · no material created or assigned","render.stage_panels.subtitle_quality":"Fixed GPU budget · future requirements omitted","render.stage_panels.subtitle_rig":"Authored light rig · emitters and passive cards","render.stage_panels.subtitle_saved_maps":"Authored maps · saved with this shot","render.stage_panels.subtitle_stage":"Physical ground and stage · fitted to the product","render.stage_panels.subtitle_studio":"Native studio · applies to the whole scene","render.stage_panels.subtitle_uniform":"Uniform approximation · not a measured material","render.stage_panels.surfaces":"Surfaces","render.stage_panels.surfaces_