pective":"Depth of field requires a perspective camera.","render.studio_lighting":"Studio lighting","render.studio_lighting_enable":"Use custom studio lighting","render.studio_needs_review":"Review method and settings","render.studio_radiance":"Linear RGB radiance","render.studio_ready":"Ready to check","render.studio_remove_area":"Remove area light","render.studio_rotation":"Environment rotation","render.studio_runtime_help":"Numeric studio settings and checked HDR sources can be saved with the setup. Body optical/material overrides remain temporary and do not change saved appearances.","render.studio_saved":"Saved setup / current camera","render.studio_sky":"Artistic sky","render.studio_sky_help":"Original sky gradient for lighting; not a calibrated atmospheric model.","render.studio_sun":"Sun","render.studio_sun_radius":"Angular radius","render.studio_tiles_require_gpu":"Studios require GPU path tracing. Select GPU in the Output editor.","render.studio_title":"Render studio","render.studio_tone_map":"Tone mapping","render.studios_environments":"Studios and Environments","render.subsurface_enable":"Interior scattering random walk","render.subsurface_help":"Closed dielectric only. Scattering and RGB absorption are separate per-mm coefficients. Paths scatter inside actual geometry, then refract or reflect at the boundary. Disable straight shadow transmission, surface denoising and exterior volume; use one Fresnel stratum. Not a diffusion shader, density grid or measured material. Dense media may need more samples and path depth.","render.subsurface_rate":"Scattering collision rate","render.tone_aces_fitted":"ACES fitted","render.tone_reinhard":"Reinhard","render.transmission_scope":"GPU glass supports certified disjoint media. Unrestricted nested media and a noise-free transmission estimator are not provided.","render.transmission_strata":"Conditional Fresnel strata","render.transmission_strata_help":"1 preserves the original stream. 2 or 4 subpaths stratify the first glass reflection/transmission choice with unchanged Snell and absorption laws. More paths cost more work; this is not denoising, nested-media support or a promise of faster rendering.","render.tree_add_light":"Add light","render.tree_add_shot":"Add shot","render.tree_browser":"Render Browser","render.tree_by_look":"By look","render.tree_by_object":"By object","render.tree_constant":"Constant environment","render.tree_default":"Default","render.tree_directional":"Directional","render.tree_environment":"Environment","render.tree_environment_values":"{rotation}° · {intensity}×","render.tree_face_count":"{count} faces","render.tree_face_one":"{count} face","render.tree_fixed_studio":"Fixed studio","render.tree_hdr":"HDR","render.tree_lights":"Lights","render.tree_lights_pending":"Named light commands are not available yet.","render.tree_mixed":"Mixed","render.tree_more":"{count} more","render.tree_mute":"Mute light","render.tree_no_environment":"No environment","render.tree_objects":"Objects","render.tree_output":"Output","render.tree_point":"Point","render.tree_rectangle":"Rectangle","render.tree_search":"Search objects","render.tree_selection":"Render selection","render.tree_shots":"Shots","render.tree_sky":"Sky","render.tree_solo":"Solo light","render.tree_spot":"Spot","render.tree_sun":"Sun","render.tree_switch":"Switch","render.tree_user_one":"{count} object","render.tree_users":"{count} objects","render.unavailable_preview":"This setup requests an unavailable preview profile.","render.unsaved":"Unsaved preview changes","render.use_preview":"Use Integrated Preview","render.volume_albedo":"Scattering albedo · linear RGB","render.volume_anisotropy":"Phase mean cosine","render.volume_enable":"Enable participating medium","render.volume_extinction":"Extinction coefficient","render.volume_help":"GPU transport inside one finite box, with Beer attenuation and HG scattering on camera and indirect paths. Uses explicit studio/HDR/sky lighting, including shadow attenuation. Positive phase cosine scatters forward. Glass boundaries and surface denoising must be disabled explicitly. Zero extinction leaves transport unchanged. Not a physical lunar atmosphere, density grid, volume emission, spectral transport or certified material property.","render.volume_max":"Maximum bounds · world mm","render.volume_min":"Minimum bounds · world mm","render.volume_title":"Bounded homogeneous volume","render.wait_add_light":"not supported yet: named light creation","render.wait_batch":"not supported yet: the saved-shot render queue","render.wait_compare":"not supported yet: retained image comparison","render.wait_paint":"not supported yet: product picking and appearance painting","render.wait_pick_up":"not supported yet: product picking and appearance sampling","render.wait_replace":"not supported yet: replacing all uses of an appearance","render.wait_solo":"not supported yet: light visibility and solo controls","render.wear_applies_to":"Applies to","render.wear_layer_count":"{count} layers","render.wear_layer_one":"{count} layer","render.wear_layers":"Layers","render.wear_no_layers":"No layers","render.wear_selected_layer":"Selected layer","render.wear_title":"Wear","sample.bracket.about":"Base flange with edge flanges and a hem on a 2 mm rule","sample.bracket.name":"Sheet Metal Bracket","sample.enclosure.about":"Shelled box with a lip, screw bosses, a rest and a snap fit","sample.enclosure.name":"Plastic Enclosure","sample.flange.about":"Hub and flange with a circular pattern driven by a parameter","sample.flange.name":"Bolted Flange","sample.hinge.about":"Two components and a revolute joint, driven to 60°","sample.hinge.name":"Hinge Assembly","sample.plate.about":"Parametric plate with fillets, holes and a bored boss","sample.plate.name":"Sample Plate","sample.vents.about":"Slots in a rectangular pattern: rows, columns and pitch are parameters","sample.vents.name":"Vent Plate","search.command_keys":"Enter run     Shift+Enter run and keep open     Esc