elect the corners to round first","select the fixed face first (a plate's large face)":"select the fixed face first (a plate's large face)","select the frame sketch's lines first":"select the frame sketch's lines first","select the path (sketch lines across the edge)":"select the path (sketch lines across the edge)","select the rim face first":"select the rim face first","select the sheet edge first":"select the sheet edge first","select two components":"select two components","set by the sketch's lines":"set by the sketch's lines","settings.display_quality_note":"Only the display. Designs and exports are not affected.","settings.double_click_components":"Double-click a component to activate it, or to edit a linked one in place","settings.frame_rate_details_note":"Adds a graph of the last frames' times with the triangles drawn over it, a histogram of frame times and what the GPU drew. Click the frame rate in the view to show or hide them.","settings.frame_rate_note":"Shows frames per second in the view's bottom-right corner.","settings.insert_lists_open_designs":"Insert Design lists the designs open in other tabs first","settings.measure_axis_distances":"Show X/Y/Z distances","settings.measure_axis_distances_help":"Show world-axis component dimensions alongside the total distance while Measure is open.","settings.msaa_applies_on_restart":"Anti-aliasing applies the next time SolidCraft starts","settings.msaa_reset":"{setting}: {requested}× isn't supported by this graphics device; it is now {reset}× (supported: {supported}).","settings.msaa_unsupported":"Not supported by this graphics device","settings.reference_geometry_through_bodies":"Show reference geometry through bodies","settings.reference_geometry_through_bodies_help":"Draw inactive sketch contours and datum planes over shaded bodies","settings.reset_intro":"These settings don't work on this computer and would keep SolidCraft from starting, so they were changed:","settings.reset_title":"Settings were changed","settings.supersampling_note":"Draws the view at a higher resolution and filters it down: smoother edges, lines and grid on screens below 4K. It costs GPU time: about 2.25× the pixels at 1.5× and 4× at 2×.","settings.update_changed_links":"Update changed linked designs when a tab comes back","settings.window_system_details":"Details","settings.window_system_note_now":"Applies after a restart. Now: {now}.","settings.window_system_wayland_limited":"Some features are limited on native Wayland.","sheet.flange_type_base":"Base","sheet.flange_type_contour":"Contour","sheet.flange_type_edge":"Edge","sheet.no_body":"there is no sheet metal body: start one with Flange > Base, or turn a plate into sheet metal with Convert to Sheet Metal (pick its large flat face)","sheet.personal_rules.confirm_delete":"Confirm delete","sheet.personal_rules.delete":"Delete","sheet.personal_rules.delete_prompt":"Delete this personal rule? Rules already in designs are unchanged.","sheet.personal_rules.full":"The personal library already contains 64 rules.","sheet.personal_rules.invalid_name":"Enter a short name without line breaks or control characters.","sheet.personal_rules.invalid_values":"Complete the rule's values: each must work out in this design, with a positive thickness and a K factor from 0 to 1.","sheet.personal_rules.missing":"The selected personal rule is no longer available.","sheet.personal_rules.name":"Rule name","sheet.personal_rules.name_exists":"A personal rule with this name already exists. Use a different name.","sheet.personal_rules.name_hint":"A unique name","sheet.personal_rules.overwrite":"Save changes to selected personal rule","sheet.personal_rules.rename":"Rename","sheet.personal_rules.rule":"Personal rule","sheet.personal_rules.save":"Save new","sheet.personal_rules.scope":"Saved in your profile for all designs.","sheet.personal_rules.select":"Select a rule","sheet.personal_rules.title":"Personal rules","sheet.personal_rules.unsupported":"This rule has values that t