his 3D mouse is connected.","ui.3d_mouse_calibration_no_response":"One axis barely moved, so it can't be calibrated. Start over and move the cap further each time.","ui.3d_mouse_circles_help":"The circles show what the device sends, after calibration. The test model shows what the view does with it, after invert, speed and the axis assignment.","ui.3d_mouse_dead_zone":"Dead zone","ui.3d_mouse_dead_zone_tip":"How far the cap has to move before the view does, as a share of its full travel. Raise it if the view drifts while the cap is at rest.","ui.3d_mouse_denied":"SolidCraft can see a 3D mouse but isn't allowed to read it. See the 3D mouse setup notes for the udev rule.","ui.3d_mouse_denied_short":"Found, but not readable","ui.3d_mouse_driven_by":"Which calibrated motion of the device drives this axis. Picking a motion another axis already uses swaps the two.","ui.3d_mouse_driven_by_label":"driven by","ui.3d_mouse_driver":"Driver","ui.3d_mouse_driver_auto":"Automatic","ui.3d_mouse_driver_direct":"Direct (hidraw)","ui.3d_mouse_driver_fallback":"Reading through spacenavd for now: the device itself could not be opened.","ui.3d_mouse_driver_only_direct":"Reading the device directly; spacenavd is not running","ui.3d_mouse_driver_only_spacenavd":"Reading through spacenavd, the only way available","ui.3d_mouse_forget":"Forget calibration","ui.3d_mouse_ghost_left_viewport":"Left viewport","ui.3d_mouse_ghost_left_window":"Left window","ui.3d_mouse_ghost_position":"Position","ui.3d_mouse_ghost_right_viewport":"Right viewport","ui.3d_mouse_hint":"Move and rotate the view together; sketches use pan and zoom only.","ui.3d_mouse_kind_cap":"Return to Center","ui.3d_mouse_kind_question":"What kind of 3D mouse is it?","ui.3d_mouse_kind_trackball":"Trackball","ui.3d_mouse_looks_like_cap":"The reading stays put while you hold it, the way a Return to Center device does.","ui.3d_mouse_looks_like_trackball":"The reading keeps dropping back as soon as you stop moving, the way a trackball's does.","ui.3d_mouse_motion_rotation_x":"Rotation X","ui.3d_mouse_motion_rotation_y":"Rotation Y","ui.3d_mouse_motion_rotation_z":"Rotation Z","ui.3d_mouse_motion_translation_x":"Translation X","ui.3d_mouse_motion_translation_y":"Translation Y","ui.3d_mouse_motion_translation_z":"Translation Z","ui.3d_mouse_navigate":"Navigate with the 3D mouse","ui.3d_mouse_none":"No 3D mouse found","ui.3d_mouse_not_calibrated":"Not calibrated","ui.3d_mouse_offer":"Calibrating your 3D mouse fixes swapped or reversed axes and sets its speed and feel.","ui.3d_mouse_offer_never":"Never show again","ui.3d_mouse_offer_swap":"Swap to Hidraw (Direct Driver)","ui.3d_mouse_orbit":"Orbit","ui.3d_mouse_orbit_classic":"Classic","ui.3d_mouse_orbit_tip":"Traced: the 3D mouse turns the view around the part of the model in the middle of the view when the turn begins, marked by a faint ball. Classic: around the view's center","ui.3d_mouse_orbit_traced":"Traced","ui.3d_mouse_reading":"Reading","ui.3d_mouse_reset_axes":"Reset axis assignment","ui.3d_mouse_reset_view":"Reset view","ui.3d_mouse_restore":"Restore defaults","ui.3d_mouse_restore_ask":"Set the 3D mouse settings back to their defaults? Your calibration and button mapping stay.","ui.3d_mouse_section":"3D mouse","ui.3d_mouse_show_in_view":"Show the 3D mouse in the 3D view","ui.3d_mouse_show_in_view_tip":"A picture of your 3D mouse in the lower left corner, moving as you move it.","ui.3d_mouse_sketch_orbit":"Turn sketches with the 3D mouse","ui.3d_mouse_sketch_orbit_tip":"The 3D mouse also turns the view while a sketch is open and seen square on, as the mouse can. Off: it pans and zooms the sketch until you tilt the view.","ui.3d_mouse_skip":"My device can't do this","ui.3d_mouse_skip_tip":"Skips this motion both ways, and the calibration leaves it out.","ui.3d_mouse_speed":"3D mouse speed","ui.3d_mouse_step_lift":"Lift the cap up, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_press":"Press the cap down, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_pull":"Pull the cap toward you, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_push":"Push the cap away from you, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_rest":"Take your hand off the cap and leave it still.","ui.3d_mouse_step_rest_trackball":"Take your hand off the ball and leave it still.","ui.3d_mouse_step_ring_clockwise":"Turn the scroll ring clockwise a few clicks.","ui.3d_mouse_step_ring_counterclockwise":"Turn the scroll ring anticlockwise a few clicks.","ui.3d_mouse_step_roll_away":"Roll the ball away from you a few times, then let it stop.","ui.3d_mouse_step_roll_left":"Roll the ball left a few times, then let it stop.","ui.3d_mouse_step_roll_right":"Roll the ball right a few times, then let it stop.","ui.3d_mouse_step_roll_toward":"Roll the ball toward you a few times, then let it stop.","ui.3d_mouse_step_slide_left":"Slide the cap left, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_slide_right":"Slide the cap right, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_spin_clockwise":"Spin the ball clockwise a few times, then let it stop.","ui.3d_mouse_step_spin_counterclockwise":"Spin the ball anticlockwise a few times, then let it stop.","ui.3d_mouse_step_tilt_away":"Tilt the top of the cap away from you (the edge nearest you goes up), hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_tilt_left":"Tilt the cap left (left edge down), hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_tilt_right":"Tilt the cap right (right edge down), hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_tilt_toward":"Tilt the top of the cap toward you (the edge nearest you goes down), hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_touch":"Rest your hand on the cap without pushing it.","ui.3d_mouse_step_twist_clockwise":"Twist the cap clockwise, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_step_twist_counterclockwise":"Twist the cap anticlockwise, hold it, then let go.","ui.3d_mouse_switch_cap":"Calibrate as Return to Center","ui.3d_mouse_switch_trackball":"Calibrate as a trackball","ui.3d_mouse_use_direct":"Use Direct Driver","ui.3d_mouse_use