rs you give in the chat are listed here.","ui.ai_auto_allowed":"Auto-allowed: {title} ({why})","ui.ai_auto_mode":"your permission setting","ui.ai_auto_ours":"SolidCraft checks its own tools itself","ui.ai_auto_remembered":"you chose Always allow","ui.ai_bad_url":"Enter a URL that starts with http:// or https://","ui.ai_base_url":"Base URL","ui.ai_button":"AI","ui.ai_command_hint":"my-agent --acp","ui.ai_copy_suffix":"copy","ui.ai_custom_url":"Custom URL","ui.ai_default":"Default","ui.ai_edit":"Edit","ui.ai_edit_agent_title":"Edit agent","ui.ai_edit_gone":"This agent was removed, so there is nothing to save.","ui.ai_edit_tip":"Change this agent's name, command or endpoint. A saved key stays hidden.","ui.ai_http_busy":"the endpoint is busy or over its limit; try again later","ui.ai_http_key":"the endpoint refused the key: check it in Preferences > AI","ui.ai_http_not_found":"no such endpoint or model: check the base URL and the model name","ui.ai_http_too_large":"the conversation is too large for this endpoint; start a new chat","ui.ai_key":"API key","ui.ai_key_hint":"optional; kept in the system keychain","ui.ai_key_keep_hint":"leave empty to keep the saved key","ui.ai_key_needs_https":"A key is only sent over HTTPS, or to this computer.","ui.ai_key_note":"Stored in the system keychain, never in SolidCraft's settings. Leave it empty for a local server.","ui.ai_keychain_error":"The system keychain refused: {error}","ui.ai_kind":"Kind","ui.ai_mode_all":"Allow everything","ui.ai_mode_all_note":"Nothing asks first. Crash reports stay off limits and the folder limits still apply.","ui.ai_mode_all_warning":"The agent can save, overwrite, export and replace your design without asking. Use this only with an agent you trust, on designs you have saved.","ui.ai_mode_ask":"Ask every time","ui.ai_mode_ask_note":"Every change to the design, and every file action, waits for your Allow.","ui.ai_mode_edits":"Auto-allow model edits","ui.ai_mode_edits_note":"Modeling commands run witho