th":"Längd","Length units":"Längdenheter","Letter Spacing":"Teckenavstånd","Library":"Bibliotek","Library file":"Biblioteksfil","Library response is missing":"Bibliotekssvar saknas","Limits":"Gränser","Line Spacing":"Radavstånd","Line Type":"Linjetyp","Line on plane":"Linje i plan","Lines":"Linjer","Listing the installed fonts…":"Listar installerade teckensnitt…","Load library":"Läs in bibliotek","Local library":"Lokalt bibliotek","Loop":"Slinga","M5 or M5x0.5":"M5 eller M5x0.5","M5, M5x0.5, 1/4-20 UNC":"M5, M5x0.5, 1/4-20 UNC","MANAGE":"HANTERA","MATERIALS":"MATERIAL","MODEL":"MODELL","MOTION":"RÖRELSE","Margin":"Marginal","Mass":"Massa","Mass Center":"Masscentrum","Matched restrictions check the final values.":"Matchade begränsningar kontrollerar slutvärdena.","Material":"Material","Material Outside":"Material utanför","Material copied. Existing body assignments are unchanged.":"Materialet har kopierats. Befintliga kroppstilldelningar är oförändrade.","Max":"Max","Max Thickness":"Största tjocklek","Maximum":"Maximum","Mesh body":"Meshkropp","Mid Radius":"Mittradie","Middle double-click":"Dubbelklick med mitten","Min":"Min","Min Draft":"Minsta släppvinkel","Min Thickness":"Minsta tjocklek","Minimum":"Minimum","Mirror Plane":"Spegelplan","Mitre":"Geringsskärning","Model Parameters":"Modellparametrar","Modeled":"Modellerad","More toolbar panels":"Fler verktygsfältspaneler","Motion":"Rörelse","Mouse gestures":"Musgester","Mouse gestures only work with the SolidWorks mouse mode (the wheel orbits, Ctrl + wheel pans).":"Musgester fungerar bara med musläget SolidWorks (hjulet orbiterar, Ctrl + hjulet panorerar).","Move / Copy":"Flytta / Kopiera","Move Type":"Förflyttningstyp","Move down":"Flytta ned","Move earlier":"Flytta tidigare","Move holes by clicking or dragging":"Flytta hål genom att klicka eller dra","Move later":"Flytta senare","Move up":"Flytta upp","Name":"Namn","Name on import":"Namn vid import","Nearest":"Närmaste","Neutral plane":"Neutralplan","New":"Ny","New Comp.":"Ny komp.","New Sketch":"Ny skiss","New rule…":"Ny regel…","New study":"Ny studie","No crash reports.":"Inga kraschrapporter.","No matching appearance presets.":"Inga matchande utseendeförinställningar.","No matching appearances":"Inga matchande utseenden","No matching physical materials.":"Inga matchande fysiska material.","No visible bodies or sketches to export.":"Inga synliga kroppar eller skisser att exportera.","Nominal Radius":"Nominell radie","Nominal diameter":"Nominell diameter","None":"Ingen","Not available yet":"Inte tillgänglig ännu","Not saved yet":"Inte sparad än","Notch":"Urtag","OUTPUT":"UTDATA","Of":"Från","On your computer":"På din dator","Opacity":"Opacitet","Open GitHub":"Öppna GitHub","Open GitHub draft":"Öppna GitHub-utkast","Open GitHub issue form":"Öppna ärendeformuläret på GitHub","Open bodies (no volume)":"Öppna kroppar (ingen volym)","Open library...":"Öppna bibliotek...","Open local libraries in the desktop app. You can export this design's library here.":"Öppna lokala bibliotek i skrivbordsappen. Du kan exportera denna konstruktions bibliotek här.","Open surface — no volume":"Öppen yta — ingen volym","Open-source parametric 3D CAD in Rust. Licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0.":"Parametrisk 3D-CAD med öppen källkod i Rust. Licensierad under MIT OR Apache-2.0.","Opens your browser and copies the report text for you to paste into GitHub.":"Öppnar webbläsaren och kopierar rapporttexten så att du kan klistra in den på GitHub.","Opens your browser and copies the report text. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"Öppnar webbläsaren och kopierar rapporttexten. Granska och skicka in rapporten på GitHub.","Opens your browser. Review and submit your report on GitHub.":"Öppnar webbläsaren. Granska och skicka din rapport på GitHub.","Operator":"Operator","Orbit (right drag)":"Orbitera (högerdrag)","Other side":"Andra sidan","Other surface (mutual trim)":"Andra ytan (ömsesidig trimning)","Other way":"Andra hållet","Outer Sharp":"Yttre skarp","Ou